[8027]={"Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book 6 of the Epic quest series of Volume III.","Level Up: Volume III: Book 6","'Volume III, Book 6, eh? This is the one with that crazy dream in it! Are you sure you want to skip it?\
\
'I guess you know what you're doing. If you want to complete Volume III Book 6 of the Epic quest, you'll be all set once you complete this quest.'","'You know what? Complete this quest and you'll have Volume III Book 6 of the Epic quest completed.'"},
[8028]={"Level Up: Volume III: Book 7","'You wish to complete Volume III, Book 7? By completing this quest, you will be bypassing the intro story to Rohan and the breaking of the Fellowship. Is this is what you want?\
\
'Speak to me again and I'll see to it that you have completed Volume III Book 7 of the Epic quest.'","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book 7 of the Epic quest series of Volume III.","'Are you prepared? You will now be granted completion of Volume III Book 7 of the Epic quest.'"},
[8029]={"'Shall we continue? Finishing this quest will grant you completion of Volume III Book 8 of the Epic quest.'","'So you wish to complete Volume III, Book 8? The story of pursuing the Fellowship across the plains of Rohan will be finished if you proceed.'\
\
'The choice is yours. If you wish to complete Volume III Book 8 of the Epic quest, speak to me once more.'","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book 8 of the Epic quest series of Volume III.","Level Up: Volume III: Book 8"},
[8030]={"'Are you ready to proceed? Finishing this quest will award completion of Volume III Book 9 of the Epic quest.'","Level Up: Volume III: Book 9","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book 9 of the Epic quest series of Volume III.","'Are you ready to complete Volume III, Book 9? You will bypass aiding Éomer in battles against the Orcs and a fleeting visit to Meduseld.'\
\
'It is your decision. If you would like to skip Volume III Book 9 of the Epic quest, speak to me once more.'"},
[8039]={"Lhudblath, el huargo plateado","Has derrotado a Lhudblath, el huargo plateado","Derrota a Lhudblath, el huargo plateado","'Los huargos ya son criaturas retorcidas, pero Lhudblath era peor que cualquiera de los que me han contado. El Bosque Salvaje sigue siendo peligroso, pero hoy has realizado una gran hazaña y has hecho que estos bosques sean un poco más seguros.'","Lhudblath, el huargo plateado, se encuentra en la parte oriental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que derrotes al huargo plateado, Lhudblath.","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet Encinarroja.","Los huargos merodean por el Bosque Salvaje, pero ninguno es tan feroz ni tan letal como Lhudblath, el huargo plateado.","Habla con Linnet","'Las historias sobre Lhudblath, el huargo plateado, cuentan que la criatura parece surgir de la niebla, atacando a los incautos y dejando una estela de destrucción a su paso. Harías un gran bien a aquellos menos capaces que tú si derrotaras a este monstruo.'"},
[8040]={"Gifemund has come forward and is demanding that Guard-captain Thurferth step down due to his inability to protect Woodhurst. They now seek to settle their differences before the empty seat of the Thane.","'Thurferth has left, and it appears the war around us fractured the people of Woodhurst more than I thought. How someone so close to leadership could share allegiances with the White Hand is concerning.\
\
'His removal is important for us to rally the people under a common banner, and making this city a safer place to live. Gifemund and I will be working together toward that goal. \
\
'Word has arrived from Brockbridge, and they are desperate for aid.'","Speak with Herubrand","Talk to Calin","'I have just received word from Calin that there is a gathering in the Mead Hall. This is likely the confrontation we have been expecting. From what Calin told me, most of the town has gone to the Mead Hall! \
\
'I need you to go with Calin and show your support for Gifemund.'","Speak with Herubrand in the basement of the farm-house in Woodhurst.","'I assume that Herubrand told you what I have discovered? We should hurry so as to make certain that we are not too late to stop whatever is happening at the Mead Hall!'","Liberating Woodhurst","You should speak with Calin when you are ready to go to the Mead Hall."},
[8042]={"Lugartenientes de la corrupción","Las arañas y los orcos ahora infectados parecen seguir a un nuevo amo una vez que adoptan sus formas mutadas. El caos puede dar miedo, pero cuando uno ve orden donde esperaba encontrar caos, puede resultar aún más aterrador.","Knakk está acampado en la pasarela elevada en la esquina noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Has descubierto qué controla a las arañas infectadas y lo has derrotado.","Encuentra al líder entre los orcos infectados","Regresa con Knakk","Has descubierto qué controla a los orcos infectados y lo has derrotado.","'Los artífices de esta corrupción no tardaron mucho en convertir a suficientes criaturas como para formar un pequeño ejército. El hongo parece ser de naturaleza simbiótica. De alguna manera, permitió que los líderes que mataste las controlaran. Este hongo infeccioso es extremadamente peligroso.\
\
'¡Espero que sea la última vez que veamos salir esos horrores de las Fundaciones de Piedra!'","'Las arañas y los orcos corrompidos por el hongo parásito parecen cambiar de comportamiento una vez transformados. Cabría esperar que actuaran de forma caótica y atacaran a todo lo que les rodea, incluso que se volvieran unos contra otros en su confusión. Sin embargo, una vez infestados, parecen simplemente cambiar de bando, como si de inmediato comenzaran a seguir nuevas órdenes. ¿Hay algo que los controla cuando se transforman?\
\
'Por favor, explora la zona afectada y ve si puedes encontrar un líder entre las arañas y los orcos recién infectados.'","Encuentra al líder entre las arañas infectadas","El líder de los orcos infectados debería encontrarse entre sus sirvientes al sureste del campamento de Knakk, al igual que la reina, que acecha entre su prole al este."},
[8043]={"'I have identified the lieutenants of these Bloodless Uruks in Kaslokroz. I hear them issuing orders to the others, and hear their names on the wind: Draulush, Mangath, and Narnagír. You know what must be done, ${PLAYER}.'","Defeated Draulush the Bloody","Defeated Narnagír the White-arrow","Legolas has identified the leaders of the Bloodless in Kaslokroz.\
\
You should defeat Draulush, Mangath, and Narnagír.","Lieutenants of the Herald","Defeated Mangath the Impervious","Defeat Draulush the Bloody","Defeat Narnagír the White-arrow","Defeat Mangath the Impervious","Legolas has identified the leaders of the Bloodless Uruks in Kaslokroz and would like your help eliminating them."},
[8045]={"Bring ninglyr to Gaerfalas atop Amon Angened","Gaerfalas is at the way-post atop Amon Angened, east of Fállug.\
\
You should bring the flowers you collected to Gaerfalas.","'The beautiful ninglor is also a marvelous curative. Please bring me some from the ruins of Fállug.'","Collected ninglyr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ninglyr may be found around the ruins of Fállug, west of Amon Angened.\
\
Gaerfalas has asked you to gather ninglor flowers for use in preparing medicines.","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}! Do you wish to be of assistance? Good! This waypost is the beginning of the supply line to our main force fighting its way to Dol Guldur. There are some supplies that we are short of, however. One of those is medicine.\
\
'Fortunately, I think this shortage may be resolved quickly. It is said that life oft springs up where death has passed. Flowers sometimes grow where battle has occurred.\
\
'If you could go to the ruins of the Orc-camp Fállug to the west, you may find ninglyr growing there. These flowers may be used in preparing medicines. Bring some to me, and you will be rewarded.'","The Elves at the way-post atop Amon Angened provide supplies and provisions for the main force of the Malledhrim in the east.","'Were you unable to find any ninglyr? The yellow ninglor would help to supplement our medicinal supplies.'","Collect ninglyr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Yes, these flowers will be of much value to us. Thank you, ${PLAYER}.'","Life After Death"},
[8047]={"A few fish were caught in this net!","Fishing nets can be found along the River Morthond near Sardol in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Gordir has asked you to search for fish in the nearby fishing nets and bring any fish you find to him. You should search the nets.","Deliver the fish to Gordir in Sardol","Gordir can be found along the River Morthond in Sardol.\
\
You have searched the nets as Gordir asked and found a few fish caught in them. You should deliver the fish to Gordir.","Gordir can be found along the River Morthond in Sardol.\
\
You have fished with Gordir and caught three pike out of the River Morthond. You should talk to Gordir.","'It has been some time, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'I, for one, have not forgotten how you helped the people of the Blackroot Vale. If it were not for you, we might still be troubled by those terrible water-spirits, and worse yet, we might still be beset by the Corsairs and that so-called Heir of Castamir who took up in Tarlang's Crown. And now, I hear tell that you've become one of King Elessar's emissaries after serving in the War. I say it is an honour and one well-deserved, no matter what some others in the Vale might think of the new King of Gondor. A fine honour, indeed!\
\
'I'm afraid there isn't much trouble about at Sardol—at least not like there was during the War. I've heard that some of the Corsairs and some deserters have made their way to Tarlang's Crown, but it'll come to nothing, I think. \
\
'It may not be much, but I could use a little help today, if you can spare the time in the course of your errands for King Elessar. Would you check the nets near the pier for fish and bring me whatever you find? I've been coming up with small fish all day, so I don't want to let the big one swim by while I'm not paying attention!'","Life Along The Morthond","Many fish dwell in the waters of the River Morthond and provide a rich bounty for the fishermen of the Blackroot Vale.","'Ah, not a bad catch for today then. You can toss those in the bucket there, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I don't have anything else to ask of you, but would you stay and fish with me for a time? The nets work well enough, of course, but I find that taking the time to fish can ease my mind. There is just something right about it, I think. And, to be honest, I would welcome the company. All of these bowmen back from the War, and it seems not one of them is a fisherman!'\
\
Gordir laughs to himself, but it seems half-hearted. He looks out at the River Morthond for a moment, and then looks back to you.\
\
'What do you say, my friend?'","Esta red está vacía","Talk to Gordir","Gordir can be found on a pier along the River Morthond in Sardol.\
\
You have delivered the fish caught in the nets to Gordir, and he has asked you to fish with him for a time. You should fish with Gordir.","Fish with Gordir along the River Morthond (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fished with Gordir along the River Morthond (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Three pike is a fine bounty, I'd say. Very good!\
\
'Thank you for taking the time to fish with me, ${PLAYER}. It has been too long since I last had company on the pier, so our time together has done much to raise my spirits. And I know that you have many other errands upon which to spend your time, so I appreciate it all the more, my friend.\
\
'If you ever find yourself back in Sardol, you are always welcome to fish the Morthond with me!'","Search for fish in the nets along the River Morthond (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[8048]={"Habla con Mallas en el Refugio Sombrío","Ayuda a Lar a eliminar a los gredbyg de Skûmfil","'Habla con Lar, Moggi y Pentlenn en el Refugio Sombrío. Vuelve a verme cuando hayas completado sus tareas, y yo le informaré a Veúlfur de tu ayuda.'","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Recoge muestras de los gredbyg en Skûmfil para Pentlenn","'Es claro de que algo dentro de Moria ha corrompido a estos gredbyg. Ahora son menos.\
\
'Le hablaré bien de ti a Veúlfur, y te doy las gracias, ${PLAYER}.'","Ayuda a Moggi a eliminar a los gredbyg de Skûmfil","Cuando la muerte da vida","Mallas se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Has completado todas las tareas que te encargaron Lar, Moggi y Pentlenn. Vuelve con Mallas e infórmale de que has cumplido con tu misión.","Lar, Moggi y Pentlenn se encuentran en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Mallas te ha dicho que le hablará bien de ti a Veúlfur en la Sala Vigesimoprimera después de que hayas ayudado a sus agentes en el Refugio Sombrío.","'En la naturaleza, tal y como ocurre aquí (aunque de forma más perversa y completamente corrompida), los insectos que habitan en Skûmfil utilizarán los cadáveres de los orcos que allí yacen para alimentar a sus larvas. Es posible que estos gredbyg estén propagando la enfermedad entre los orcos desprevenidos que llevan los cadáveres a Skûmfil.\
\
'He encargado a Lar, Moggi y Pentlenn las tareas necesarias para garantizar que los insectos de Skûmfil no sean los responsables de la propagación de la plaga entre los orcos. Ayúdalos en lo que puedas, y me encargaré de que Veúlfur se entere de tu apoyo contra los peligros de Skûmfil.\
\
'Puedes encontrar a mis tres agentes aquí, en el Refugio Sombrío.'"},
[8049]={"Collected horsetail seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect oxlip seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the seeds to Ereblen in Henneth Annûn","Ereblen can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered many seeds and should now deliver them to Ereblen.","Even with near-constant incursions from Mordor and the Wastes, Ithilien has proven resilient to the Enemy's attacks and continues to bloom with new life.","Collect horsetail seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hail, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'If you are willing, I once again have need of your aid. I would ask that you travel to the Field of Cormallen and again gather seeds of oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling. My fellow Rangers and I have great need of them, especially with our foes retreating into the Wastes.\
\
'Return to me with as many seeds as you can bear and perhaps then we can speak of planting them!'","Collected vetchling seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect vetchling seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you, my friend. Our company shall put these seeds to good use and plant them in the surrounding lands.\
\
'As long as there are Rangers in Gondor, our lands shall bloom anew.'","Seeds of oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling can be found on the Field of Cormallen to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to gather more seeds from the Field of Cormallen and return to him with as many as you are able to bear.","Life Springs Anew","Collected oxlip seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8050]={"Life in Darkness","Mossbeard can be found at your side or if you have become separated, you can use your whistle to call him.\
\
You have uncovered many plants that were freezing beneath snowdrifts in south-west Balewood. You should now talk to Mossbeard and see what more can be done.","Uncover frozen plants in the Balewood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hoom. Such tiny things are ill-prepared for these harsh conditions, little one.\
\
'However, you have done well to return them to any sunlight that finds its way through the fog. I do not know if they will survive unless this winter ends soon, but we have done all we can.\
\
'Thank you for your help, little one, but we must press on.'","Talk to Mossbeard","'Look at what has become of Fangorn, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'So much of the forest smothered in snow...I do not know what the cost of this winter shall be. The trees are strong enough, at least those that were not in the monster's path...but the other greenery is not as hearty, and I fear it will succumb under the cover of snow.\
\
'Snowdrifts have buried much of the life in this forest, ${PLAYER}, but I am hopeful that if we sift through the snow, we might save some of the plants. Let us travel about the wood and rescue what we can.'","Mossbeard fears that the winter will claim much of the life in the Balewood and wishes for you to uncover the plants that have become buried in snow.","Uncovered frozen plants in the Balewood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Snowdrifts can be found throughout south-west Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard wants you to uncover plants that might be freezing beneath snowdrifts in the Balewood and expose them to whatever light remains in the darkened forest."},
[8051]={"Habla con Radagast","Brotes recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Life in Eryn Lasgalen","Hoping to heal Eryn Lasgalen, Radagast has been cultivating saplings.","Cleared dead trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Plant saplings in fertile soil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clear dead trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Have you a moment to aid me once more, my friend? My saplings have grown strong and the time has come to plant them in the fertile soil of Eryn Lasgalen. \
\
'Where many have fallen, new life shall soon spring. Such is nature's way.'","Fertile soil and dead trees can both be found throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should clear away the dead trees and plant the saplings in fertile soil around the forest.","Planted sapling (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.","Saplings can be found just south of Felegoth.\
\
You should gather saplings that are to be planted around the forest.","'Good, good! I knew I could count on you. The Greenleaves will return in time... of this I am certain!'","Recoge brotes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8052]={"La vida en el otro lado","Mizâdi has agreed to hear Kotráka Saiya's story.\
\
You should talk to Kotráka Saiya and complete the Session.","You have heard Kotráka Saiya's story.\
\
You should talk to Kotráka Saiya.","You have heard Kotráka Saiya's story.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi to hear what she thinks.","Kotráka Saiya has come to seek an alliance with Mizâdi. Will the princess' words be enough to convince her?","Complete 'Session: Life on the Other Side'","Talk to Kotráka Saiya","'She believes some dark force now controls her husband, and she must abandon both him and her station to save her children's lives....'\
\
Mizâdi pauses, deep in thought.\
\
'I am not sure I fully understand what is happening in the palace, but I understand her grief and desperation. Those are things I can trust. I will accept her deal, and we will rescue her children.'","Talk to Mizâdi","'Tell Kotráka Saiya I will hear her story. Her words must convince us to put our fates in the hands of an Ordâkhai princess! Will they do this?\
\
'She has risked her life by coming here, and I believe she knows this. This gives me pause enough to hear what she has to say.'","'...And that is why I decided to come to you, my enemies, and beseech you for your help.\
\
'Please... you must understand what a desperate mother would do to save her children. Even if it is too late to save my husband... I had to do something!'","'Let me tell you what life is like inside Emax Dûl... and why I have chosen to abandon it.'"},
[8053]={"'Every man should put in some coin... and make his donation with the certainty that it will keep the Ballast as far from our ship as might be managed!'","'I will go to the Swain's Guild Hall, in the Lower Ward. I understand that is from where some of the caravans across the desert depart, and that is the new profession I have chosen for myself. I will see you there, friend!'","Talk to Jidâlo outside the Broken Pillar Tavern in the Lower Ward","'You retrieved my coins? I am so grateful, my friend! Now my new life can begin!\
\
'I do not understand how such things can keep happening to me, but I am ready to join one of the caravans and see what adventures await me across the sands! It will be a new beginning for the Ballast... and I have you and my good crew-mates to thank for it!'","Shajât's former captain, Jidâlo, is outside the Broken Pillar Tavern in the Lower Ward.","'They raised these coins... for me?'\
\
Shajât's eyes water with grateful tears.\
\
'I told you my former ship-mates were like family to me! \\qBallast!\\q they said to me, \\qwe have never had a voyage like this before!\\q\
\
'But it is time to set a new course. I will go to the Swain's Guild Hall, in the Lower Ward. I understand that is from where some of the caravans across the desert depart, and that is the new profession I have chosen for myself. I will see you there, friend!'","The Ballast's former ship-mates can be found in the vicinity of the Broken Pillar Tavern, in the Lower Ward.","Shajât goes inside the Guild Hall, and you wonder if caravans have ballast","He gives you some coins to help the Ballast find a new course (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the coins raised by his ship-mates to Shajât outside the Lower Ward","Shajât is outside the Lower Ward, in the Sail-haven.","Lifting the Ballast","Retrieved Shajât's coins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The ruffians apparently make their home in a place called the Gut. Do you know where that is, and do you think you might retrieve the money for me? It would be a shame for the hopes of Captain Jidâlo and his crew to be dashed in this fashion! What will they think of their Ballast then?'","Shajât lost the coins given to him by his ship-mates to ruffians in the Gut, and if you don't recover them for him no one will.","'My name is Shajât, and I have a sad story to spin. Will you hear it?\
\
'I was a sailor on a ship, a good ship, and together the crew and I delivered cargo up and down the coast. It was the life for me: seeing new lands and distant shores, meeting interesting people and seeing their faces light up with delight when they received the goods they wanted or needed! I loved it!\
\
'And the camaraderie! That crew was like my family. They called me \\qThe Ballast.\\q A term of endearment, you know?\
\
'It was the best week and a half of my life. But now Captain Jidâlo has sent me away! Will you find him and beg for me to be allowed to join his crew again? He should be at the Broken Pillar Tavern in the Lower Ward with the rest of the crew.'","Talk to the Ballast's former ship-mates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'But now Captain Jidâlo has sent me away! Will you find him and beg for me to be allowed to join his crew again? He should be at the Broken Pillar Tavern in the Lower Ward with the rest of the crew.'","Return his coins to Shajât outside the Swain's Guild Hall","'Shajât sent you? Who is that?'\
\
You tell the captain that Shajât also may have been called \\qThe Ballast,\\q and he groans.\
\
'Oh, I see. Do you know why we called him the Ballast? He may not understand this, being so unused to a mariner's life, but ballast is a heavy material, usually iron, lead, or stone, placed in the hold of a ship to keep it steady. When used as a name for someone onboard a ship... it means that person is useless.\
\
'He was just terrible, friend. During the days he was with us we encountered enough ill fortune and bad luck to fill a year. He tied the wrong knots, scrubbed the wrong floors, emptied the wrong pots, read the wrong weather signs, pointed out dangerous shoals as safe and safe shoals as dangerous. I have never seen someone less-suited to shipboard life. So I sent him away.\
\
'We did not mean to hurt his feelings. Boys! I say we pass around the hat and raise some coin for the Ballast to begin a new life. Every man should put in some coin... and make his donation with the certainty that it will keep the Ballast as far from our ship as might be managed!'","Talk to Shajât outside the Swain's Guild Hall","Shajât stands outside the Guild Hall, but he still looks despondent","Retrieve Shajât's coins from ruffians in the Gut (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Shajât stands outside the Swain's Guild Hall in the Lower Ward.","Find the Swain's Guild Hall in the Lower Ward","Excited to begin his new life, Shajât agreed to meet you outside the Swain's Guild Hall in the Lower Ward.","Is it possible for one man to be so... unfortunate?","Shajât has a sad story to tell, and he has asked you to help him with his myriad woes.","'You are not going to believe this, friend... but as I made my way here I was accosted by ruffians, and they stole the coins given to me by my former shipmates! Alas!\
\
'The ruffians apparently make their home in a place called the Gut. Do you know where that is, and do you think you might retrieve the money for me? It would be a shame for the hopes of Captain Jidâlo and his crew to be dashed in this fashion! What will they think of their Ballast then?'"},
[8054]={"'Gracias por hacer esto. Mi gente nunca olvidará tu valentía. Pero dime, ¿encontraste a Erscin? Vivo o muerto, debo saber qué le ocurrió.',","Libera a los esclavos en Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Esclavos liberados en Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Éa está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Los esclavos de Carn Dûm han sido liberados y ahora pueden regresar a sus hogares, pero no pudiste encontrar al esposo de Éa, Erscin. Deberías regresar con Éa para informarle.","Carn Dûm se encuentra al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
El esposo de Éa, Erscin, y sus compañeros guerreros fueron capturados por orcos y llevados a Carn Dûm. Ella te ha pedido que entres en Carn Dûm y rescates a Erscin.","Levantando el yugo","Carn Dûm es el corazón maligno de Angmar, una ciudad terrible protegida por puertas y hordas de orcos guerreros.","'Debes liberar a mi gente de Carn Dûm.',","'${CLASS}, debes ayudarme. Mi gente ha desaparecido, llevada por los orcos esclavistas de Carn Dûm.\
\
Estos esclavistas asaltan nuestras aldeas y se llevan a nuestros mejores guerreros para trabajar en sus campos de trabajo. Encadenados y maniatados, se ven obligados a servir al Falso Rey. Aquellos que se hieren o enferman son abandonados a su suerte.\
\
Mi esposo, Erscin, está entre los esclavos capturados, si es que aún vive. ¡Por favor, date prisa! Los esclavos deben ser liberados. Los encontrarás en Carn Dûm, lejos al oeste.',"},
[8056]={"Ruingal ha sido derrotado","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Con el espectro ígneo desterrado, las Minas de Moria están un paso más cerca de su recuperación, aunque no sé si los elfos llegarán a ver que esto se haga realidad… su tiempo en la Tierra Media está llegando a su fin.\
\
'Toma esto como recompensa. La has ganado con creces.'","'Tu investigación ha resultado tan fructífera como inquietante. Al parecer, los enanos de antaño fueron acosados por un espectro ígneo de considerable poder, quizá un servidor del Azote de Durin.\
\
'Si se permite que esta criatura permanezca aquí, es muy posible que obtenga ayuda de otros agentes del Enemigo que han venido a reclamar Moria. ¡No podemos permitir que eso ocurra!\
\
'Reúne a tus amigos, ${PLAYER}. Dirígete a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, avanza hacia el este, a las Profundidades Llameantes, y luego al sur, en el Cruce de las Cenizas. Una vez allí, usa este tomo para invocar al espectro ígneo Ruingal y derrotarlo.'","Entra en las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, invoca al espectro ígneo Ruingal y acaba con él.","Habla con Winiel en la Bodega Putrefacta","Usa el tomo para invocar a Ruingal","'¿Está hecho, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'No desesperes si la tarea resulta más difícil de lo que esperabas. La esperanza y la Comunidad son tus armas más poderosas frente al mal. Confía en ellas para hallar la fuerza.'","Con la ayuda del libro que obtuviste del sapo Granrugido, Winiel ha logrado descifrar los fragmentos de saber que le llevaste. Gracias a tu ayuda, ha obtenido información acerca de un espectro ígneo que acecha en las Minas de Moria.","Winiel se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas, al noreste de las Forjas de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Deberías regresar con Winiel para informarle de tu victoria.","Derrota a Ruingal","Luz del alba naciente (opcional)"},
[8057]={"Habla con Gaelnarthan en el campamento del Coloso","Las ruinas del faro están al sureste del Coloso.\
\
nGaelnarthan te ha pedido que te aventures en el faro y derrotes a la criatura que encuentres en su interior.","'Por favor, derrota a lo que quiera que sea esta cosa. No podemos estar completamente seguros en este campamento mientras exista.'","Derrota a la criatura bajo el faro","'He podido abrir todos los recipientes que recuperaste y he encontrado la llave en el último. Son grandes noticias para nosotros, ya que finalmente podemos pasar a la ofensiva.\
\
'Como he mencionado antes de que te marcharas a recuperar los recipientes, hemos estado constantemente hostigados por una criatura que creemos vive bajo las ruinas del faro. La puerta está cerrada, así que no podemos encontrar. No hemos encontrado otra entrada, ni sabemos cómo entra y sale. Estamos seguro de que vive ahí, eso sí.\
\
'Ya hemos perdido a suficientes hombres a causa de esta criatura. Toma esta llave, aventúrate bajo el faro y elimina a lo que quiera que encuentres allí abajo. No vuelvas hasta que estemos a salvo de esa amenaza.'","Gaelnarthan está en el campamento del Coloso.\
\
Gaelnarthan estará complacido de oír que el kergrim que les hostigaba ha sido derrotado.","El faro del Baranduin","'¡La criatura ha sido derrotada! Puedo verlo en tu ropa y en la suciedad que la cubre. Estoy muy agradecido por tus esfuerzos. Creo que esta será la primera noche que duerma tranquilo en este campamento.'","Con la llave del sótano del faro, puedes atacar a la criatura que ahora llama hogar a este lugar.'"},
[8067]={"'Hay muchas lámparas colocadas a lo largo del sinuoso camino minero que desciende hacia las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, pero hace muchos años que no se encienden.\
\
'¿Recorrerás el largo descenso y encenderás las lámparas a medida que avanzas? Las luces deberían ayudar a ahuyentar a los enemigos que se han instalado aquí y facilitar la visión de los enanos mientras trabajan y exploran.'","Las lámparas se encuentran en el largo y sinuoso descenso hacia el pozo situado en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Debes bajar por el camino y encender las lámparas a medida que avanzas.","Thalfar quiere que se enciendan las lámparas de la mina profunda, lo que debería ayudar a ahuyentar a los enemigos que se han instalado allí y hacer que la expedición minera sea más segura para los enanos.","halfar se encuentra en el campamento minero central de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Thalfar e informarle de que las lámparas están encendidas de nuevo","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. ¡Las luces serán de gran ayuda para nuestro trabajo en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata!'","Enciende lámparas a lo largo del sinuoso sendero (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encendiendo el pozo","Habla con Thalfar","Enciende una lámpara (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las luces que hay a lo largo del recorrido del pozo serán de gran ayuda para la expedición minera.'"},
[8068]={"'Así que fuiste tú quien ajustó la luz, ¿verdad? Al principio pensé que había un incendio y que estábamos a punto de ser atacados, pero luego me di cuenta de que era una luz cálida y suave. \
\
'Entonces supe que procedía de uno de esos antiguos espejos de los que tanto he oído hablar. Me alegra haber vivido para contemplar la belleza del sistema de iluminación de Khazad-dûm.'","Habla con Slagvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Los caminos hacia y desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación son oscuros, pero ajustar un antiguo espejo reflector de luz ha ayudado a iluminar el camino.","Ajustar este espejo ha permitido que los caminos del Mirador de la Gran Excavación estén mucho mejor iluminados que antes. Esto evitará probablemente que muchos caigan o tomen un camino equivocado.","Slagvi se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en la Gran Excavación de Moria.\
\
Deberías hablar con Slagvi sobre el espejo que ajustaste.","Iluminando el camino"},
[8069]={"Enciende piras en Hurmulkezer (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hurmulkezer se encuentra justo al sur del Patio de Durin, en la zona sureste de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías encender piras en Hurmulkezer.","'Me dirigiré ahora al Cruce de las Cenizas, pero antes de que me sigas, te pediré un favor, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Las piras de Hurmulkezer están apagadas, y sin enanos custodiando el Patio de Durin, no serán advertidos de que Hurmulkezer ha sido reclamado por el Enemigo. Me gustaría que fueras a encender las piras como advertencia para los enanos.\
\
'Mientras tanto, marcaré los muros que conducen al Cruce de las Cenizas para que puedas encontrar el camino fácilmente.'","Las piras de Hurmulkezer están encendidas, advirtiendo a los enanos de que los enemigos controlan actualmente esta fortaleza, y que entrar sin saberlo sería mortal.","Completado","Pira encendida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Iluminando el camino","Todos los orcos son criaturas perezosas, y las piras de Hurmulkezer permanecen apagadas por falta de mantenimiento. Encenderlas servirá como advertencia a los enanos de que en estos salones habitan enemigos."},
[8071]={"Defeated many Linduin fire-flies in Laerlad.","You have defeated many Linduin fire-flies in Laerlad, allowing the Woodmen to travel without constant threat. They will be grateful for your efforts.","Defeat Linduin fire-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Linduin fire-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Linduin fire-flies can be found in Laerlad.\
\
You should defeat Linduin fire-flies.","Something has agitated the fire-flies of Laerlad, causing them to attack without warning. If Laerlad is to be made safe for the Woodmen of Blómgard, these creatures must be defeated.","Completado","Frenzied fire-flies attack those who wander through Laerlad.","Lights Upon the Linduin"},
[8072]={"'¿Así que los caminos están todos iluminados? ¡Bien, ahora los que paseen después del postre no tienen nada que temer!'","Milo Surcolargo está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Milo Surcolargo se alegrará de saber que las lámparas arderán durante toda la noche.","Se pueden encontrar lámparas apagadas en los senderos de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Milo Surcolargo te ha pedido que le ayudes a iluminar la zona encendiendo las lámparas del mercado agrícola de la Granja de Cotonorte.","'Esto no puede ser. Sencillamente no puede ser. ¿Ves lo oscuro que está esto? El mercado dura hasta bien entrada la noche, a veces incluso después de la segunda cena. Si la gente no puede ver por dónde va, ¡alguien podría hacerse daño!\
\
'Las lámparas de los senderos tienen que estar encendidas y permanecer así. Si sales y las enciendes por mí, te lo agradecería enormemente.'","Enciende las lámparas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has encendido las lámparas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los senderos de la Granja de Cotonorte están iluminados por lámparas que con el tiempo se apagan y hay que reemplazarlas.","Habla con Milo Surcolargo","'Las lámparas deben arder durante toda la noche.'","Luces para el mercado"},
[8073]={"Los limrafn acechan en Haudh Valandil, la tumba en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant, en Annúminas.\
\
Debes derrotar a los limrafn que acechan en las profundidades de Haudh Valandil.","Derrota a los limrafn en Haudh Valandil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Limrafn derrotados en Haudh Valandil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ost Elendil, el gran palacio de los reyes de antaño, está en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant. En su base está la entrada a Haudh Valandil, la tumba de Valandil, hijo de Isildur. Temo que la tumba, tras largo tiempo sin profanar, se haya convertido en el hogar de grandes males: tanto de Angmar como de otros orígenes.","Luces en la oscuridad"},
[8074]={"Lights in the Land","'Good! Let us prepare ourselves for battle!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to help the Rohirrim border-guard defend against the Khundolar's retaliation.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, we were fortunate to survive that attack; however, I think the Khundolar will be unable to attack again for some time.\
\
'Thank you for your courage and your weapon!'","Talk to Céola when you are ready to defend Etheburg","Enraged by your attack upon Lashkarg and the death of their chieftain, the Khundolar stage an assault upon Etheburg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","'There are lights in the land, ${PLAYER}. The fires of Lashkarg burn brightly, for the Khundolar prepare to lay siege to Etheburg. You had a mighty victory at Lashkarg, but now I fear we must pay the price for it.\
\
'Will you stand with us and defend Etheburg? If we can rout the enemy here, then we may actually survive this war!\
\
'If you do wish to help us defend Etheburg, speak with me again, and we will go to prepare ourselves.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak with Céola regarding the victory at Etheburg."},
[8075]={"'Good! Then let us prepare ourselves for battle!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to help the Rohirrim border-guard defend against the Khundolar's retaliation.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, we were fortunate to survive that attack; however, I think the Khundolar will be unable to attack again for some time.\
\
'Thank you for your courage and your weapon!'","Talk to Céola when you are ready to defend Etheburg","Enraged by your attack upon Lashkarg and the death of their chieftain, the Khundolar stage an assault upon Etheburg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Lights in the Land -- Repeatable","'There are lights in the land, ${PLAYER}. The fires of Lashkarg burn brightly, for the Khundolar prepare to lay siege to Etheburg. You had a mighty victory at Lashkarg, but now I fear we must pay the price for it.\
\
'Will you stand with us and defend Etheburg? If we can rout the enemy here, then we may actually survive this war!\
\
'If you do wish to help us defend Etheburg, speak with me again, and we will go to prepare ourselves.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak with Céola regarding the victory at Etheburg."},
[8076]={"Ordâkhai soldiers can be found throughout TBD Khud Zagin.\
\
TBD has asked you to defeat several wandering patrols of Ordâkhai soldiers through TBD various parts of Khud Zagin.","'The Ordâkhai continue to nip at our heels. Have you had much trouble ridding these wastes of their like? The sooner their numbers dwindle, the safer Ghalburu becomes.'","TBD, a rebel in opposition to the Ordâkhai, is growing concerned about the number of Ordâkhai patrols near Ghalburu. You have offered to clear a few of their number.","Like Smoke in the Night","TBD Rebel Sharpshooter can be found in Ghalburu.\
\
Return to TBD Rebel Sharpshooter,","Ordâkhai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You are known to me through a particular shared network, wanderer, and I know the Ordâkhai are no friend of yours. I and my fellows grow wary of their patrols so near to our own. We true of the Khûd would welcome your assistance in limiting their hunting grounds.'","Derrota a los soldados Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to TBD Rebel Sharpshooter","'It is not just I and my fighters that have noticed fewer Ordâkhai sniffing about our home. Our families, sick, injured, and children back home in Ghalburu have all felt relief from the yoke of their oppression. Thank you for sending those vile invaders a message that we will not accept their presence lying down.'"},
[8078]={"Bring peace by force to the restless Curthádi spirits at Róthirin.","'It grieves me greatly, but I have a task for you, outsider, if you're willing. There are many of our kind that cannot find peace, even in death. It is this forest, Favrathór, cursed as it has become. Wherever the Lâg Dávrit struck the Favrathór, Curthádi were borne out of that imbalance in nature. Curthádi are Adúrhid spirits of hatred and anger, who roam this land, never finding peace.\
\
'It is the solemn duty of the Adúrhid warriors to bring peace by force to those among my kin who become Curthádi. You have helped Thórvilon greatly, and so you seem to be someone we Adúrhid can trust. I will be honest, I have so few warriors left - I cannot spare any currently to deal with the Curthádi. The southern Men make war on us. Ever has it been, and ever it will be. We cannot find peace. Yet our duty to the Curthádi remains.\
\
'Will you go in my stead? This is a sacred duty I give to you. We are responsible for tending all of our dead, peaceful and otherwise. This extends even to the odious few who become Curthádi. Go to Róthirin - there the Pale Blight has corrupted the Veróthi of the grove, and many spirits of the grove have spilled out, angry and hateful, becoming Curthádi. Give them the final peace they deserve.'","'It is a hard thing, bringing peace to those who do not want it. Thank you for executing this duty in my stead. There is much that is out of balance in Favrathór this day. I must admit, I often long for the great boughs and peaceful green copses of the old Emerald Wood, of Laithór.'","Defeat Curthádi at Róthirin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Report back to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin that you've brought peace to many Curthádi at Róthirin.","Ildarthos, Artar of the remaining Adúrhid warriors in Vartúlin, has asked for your help in bringing peace to the many wrathful Curthádi at Róthirin.","Defeated Curthádi at Róthirin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Report back to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin","Like Water for the Drowned"},
[8079]={"'After being frightened by those enormous frogs, I am afraid to collect the water-lilies now!\
\
'Would you mind doing it for me? It would be a great help to me.\
\
'Go to the pond to the west of here and gather some water-lilies for my dear Lily.'","The pond that contains the water-lilies is just to the west of the Mead Hall.\
\
Selethryth asked you to gather water-lilies to feed her goat.","Collected water-lilies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Selethryth is north-west of the Mead Hall of Fenmarch.\
\
You have gathered a number of water-lilies and should bring them back to Selethryth so that she may feed her hungry goat.","Selethryth's goat, Lily, will only eat water-lilies, and Selethryth has no more.","Collect water-lilies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you for gathering these for me. Lily will be quite happy now.\
\
'I hope those frogs left you alone. Such vile creatures!'","Lilies for Lily","Talk to Selethryth"},
[8080]={"Un lirio perfecto crece en algún lugar a lo largo del Bruinen, al este del puesto de Arrod.\
\
Arrod te ha pedido que le traigas un lirio perfecto de belleza exquisita. Ningún otro tipo servirá.","Has encontrado un lirio perfecto","'He decidido confeccionar un collar para mi doncella Elfa, ${PLAYER}, y aunque la pluma que me trajiste es un buen añadido, aún no es suficiente.\
\
'Los lirios crecen a orillas del Sonorona, el Bruinen hacia el este, y cualquiera de ellos sería lo bastante hermoso como para que un joven Elfo se lo ofrezca a su amada. Pero lo mío no es un amor común, ${PLAYER}, ¡y esos lirios blancos no bastarán!\
\
'Solo un lirio malva de belleza insuperable será lo bastante hermoso para mi doncella Elfa. Busca uno en algún lugar a lo largo del Bruinen, y con cuidado: ¡los lirios de ese tono son sumamente raros!'","Arrod quedó complacido con la pluma que le trajiste, y se ha inspirado en ella para confeccionar un collar para Narlinn.","'¡Qué belleza! Este lirio servirá perfectamente, ${PLAYER}. Te agradezco, por supuesto, ¡y de todo corazón!\
\
'Solo tomará un momento. ¡Narlinn atesorará este collar y comprenderá la profundidad de mi afecto por ella!'","Encuentra el lirio perfecto","'Un lirio malva de hermosura insuperable es algo raro, y solo se encuentra a lo largo del Bruinen. ¡Busca con cuidado! ¡Los blancos no servirán!'","Arrod vigila el camino que atraviesa las Gargantas del Bruinen desde su puesto, cerca de unas ruinas en lo alto de una colina, al oeste del Bruinen.\
\
Arrod se alegrará al ver que has encontrado un lirio de belleza exquisita.","Lirios en el Valle","Lleva el lirio perfecto de regreso a Arrod","'No has regresado con el lirio que te pedí, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[8081]={"Haldis wishes for you to decorate the inside of Grimbeorn's lodge.\
\
You should decorate the inside of the lodge with the lilies you collected.","Collect pond lilies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lilies of the Vale","Pond lilies can be found in ponds throughout the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should collect pond lilies for Haldis.","Collected pond lilies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Haldis has seen the pond lilies in full bloom and wishes to bring joy to the Beorninghús.","Decorate Grimbeorn's hall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Decorated Grimbeorn's hall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Haldis","Haldis can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should inform Haldis that the decorations are complete.","'While I was walking sweet Honey-bell I saw the pond lilies in full bloom, and their loveliness left me amazed! Had I not been so exhausted by the walk, I might have picked some lilies to brighten Grimbeorn's hall. If you venture once again among the Vales, could I ask you to pick some of the lilies for me? The hall could use some decoration and some brightening both!'","'I am sure the lilies will brighten the hall! Dare I think the flowers might bring a smile even to old Grimbeorn himself? I do dare!'"},
[8082]={"Gammy Cenagales está segura de que Falco Manoverde se ha metido en algún tipo de problema del que no puede salir, y el mensaje críptico que recibiste de Lirio no ayuda a tranquilizarla.","'¡Gente Grande! Ya fue bastante malo que los Hombres en Archet quemaran su pueblo y luego se internaran en el bosque de Chet. No sabía que había algunos cerca de aquí.\
\
'Oh, Falco... qué vamos a hacer contigo.'","Habla con Lirio Sotomonte en su casa","'Busca mi homónimo junto a las ruinas y encontrarás la respuesta a los problemas de Falco...'","Lirios rojos recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Gammy Cenagales en su granja.","lleva los lirios rojos a Lirio Sotomonte en su granja.","Entrega los lirios rojos a Lirio Sotomonte","Lirio Sotomonte se encuentra fuera de su casa al este de la casa de Gammy Cenagales, al pie de la colina, al norte del camino.\
\
Gammy Cenagales cree que con la persuasión adecuada, Lirio contará todo lo que sabe sobre la difícil situación de Falco.","'Le dije a Falco que no diría nada sobre lo que sé... pero tal vez pueda decírtelo sin decir nada, entonces no estaría diciendo, ¿verdad?\
\
'Me gustan las flores, ${PLAYER}, pero no cualquier flor... Me gustan las flores que llevan mi nombre. Al sur de mi casa, más allá del Árbol Amarillo, encontrarás lirios, ¡lirios rojos!\
\
'Tráeme un manojo de lirios y mantén los ojos abiertos. Si miras dónde estás, notarás el gran problema que enfrenta el pobre Falco.'","Lirio Sotomonte se encuentra fuera de su casa, al este de la granja de Gammy Cenagales.\
\
Lirio Sotomonte dijo que no podía decir específicamente cuál era el problema de Falco Manoverde, pero que podía mostrártelo si mirabas las cosas correctas. Como pista, te envió a recolectar lirios rojos. Al encontrar los lirios, también notaste el gran campamento de bandidos en Ost Baranor.","El secreto de Lily","'¡Apresúrate! No permitiré que un hobbit sufra mientras pueda ayudar.'","'Si mantienes los ojos atentos, puede que notes que Falco tiene un \\qgran\\q problema.'","Gammy Cenagales está en su granja, al oeste de la casa de Lirio Sotomonte.\
\
Lirio te dijo — sin decirte — que la Gente Grande acampada en las ruinas del sur del bosque de Chet es la razón por la que la granja de Falco Manoverde está sufriendo. Deberías contarle a Gammy Cenagales lo que sabes.","'Si estuviste mirando por ti mismo en el sur del bosque de Chet, probablemente notaste a toda la Gente Grande allí. Ahora sabes mi secreto, ¡y nunca dije una palabra!\
\
'Oh, gracias por las flores, ${PLAYER}. Son preciosas.\
\
'Ahora puedes decirle a Gammy Cenagales que sabes lo que yo sé. Espero que puedas encontrar una manera de ayudar al pobre Falco.'","'Espero que puedas encontrar una manera de ayudar a Falco, ${PLAYER}.'","Recolecta lirios rojos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los lirios rojos se pueden encontrar en la zona boscosa al sur del Árbol Amarillo, bien al sur de la casa de Lirio Sotomonte.\
\
Lirio Sotomonte dijo que no podía decir específicamente cuál era el problema de Falco Manoverde, pero que podía mostrártelo si mirabas las cosas correctas. Como pista, te envió a recolectar lirios rojos.","'Si Lirio sabe algo, probablemente podamos hacer que hable. Será reservada, como la mayoría de las hobbits jóvenes, pero si le pides amablemente, estoy segura de que nos dirá lo que necesitamos para ayudar al pobre Falco.\
\
'Necesitamos unirnos y asegurarnos de que Falco reciba toda la ayuda posible para superar este momento.\
\
'Regresa con Lirio a su granja al pie de la colina — no está muy lejos por el camino hacia el este — e intenta averiguar qué vio.'"},
[8083]={"Collect lilies in the marsh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'If you are able, ${PLAYER}, would you help me gather lilies from the marsh north of here? It has been a busy time for both my husband Rossaran and me, and I wish to surprise him with something nice. Of course, I will reward you for your efforts.'","'Oh, these lilies are beautiful. Thank you. Perhaps such a request seemed silly in the face of everything that is happening... but I am grateful that you went out of your way to help me.'","Talk to Bruidis in Tadrent","Bruidis has asked you to help her collect lilies from the marsh north of Tadrent.","Lily-Picking","You have collected plenty of lilies.\
\
You should bring them to Bruidis in Tadrent.","Bruidis wishes to surprise her husband with a gift.","Collected lilies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8085]={"'Among the remains of the creatures that we have dispatched, several chain-links have been recovered. These links hold the key to the travesty that has occured here.\
\
'Will you bring me any of these links that you may find while dispatching the wights plaguing Plas-maru?'","Collect chain-links (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected chain-links (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Sadly, these chains are indeed the ones that were gifted to the Dievlig. I feared that this might be so.\
\
'I am unsure how this has been done, but we must do what we can to prevent our ancestors' bodies from being befouled further.'","Wights have arisen in the Bonevales, presenting a terrible threat to all who dwell in Dunland.","Link in the Chain","'Bring me any chain links that you find upon the wights.'","Ilar is at his camp, west of Plas-maru.\
\
You should bring the chain-links that you recovered to Ilar.","Talk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales","Chain-links may be found on wights outside Plas-maru, east of Ilar's camp.\
\
Ilar has asked you to recover chain-links from fallen wights."},
[8086]={"'Ah yes! A great many of the draughts, indeed! This'll warm our bones on long nights looking out over the walls of this fort.\
\
'You've earned this, ${PLAYER}. Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig is collecting these for greater rewards.'","Liquid Courage","'Listen here. Captain-General Makán looks out for the Free Peoples as best he can, and that's why he has me working on restocking food and ale.\
\
'Hoarhallow, that little village of hobbits to the south-west, makes the finest ale in the region -- well, the only ale in the region. Slightly bitter to appeal to the taste of dwarves and Men, with a sweet finish that the Elves desire.\
\
'Raiders from the forces of Angmar have looted so much of the ale that there is not enough left to go around. Find some Hoarhallow-ale and make your way back to me, and I will see you suitably rewarded.'","Return to Lieutenant Solvi at Tol Ascarnen","Collected draught of Hoarhallow-ale (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Captain-General Mákan does his best to assist the morale of the troops stationed at Tol Ascarnen. The relentless battle takes its toll on a being over time, and ale is the best way to keep the Free Peoples prepared.","You may be able to find some in Hoarhallow itself, but it will likely be costly. You may even find the draughts stored at Grothum and Dâr-gazag.\
\
Lieutenant Solvi asked you to find and recover draughts of Hoarhallow-ale.","'I'll need a goodly number of draughts before I can cede a token of valour to you, ${CLASS}. You'd best get out there and find them.'","Collect draughts of Hoarhallow-ale (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8087]={"Hathalon's mood is grim","Talk to Hathalon, Master-at-arms, in the north of Imloth Melui","'How am I feeling? I have seen better days and better nights, ${CLASS}! Most of the warriors have already left this city, and now I am forced to remain behind and train youths and old men!\
\
'This is a city of healers and potion-makers, not fighters. Even with the finest training I can give to them, this vale is nearly undefended! Tell Lady Vanyalos we must hope the enemy does not come to Imloth Melui, for that is the only way we might survive!'","Merenir's mood is hopeful","'I ask you to speak with the few trusted folk who remain, and learn if they have given up hope of victory and peace in Imloth Melui.\
\
'Hathalon is my Master-at-arms, and he is responsible for training the few warriors who remain. If he has given in to despair, I fear the sickness will spread to his recruits. Merenir, my Captain of the Guard, oversees the flow of refugees by the fountain in the middle of town. And Master Healer Brunil treats the injured within the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of town. I rely on all three of these good people, and I need to know they are still able to carry out their duties.'","Talk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui","'I thank you for judging the mood of my people, ${PLAYER}. If I were a potion-maker, I would think two parts despair and one part hopefulness a poor mixture indeed, but perhaps I should be grateful it is no worse.'","Hathalon trains new recruits in the northern part of Imloth Melui. Merenir oversees the flow of refugees by the fountain in the middle of town. Master Healer Brunil treats the injured within the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui.\
\
Lady Vanyalos has asked you to talk to the people she trusts in Imloth Melui and determine their moods.","Lady Vanyalos is in her hall on the north-eastern rise in Imloth Melui.\
\
You should return to Lady Vanyalos and report what you have heard from her three trusted advisors.","Talk to Lady Vanyalos in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui","Talk to Merenir, Captain of the Guard, in the centre of Imloth Melui","Lady Vanyalos wishes to know the current mood and thoughts of the people of Imloth Melui.","'Lady Vanyalos sent you to ask after us?'\
\
Brunil scowls at you.\
\
'The sick are sick and the well are weary. I would not expect the Lady to come to these halls, but I suppose sending you shows that at least she thinks of us on occasion, toiling away for the health of her people. Tell her that we do what we can with less than we need, and if we complain we do it only as a result of much hardship.'","'Lady Vanyalos wishes to know the mood of the people? That is why Imloth Melui will thrive even in the absence of Lord Forlong, ${PLAYER}. What ruler cares as much about her people as Lady Vanyalos? Very few, I wager!\
\
'When you return to her hall, please bring my assurances that we keep good watch on all who approach the vale. Nothing will threaten Imloth Melui without me hearing of it first!'","Listening to the Pulse","'It is good to speak with someone new, even if you were driven here by sorrow and war. So many good men have gone away to Minas Tirith, my husband Forlong not least of them. Indeed, he exceeds them all, in girth, at least! My Forlong always had such a sense of humour, and fond of his dinners, too.\
\
'One sound has fled beyond the walls of my city, ${PLAYER}, and I miss it almost as much as Forlong. The sound of laughter has quite vanished from the vale. Has its absence affected my people as grievously as it has me? I ask you to speak with the few trusted folk who remain, and learn if they have given up hope of victory and peace in Imloth Melui.\
\
'Hathalon is my Master-at-arms, and he is responsible for training the few warriors who remain. If he has given in to despair, I fear the sickness will spread to his recruits. Merenir, my Captain of the Guard, oversees the flow of refugees by the fountain in the middle of town. And Master Healer Brunil treats the injured within the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of town. I rely on all three of these good people, and I need to know they are still able to carry out their duties.'","Brunil's mood is dour"},
[8088]={"El gremio de carpinteros de Umbar Baharbêl suministra muchos artículos hermosos a los ciudadanos de la ciudad. Estás ayudando a que sus servicios de artesanía crezcan.","'Me alegra verte. Me pareces del tipo que ve madera de deriva a lo largo de la orilla y no oye el sonido de las olas rompiendo, sino la voz de la madera llamándote a encontrar la belleza más profunda en su interior. Es la razón por la que te uniste a nuestro gremio, ¿no? Sea cual sea la razón, eres uno de nosotros y tenemos peticiones acumulándose que necesitan ser cumplidas.\
\
'Por favor, coge tus herramientas de tallado y ayúdanos a suministrar todo lo que se nos pide.'","Fabrica una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Has creado una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","'Excelente. Estos arcos serán bien utilizados por los guardias de todo Umbar.'","Proporciona la caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Escuchando a la madera (Diario)","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de arcos para Umbar Baharbêl."},
[8089]={"El gremio de carpinteros de Umbar Baharbêl suministra muchos artículos hermosos a los ciudadanos de la ciudad. Estás ayudando a que sus servicios de artesanía crezcan.","'Me alegra verte. Me pareces del tipo que ve madera de deriva a lo largo de la orilla y no oye el sonido de las olas rompiendo, sino la voz de la madera llamándote a encontrar la belleza más profunda en su interior. Es la razón por la que te uniste a nuestro gremio, ¿no? Sea cual sea la razón, eres uno de nosotros y tenemos peticiones acumulándose que necesitan ser cumplidas.\
\
'Por favor, coge tus herramientas de tallado y ayúdanos a suministrar todo lo que se nos pide.'","Fabrica una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Has creado una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","'Excelente. Estos arcos serán bien utilizados por los guardias de todo Umbar.'","Proporciona la caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Escuchando a la madera (Diario)","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de arcos para Umbar Baharbêl."},
[8090]={"'Te saludo, ${PLAYERNAME:Guardián[m]|Guardiana[f]}. Buscabas a Brestir, ¡y ahora lo has encontrado!\
\
'Dithrik te envía aquí para ponerte a prueba. Examinaré tu determinación en combate y juzgaré tu valía, y no me morderé la lengua cuando vuelva para dar mi informe. Si hay alguna carencia en tu habilidad, el poderoso Brestir la descubrirá, ¡y Dithrik lo sabrá!\
\
'Bien entonces, ${PLAYERNAME:novato[m]|novata[f]}: ¿estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para enfrentarme en combate? ¡Entonces ven! ¡Baruk Khazâd! ¡Khazâd ai-mênu!'","Antes de continuar tu aprendizaje, Dithrik desea ver cómo te desempeñas en un duelo contra el enano Brestir.","El Puente de Khazad-dûm, donde se encuentra Brestir, está al norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra y al este de la Segunda Sala.\
\
Dithrik te ha invitado a desafiar a su amigo Brestir en un duelo para ver si estás ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]} para los desafíos que te esperan.","Letanía de desafío","Regresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra","Desafía a Brestir a un duelo en el Puente de Khazad-dûm","Brestir derrotado","'Has hecho muy bien en llegar tan lejos en tu camino como ${PLAYERNAME:Guardián[m]|Guardiana[f]}, pero tengo mucha curiosidad por ver cómo te desenvuelves en una situación de igualdad. Mi amigo Brestir, uno de los enanos más fuertes que puedes encontrar hoy en día, está esperando para enfrentarse a ti en un duelo.\
\
'Viaja al Puente de Khazad-dûm y busca allí a Brestir. Si logras derrotarlo en un duelo justo, sin duda estarás preparado para mi siguiente tarea.\
\
'Mi corazón me dice que ya lo estás, pero Brestir volverá conmigo y quizá tenga más que decirme. Perdóname la falta de confianza, pero hay cosas que deben probarse sin lugar a dudas antes de darlas por sentadas.'","'Estoy impresionado... y me siento humilde. Todos los enanos son recios y resistentes, pero Brestir es considerado uno de los más fuertes de nuestra raza. Debes ser ${PLAYER:un guerrero verdaderamente consumado[m]|una guerrera verdaderamente consumada[f]}, y ${PLAYER:un Guardián[m]|una Guardiana[f]} excepcional, para haberle vencido así.\
\
'Has pasado la prueba, y tienes mis elogios y mis disculpas. Mi corazón hablaba con verdad cuando me dijo que estabas ${PLAYER:listo[m]|lista[f]} y no necesitabas ser ${PLAYER:puesto[m]|puesta[f]} a prueba. Espero que me perdones, por el bien de la equidad.\
\
'Ahora miremos hacia adelante, ${PLAYER}. Veamos tu siguiente tarea.'"},
[8092]={"Bote, Léofrun's doll, is somewhere within the ruins of Thornhope.\
\
Léofrun has asked you to find her doll Bote.","'Have you found Bote?'","Collected Léofrun's doll","Bring the doll to Léofrun outside Thornhope","Léofrun clutches the doll to her breast.\
\
'Oh thank you, kind ${CLASS}! Do you think you can find my Mama and Papa?\
\
'Nay, I suppose not....'\
\
The girl begins to weep again.","Little Comfort","'Mama! Papa!'\
\
The little girl sobs.\
\
'I am scared... I cannot find Mama and Papa. I want my doll, Bote! I lost her when I hid from the monsters! Please find Bote!'","Léofrun is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope.\
\
You should return the frightened little girl's doll to its owner.","After you rescued the frightened child, Léofrun, from the ruins of Thornhope, she took refuge with Thane Béortnoth.","Collect Léofrun's doll"},
[8093]={"The Lumber Yard has fallen into enemy hands.","Tortmund has arrived safely","Little Folk Harvesters","'Tortmund can be found at Hoarhallow, my friend. You should find him and speak with him.'","Tortmund Cliffside is at the tower on the eastern border of Hoarhallow, just over the bridge.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Aeglas has asked you to see the safe arrival of the hobbits from Hoarhallow. The hobbits will be assisting the Free Peoples in acquiring enough materials to create bulwarks throughout the Ettenmoors.","As the battle for the Ettenmoors rages on, the host of the Free Peoples is beginning to realize that they must think about reinforcing their positions throughout the land.","'We have allies to the west, ${PLAYER}, allies willing to come and assist us in the collection of much needed resources in this battle. The battle is taking longer than we thought, and we must prepare battlements throughout the Ettenmoors. To do this, we must have proper provisions and materials, which means that we need to get this lumber-camp operational.\
\
'Tortmund Cliffside, one of the halflings, has agreed to lead a group of his people to the Lumber Camp. He is located within the tower at the eastern edge of Hoarhallow. Go and speak to him, then bring him safely to the Grimwood Lumber-yard.\
\
'Be swift, but be cautious.'","Escort Tortmund Cliffside to the Grimwood Lumber camp","'Let us move along. If all goes well, we will arrive swiftly.'"},
[8094]={"'¡Date prisa, coloca ese estandarte en el trono de Zâhof! ¡Los que son leales a él creerán que ha sido obra de Mordor!'","'Los uruks de la Mano Blanca tenían un propósito aquí: tomar el mando de los orcos y trasgos de Khazad-dûm y volverlos contra las fuerzas de Mordor. Por qué les ordenaron hacer eso no lo sé, pero sus intenciones eran claras. Ahora es el momento de romper el equilibrio. Antes de que tengan oportunidad de sobrepasarnos, quiero volverlos a los unos contra los otros.\
\
'Hay un poderoso líder uruk de la Mano Blanca, Zâhof, que ha unido a muchas de las tribus de trasgos desde aquí hasta la puerta. Gobierna ahora sobre el Camino de Durin, reclamándolo para sí. Ha llegado su momento de caer, cargando con la responsabilidad de ello a Mordor.\
\
'Mis exploradores me han informado que Zâhof se encuentra en Fehem-dûm. Encuéntrale, derrótale y coloca este estandarte de Mordor en su trono.'","'Así que Zâhof por fin ha caído. Sin él, el resto de las fuerzas de la Mano Blanca han empezado a huir de Khazad-dûm. Con la presión de tanto las fuerzas de Mordor como del Pueblo de Durin, creen que esta no es una causa por la que vale la pena luchar.\
\
'Esta es una gran victoria para nosotros, pero no dejes de estar vigilante. Solo hemos encendido una pequeña llama... ahora tenemos que convertirla en fuego embravecido.'","'¡Has mostrado gran valentía expulsando a la Mano Blanca de Khazad-dûm!'","Estandarte de Mordor colocado en el trono de Zâhof","Zâhof derrotado","El líder uruk de la Mano Blanca ha establecido su campamento en el Camino de Durin y está haciendo que varias tribus de trasgos y orcos se alíen bajo su mando.","Coloca el estandarte de Mordor en el trono de Zâhof","El trono de Zâhof está en Fehem-dûm, al este de Jazârgund.\
\
Ión desea causar discordia entre los orcos de Moria y Mordor. Te ha dado un estandarte para que lo coloques en el trono del uruk de la Mano Blanca.","Derrota a Zâhof","Ion está en Jazârgund, al oeste de Fehem-dûm.\
\
Ión se alegrará de oír que Zâhof está muerto y que el estandarte de Mordor ha sido colocado en su trono.","Zâhof se encuentra en Fehem-dûm, al este de Jazârgund.\
\
Zâhof es el líder de los uruks de la Mano Blanca en Moria. Si cae, los planes de Saruman caerán con él.","Pequeña revolución","'Zâhof ya no es bienvenido en Khazad-dûm. Es hora de que caiga... y de que Mordor cargue con la culpa.'","Habla con Ión en Jazârgund"},
[8095]={"Amarêkh, one of the Temámir guards stationed in Mekab-kuphâr, has asked you to leave offerings of food for the \\qlittle spirits\\q throughout Khabârkhad. \
\
The first location is west of Mekab-kuphâr, near Sektakhâb, where the Dead walk.","Return to the Temámir Guard Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr in southern Khabârkhad.","Amarêkh, one of the Temámir guards stationed in Mekab-kuphâr, has asked you to leave offerings of food for the \\qlittle spirits\\q throughout Khabârkhad.","Return to the Temámir Guard Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr","Left food offerings near Lôkhalel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Left food offerings near Sektakhâb (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Leave food offerings near Sektakhâb (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The third location is north-west of Mekab-kuphâr, near Lôkhalel, where tomb robbers keep their council.","Leave food offerings near Lôkhalel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The second location is north of Mekab-kuphâr, near Nishabêt, home of monstrous spiders.","Little Spirits","'Could I have a moment of your time? I have a bit of a problem.'\
\
The guard seems reticent to share her secret.\
\
'It's, well, promise you won't laugh, will you?'\
\
She leans in close to whisper something to you.\
\
'It's the little spirits. Spirits of the dead. They've been coming after our patrols, throwing stones at our helmets, knocking our legs when we're not looking. It's bad for morale. Some of the guards are scared to patrol now, for fear the spirits will get more violent and do worse.\
\
'I've been leaving food for them, little offerings over the past few weeks. It seems to have mollified them. But now I've been stationed here and I'm not to leave or go on patrols for a fortnight or more. I'm worried the spirits will start growing agitated. Could you leave food for them, in my stead?\
\
'I know it seems a mite odd, but things have gotten more peaceful in the past few weeks. I can mark the locations down for you. Can you help?'","'Thank you. I know it seems strange, but I really do think the food helps. And anyway, someone is eating a little better because of us.'","Leave food offerings near Nishabêt (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Left food offerings near Nishabêt (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8096]={"You discovered an object which by all appearances belongs to a child, though it does not seem to be Dunlending in nature.","Talk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair","This appears to belong to a child, though it does not seem to be of the Dunlendings. Perhaps one of the Rangers of the Grey Company may be able to unravel the mystery.","'You were right to bring this to me, ${PLAYER}! This belongs to no child, much less a Dunlending. This most certainly belongs to a hobbit!\
\
'The mystery, I'm afraid, has deepened.'","Pequeñas maravillas","There are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens.\
\
You should bring the object you found to the Rangers of the Grey Company. Perhaps they will be able to unravel the mystery."},
[8101]={"'¿Ah, sí? ¿Fuegos artificiales para Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón, dices? Casi me alegra poder decirte que no me quedan ni fuegos artificiales ni los ingredientes para hacerlos. La verdad es que preparé un lote hace poco, ¡pero me lo robaron! Y los Fronteros no han sido de mucha ayuda para recuperarlo, con todo el respeto.\
\
'Si Lobelia quiere realmente fuegos artificiales para su fiesta, tendrá que hacer muchas compras. Hay que comprar carbón, salitre, azufre y limaduras de hierro, entre otras cosas. Así que vuelve con Lobelia y asegúrate de que está dispuesta a pagar por todo esto.\
\
'Si todavía los quiere, vuelve aquí y te diré todo lo que tienes que hacer.'","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está organizando una fiesta de cumpleaños para ella misma lo suficientemente grandiosa como para eclipsar la de Bilbo Bolsón varios años antes. Quiere fuegos artificiales dignos de sus esfuerzos.","'¡No pensaba que Lobelia realmente quisiera pagarlos!'","'Pero ten cuidado, ni se te ocurra robar alguna de esas monedas. Te tengo vigilado, y también vigilaré a esa Tuk. Encuéntrala en su casa, al oeste de los Grandes Smials, en Alforzaburgo.'","'Probablemente Lobelia no querrá pagar por los ingredientes. A mí no me importa en absoluto. Ve a decírselo a ella, a Bolsón Cerrado.'","Hyacinth Tuk está en Alforzaburgo, al oeste de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón ha oído que Hyacinth Tuk sabe hacer fuegos artificiales y te ha pedido que le hagas un pedido de los más grandes y brillantes.","Los fuegos artificiales de Lobelia","'¡Tú, ahí! Sí, me refiero a ti. Ven aquí. Tengo trabajo para ti.\
\
'Simplemente debo tener fuegos artificiales para mi fiesta de cumpleaños. ¡Más y más brillantes que los que tuvo ese loco de Bilbo! He oído que Hyacinth Tuk, en Alforzaburgo, ha aprendido a hacerlos, sin duda de ese extraño tipo llamado Gandalf. Ve allí y dile que quiero una docena de grandes cajas de sus mejores fuegos artificiales. Vive al oeste de los Grandes Smials.\
\
'Por supuesto, te pagaré si insistes. Qué molestia. Pensé que los Fronteros --o lo que sea que seas-- debían ayudarnos a nosotros, los habitantes de la Comarca, por deber.'","'¿Y bien? No te pago para que te quedes ahí ${PLAYERNAME:parado[m]|parada[f]}, ¿sabes? ¡Date prisa y ve a ver a esa Hyacinth Tuk y consigue esos fuegos artificiales! Vive en Alforzaburgo, al oeste de los Grandes Smials!'","Lleva la bolsa de monedas a Hyacinth Tuk","'¿Pagar por los ingredientes? ¡De ninguna manera...!\
\
'Oh, supongo que tendré que hacerlo, si le han robado todo su stock... Toma, lleva estas monedas a esa Tuk. ¡Más le vale preparar los mejores fuegos artificiales que haya visto la Comarca!'","'¿Así que la vieja urraca ha terminado pagando? Estoy asombrado. Debe de querer mucho esos fuegos artificiales.\
\
'Bueno, voy a ver qué puedo hacer.'","Hyacinth Tuk está al oeste de los Grandes Smials, en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Hyacinth Tuk te ha pedido que vuelvas a ver a Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón para exigirle el pago de los ingredientes para hacer sus fuegos artificiales. Lobelia ha accedido a regañadientes y te ha dado una bolsa de monedas para que se la lleves a Hyacinth.","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está en su casa de Bolsón Cerrado, en Hobbiton.\
\
Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón te ha pedido que hagas un pedido de fuegos artificiales a Hyacinth Tuk, pero Hyacinth te ha informado de que no le quedan ni fuegos artificiales ni los materiales para hacerlos. Te ha dicho que vuelvas a Hobbiton y te asegures de que Lobelia tendrá que pagar por los materiales, si todavía quiere fuegos artificiales."},
[8102]={"'¿Por qué sigues ahí ${PLAYERNAME:parado[m]|parada[f]}? ¡Ve a decirle a Holly que su tarta estaba estropeada! ¡Exijo otra!'","Recoge la tarta","Evita a los hobbits hambrientos","La tarta de Lobelia","'¿Qué? ¿Que mi tarta estaba estropeada? ¡Qué grosería! Déjame probar la que estoy preparando ahora...\
\
'¡Estas bayas están malas! Oh, no, oh, no. ¿Sabes cuántas tartas he preparado con estas bayas?'\
\
'Tengo que ponerme a preparar nuevas tartas para toda esa gente. No tengo tiempo para hablar ahora, pero me alegro de que hayas descubierto esto por mí. Ah, y si te encuentras con alguna de las tartas que he enviado, tráemelas, por favor. Diles que les prepararé una tarta fresca tan pronto como pueda. ¡Simplemente no puedo permitir que la gente coma tartas estropeadas!'","'La tarta para la fiesta de Lobelia está ahí, sobre la mesa. Recógela y llévasela a Opal Buenavista al Campo de la fiesta. Y date prisa, ¡mis tartas deben entregarse calientes!\
\
'¡No olvides que ningún hobbit hambriento debe oler la tarta, no quiero que vengan a molestarme para pedirme una porción!'","Opal Buenavista está en el Campo de la fiesta, al norte de Hobbiton y al sur de Bolsón Cerrado.\
\
Cuando volviste de entregar una tarta al Dragón Verde, Holly Corneta tenía otra tarea de entrega esperándote: te ha pedido que lleves la tarta que preparó para la fiesta de cumpleaños de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón a Opal Buenavista en el Campo de la fiesta de Hobbiton, al sur de Bolsón Cerrado y al norte del pueblo. Asegúrate de que ningún hobbit hambriento huela la tarta, o vendrán a molestar a Holly para que les dé una porción.","Opal Buenavista, que está ayudando a organizar la próxima fiesta de Lobelia, ha estado molestando a Holly Corneta para que le entregue una tarta para la fiesta.","Un hobbit hambriento ha olido la tarta","Holly Corneta se encuentra al norte de la plaza principal de Hobbiton y al sur del Campo de la fiesta.\
\
Cuando entregaste la tarta a Opal Buenavista, ella la probó y descubrió que sabía horrible. Le exigió a Holly Corneta que le preparara otra. Deberías volver con Holly enseguida.","'¡Oh, cielos! ¡No puedo creer que no me haya dado cuenta de las bayas podridas!'","'Si encuentras otras tartas que he preparado, tráemelas por favor.'","'Hace algún tiempo que Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón molesta a todo el mundo con su fiesta, pero al parecer eso no le basta, así que ha traído a otra hobbit, Opal Buenavista, para que la ayude.\
\
'La pobre Opal está tan acosada por Lobelia que se enfada con todo el mundo. Ha estado detrás de mí para que le prepare una tarta, pero como no me gusta mucho Lobelia, lo he ido posponiendo. Pero ya no podía posponerlo más, así que hoy he preparado la tarta que quería.\
\
'La tarta está enfriándose en la mesa de allá. Llévasela a Opal al Campo de la fiesta, pero recuerda: aunque esta tarta es para Lobelia, ¡debe estar caliente cuando se la entregues! Manténla alejada de esos hobbits hambrientos... ¡No quiero que me molesten!'"},
[8109]={"Repair the squeaky chairs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Repaired the ladder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gladion's dark gaze lightens as he takes in the sight of you, and while his clever smile pushes away some of the weariness on his face, you can't help but notice he's aged years in the weeks since last you saw him.\
\
He greets you with the same words he did the last time you walked up this road.\
\
'Ho there, traveller! You look as if you are in need of a meal and a place to put up your feet.\
\
'You are welcome to take respite and break bread with us tonight, and in exchange we ask for a day's work on our farm. Limril will be pleased to see you, and her cooking has only improved since your last visit.'","'Thank you, friend. Normally I pick stones on Sunday. It'll be nice to have some of that time back for myself.\
\
'What was it you said to me last time? That your life is one for travelling? Be that as it may, know you are always welcome around here, even if it is for a short rest.'","Pick stones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tell Gladion you will help him with his work","Gladion asks you to fix some creaky chairs and a broken ladder","Repaired squeaky chairs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gladion's farm is in northern Lamedon.\
\
Repair damaged furniture at Gladion's farm.","Lodging for Another Day's Labour","Gladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should return to Gladion.","Ask Gladion what else he needs","'You are as fast as I remember, ${PLAYER}. Now, while we do not need help harvesting, we do need help with weeding and picking stones.'","'So, you will stay? I am very glad to hear that, very glad indeed. Now, this may sound familiar to you, but there are some squeaky chairs that Limril will not let back into the house until they are repaired, and also a ladder with a broken rung.\
\
'No, no. Not the same chairs as last time nor is it the same rung on the ladder. Your repairs held up.'","Malas hierbas arrancadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Arranca las malas hierbas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gladion, a farmer of northern Lamedon, has offered you familiar exchange: a night of lodging and hospitality for a day's labour on his farm.","Repair the broken ladder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Picked stones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Gladion","Weeds and stones can be found on Gladion's family's farmland.\
\
Pick weeds and stones from Gladion's farmland.","Gladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon.\
\
Speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.","He asks you to remove weeds and stones from the farmland"},
[8110]={"'So you are interested in helping out? That is excellent. There are some squeaky chairs that Limril will not let back into the house until they are repaired, and also a ladder with a broken rung. I do not want anyone getting hurt.'","Gladion, a farmer of northern Lamedon, has offered you a night of lodging and hospitality in exchange for a day's labour on his farm.","Lodging for a Day's Labour","Repair the squeaky chairs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Repaired the ladder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should harvest the wheat and cabbages, and carry the carrot-crate to the waggon bound for Calembel","'Ah! Well done, friend. You have good arms and a strong back for this sort of work. Our village could use you, you know. It is a good life here in Lamedon.'\
\
You politely tell Gladion that your life is one for travelling, not sitting still.\
\
'A shame, ${PLAYER}. But that is well. You shall sit still tonight, at my wife's table! You will have a good rest this night.'","The wheat and cabbages can be harvested from the fields at Gladion's farmstead. The crate of carrots is on Gladion's farm, and should be carried to the Calembel-bound waggon in the centre of the village.\
\
You should harvest the crops and carry the carrots to the waggon.","Tell Gladion you will help him with his work","Gladion asks you to fix some creaky chairs and a broken ladder","Gladion's farm is in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should repair damaged furniture at Gladion's farm.","Collect the carrots for delivery (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.","'That was fast! Thank you for the help, ${PLAYER}. Now, if you would be so good as to help with the harvest. The wheat and cabbages are ready for picking, and the carrots need to be brought to the waggon bound to Calembel.'","'Ho there, traveller! You look as if you are in need of a meal, and a place to put up your feet. You have a wholesome look about you.\
\
'You are welcome to take respite and break bread with us tonight, and in exchange we ask for a day's work on our farm. I am Gladion, and Limril my wife is a fine cook.'","Harvested wheat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Delivered the carrots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Repaired a squeaky chair (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pick cabbages (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should return to Gladion.","Ask Gladion what else he needs","Picked a cabbage (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Harvest wheat from the fields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Repair the broken ladder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Gladion"},
[8111]={"Poppy Silleras está en Ost Forod, al oeste de Nan Orngon.\
\
Poppy Silleras se alegrará de ver toda la leña que has recogido.","Recolecta troncos secos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Troncos para el fuego","Troncos secos recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las mantas no son lo único que te mantiene caliente en invierno. Un buen fuego rugiente es igual de importante. Pero para mantenerlo encendido necesitas leña... mucha y bien seca.\
\
'Nuestras reservas están bajas este invierno. Con la gente marchándose para unirse a los saqueadores de tumbas, nos quedan menos personas honestas para hacer el trabajo necesario y prepararnos para el invierno. Hemos tenido que centrar a todos en la comida. La pila de leña se ha quedado muy escasa.\
\
'La mejor leña se encuentra cerca de Nan Orngon. Los osos la desentierran mientras buscan larvas. Está seca, pero arde durante mucho tiempo. Si pudieras recoger un montón de ramas, nos sería de gran ayuda.'","Se pueden encontrar troncos secos alrededor de Nan Orngon. Los osos los desentierran cuando buscan larvas.","Nan Orngon está al este de Ost Forod.\
\
Poppy Silleras te ha pedido que te aventures en Nan Orngon y recojas troncos secos.","Lleva troncos secos a Poppy Silleras en Ost Forod","'Si no tenemos leña para los fuegos, el invierno acabará siendo muy corto para la mayoría de nosotros.'","'Aún necesitaremos recoger más leña para poder pasar el invierno, pero es agradable ver crecer la pila de leña por primera vez en mucho tiempo.'"},
[8112]={"You should find Kyrstig and help investigate the Houses of Rest.","'${PLAYER}! Tell me everything! Are the Houses of Rest free of evil?'\
\
You tell Ausma of Loknashra's return, the unnatural animation of the dwarf-lords, Vethúg Wintermind's resurrection as a wight, and Loknashra's ultimate defeat.\
\
'By the Valar! You were just in time to prevent a catastrophe! I am filled with amazement that you were able to defeat the newly-risen Vethúg Wintermind with so few! I am concerned to hear that Loknashra escaped, but she and Drugoth will need time to regain their power. They are certain to be off the table for the remainder of this war. For now, our top priority must be the defeat of Hrímil Frost-heart. One of us will send for you when we are ready to strike at the dragon's lair!'","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","Kyrstig has sent word that the mysterious Loknashra has been spotted in the Pit of Stonejaws. Scout-master Ausma has asked you to investigate right away.","Talk to Kyrstig in Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest","Loknashra's Return","'${PLAYER}! Did Ausma send you to assist me? Good. To be frank, I was afraid to go in there alone! This place was pretty quiet when last I scouted these tombs, but there has been a flurry of activity here of late. And it's not the Angmarim, it's the hobgoblins! If I had to venture a guess, I would say Loknashra has taken leadership of the hobgoblins that were spared the control of the Dragon Voice, and has sent them to the tombs. Hórin did say she swore revenge on everyone, right? I think they might be eager to turn our resting ancestors into their foot-soldiers!\
\
'We have no other option but to go in there and stop her. It would take too long to wait for reinforcements. You're coming with me, right?'","You should seek out the entrance to Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest.","Ausma is waiting for your report.","'${PLAYER}! I have urgent news: Loknashra has been spotted in the Pit of Stonejaws!\
\
'I have had my scouts keep an eye out for her after she disappeared from the Welkin-lofts, clearly changed from that Angmarim ritual you and Hórin beheld. She had completely vanished from Gundabad, until now! Kyrstig has just sent word that there is new activity in the Houses of Rest, and she witnessed the hobgoblins there first-hand! I want you to go to the Pit of Stonejaws and meet her outside the Houses of Rest. Investigate them with her. I have a feeling that Loknashra has returned to enact her vengeance upon us, and we must put an end to her plan before it is too late! Go, find Kyrstig with haste!'","Complete Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, on any difficulty","Talk to Kyrstig near the Houses of Rest","'${PLAYER}! I have urgent news: Loknashra has been spotted in the Pit of Stonejaws!\
\
'I have had my scouts keep an eye out for her after she disappeared from the Welkin-lofts, clearly changed from that Angmarim ritual you and Hórin beheld. She had completely vanished from Gundabad, until now! Kyrstig has just sent word that there is new activity in the Houses of Rest, and she witnessed hobgoblins there first-hand! I want you to go with her and investigate the Houses of Rest. I have a feeling that Loknashra has returned to enact her vengeance upon us, and we must put an end to her plan before it is too late! Go, find Kyrstig with haste!'","You should complete Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, on any difficulty.","'We really were just in time, ${PLAYER}! Can you imagine if the newly-restored Vethúg Wintermind was permitted to wreak havoc on our forces? The war would have been over... and not in our favour! It is a pity Loknashra escaped, but I don't think we'll see her again anytime soon. I hope not, anyway.\
\
'You should return to Ausma and tell her what happened. I will stay here for now and make sure we didn't miss any wights or hobgoblins. And please thank her for sending you my way. I wouldn't have been able to do this without you!'","Complete 'Discovery: Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest'","You should report to Kyrstig at once."},
[8113]={"Londrandir, un Elfo del refugio de Lin Giliath, ha venido a Amon Raith en busca de la ayuda de los Montaraces para un pequeño asunto.","Mensaje de Londrandir","Londrandir está en la granja de Gatson en la Dehesa del Rey.\
\
Deberías hablar con Londrandir.","'Tuvimos suerte de que este Elfo pasara por aquí cuando lo hizo, y suerte de que tú también vinieras. Ojalá pudiéramos hacer algo para ayudarle en agradecimiento, pero no podemos abandonar nuestra granja.\
\
Quizá podrías hablar con él, si deseas ayudar.'","Lachenn y Aglardir están en Lin Giliath en Meluinen, al sur de Esteldín.\
\
Como está claro que los Montaraces tienen sus propias cargas, Londrandir te ha pedido que viajes al este para hablar con Lachenn, el Maestro de Lin Giliath. Si Lachenn no está disponible, te indicó que hablaras con Aglardir.","'Vi orcos cuando pasé por aquí y no pude ignorarlos. Me alegro de haber llegado a tiempo para salvar a estos hombres.\
\
Vine en busca de ayuda en nombre de Lachenn, el Maestro de Lin Giliath, un pequeño refugio de mi gente en la tierra fértil de Meluinen. Es algo pequeño, no más que un leve indicio de un mal viento. Los Montaraces no están en posición de enviar a alguien a Lachenn, pero ¿quizá tú podrías ir?\
\
Viaja al sur; Lin Giliath está muy cerca de la frontera de Meluinen. Si Lachenn no puede hablar contigo, habla con Aglardir en su lugar.'","'¿Londrandir te envió a hablar con Lachenn? Entonces has llegado demasiado tarde.\
\
Lachenn está muerto. Fue asesinado cuando los trolls de piedra atacaron Lin Giliath, poco antes de que llegara mi compañía.'","Habla con Lachenn o Aglardir en Meluinen"},
[8118]={"Encuentra una colmena salvaje antes de que se seque el ungüento","'Siempre tan amable.'","'¡Será mejor que encuentres una nueva colmena para Polo!'","'Mi ungüento está listo para ti, querida, cuando quieras. Pero recuerda que solo durará unos minutos antes de perder su efecto, ¡así que será mejor que te apresures a volver y encontrar una colmena para el granjero Ganapié!\
\
'Espero que encuentres colmenas en el bosque al sureste de Alforzaburgo. Encuentra una grande para Polo y llévasela a su pradera cercana.\
\
'Ahora bien, si llevas una colmena delicada contigo, puede que no seas capaz de defenderte de los osos u otros animales que puedan sentirse atraídos por la colmena, así que anda con cuidado!'","Larga vida a la reina","'¡Gracias por haberte ocupado de esos osos mieleros!'","Polo Ganapié quisiera tomarse un momento para agradecerte tus esfuerzos.","'Será mejor que te apresures a encontrar una de esas colmenas salvajes antes de que se seque el ungüento que llevas. Mira al sureste, entre todos los osos, ¡y ten cuidado!'","El granjero Ganapié guarda sus colmenas en la pradera al sureste de Alforzaburgo. Las colmenas salvajes que buscas están en una zona infestada de osos más al sureste, más allá de la pradera. \
\
El granjero Ganapié te envió a Gammer Boffin en Sobrecolina para que consiguieras un ungüento que alejara a las abejas, para que pudieras recoger una colmena para él. Gammer Boffin te advirtió de que el ungüento no duraría mucho, así que tendrás que recoger la colmena lo antes posible y llevársela a Polo Ganapié.","'Las nuevas reinas funcionan muy bien... aunque mis abejas están un poco inquietas.'","'Creo que necesito hablar con Gammer Boffin para conseguir más ungüento.'","'Esa nueva colmena servirá perfectamente. Solo voy a dejar que las abejas se acostumbren a su nuevo hogar.\
\
'¡Mientras tanto, toma esta recompensa, te la mereces!'","Polo Ganapié necesita nuevas reinas para sus colmenas para reemplazar a las que fueron asesinadas por los osos mieleros.","'Estoy seguro de que Polo Ganapié está contento con la colmena que le has traído.'"},
[8119]={"Reúnete con Prestadír fuera de las ruinas de Eitheldir, al norte de Tornhad","Ravaedron se encuentra en Tornhad, el campamento de los montaraces al sur de Eitheldir.","'Te agradezco de nuevo que me hayas escuchado, ${PLAYER}. No alcanzo a comprender la carga que Ravaedron debe de sentir al caminar por estas tierras. Deseo que abandone estas costas y halle la paz que su corazón merece. Espero que sientas lo mismo y le ayudes a lograrlo.\
\
'Regresemos ahora a Tornhad.'","'Estos Dúnedain siempre han ido adonde les placía, y Prestadír me dice que pronto partirán en una de sus misiones. ¿Cómo protegerán a los Astaciervo si pretenden abandonar el Ángulo y cruzar las montañas?\
\
'¿Debería cambiar mis planes? ¿Acaso no debería viajar a los Puertos Grises para partir de la Tierra Media?'","A Ravaedron le disgusta que muchos montaraces planeen partir con un propósito misterioso en las próximas semanas, y Prestadír intenta tranquilizarlo.","El montaraz Prestadír se encuentra en Tornhad, intentando calmar las preocupaciones de Ravaedron.","Habla con Ravaedron en Tornhad","'Empecemos, pues, y mantengámonos alerta ante cualquier cosa que pueda amenazar la seguridad de Tornhad y su gente.'","Habla con Prestadír en Tornhad","Prestadír espera pacientemente tu llegada","'${PLAYER:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]}, ${PLAYER}. Mientras Prestadír y tú estabais fuera, otros de su pueblo me han asegurado que vigilarán a los Astaciervo cuando yo me haya ido. Así que no hay problema.\
\
'¿De qué habéis hablado mientras estabais fuera?'","'¿Debería quedarme después de todo? ¿Tendrá Híthrochon que marcharse sin mí?'","'Regresemos ahora a Tornhad.'","Prestadír está fuera de las ruinas de Eitheldir, al norte de Tornhad.","Habla con Prestadír fuera de las ruinas de Eitheldir","Prestadír te ha pedido que te reúnas con él fuera de las ruinas de Eitheldir, al norte de Tornhad.","'Ahora que tengo tu atención, ${PLAYER}, hay algo que me gustaría tratar. Reunámonos cerca de Eitheldir, al norte, y hablaremos mientras realizo mi última patrulla del día.'","'Gracias por venir, ${PLAYER}. Los Dúnedain protegemos desde hace mucho a quienes moran en los confines de las tierras salvajes, pero no podríamos hacerlo si nuestros corazones estuvieran inquietos. Nuestras propias familias residen en el Ángulo del Mitheithel y, si tenemos la certeza de que viven a salvo, nos resulta más sencillo cumplir con nuestro juramento.\
\
'Por eso los Dúnedain enviamos patrullas como esta en los bordes del Mitheithel y en los accesos a Tornhad. En tiempos de peligro, la aldea puede ser evacuada y trasladamos a nuestras familias a diversas cuevas en las colinas periféricas. Ha ocurrido con más frecuencia en los últimos años: un cambio poco grato en cada ocasión, pero necesario. Es motivo de tristeza para los veteranos y una distracción amena para los niños, pero para mí justifica nuestra cautela.\
\
'¿Qué me dices? ¿Patrullarás estas ruinas conmigo?'","'Se lo dije a Ravaedron en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero así es: a algunos de los míos y a mí se nos ha encomendado investigar ciertos rumores que llegan del Bosque Negro. Partiremos pronto y no podemos prometerle lo que nos pide.\
\
'Los Dúnedain hemos prestado juramento ante Aragorn, nuestro capitán, y ninguno de nosotros quebrantaría ese juramento, ni siquiera por un amigo tan querido como Ravaedron. Él lo sabe, por lo que sospecho que este numerito es para que tú lo veas, ${PLAYER}.'\
\
Prestadír se vuelve de nuevo hacia Ravaedron.\
\
'No cambies ninguno de tus planes, amigo mío. No todos los Dúnedain me acompañarán en esta misión, y muchos de los nuestros se quedarán aquí, en Tornhad. Ellos velarán por la seguridad del leñador y de su familia. ¡Habla con Mithrendan y Angwedh y verás que es cierto!\
\
'Pero contigo, ${PLAYER}, ahora que tengo tu atención, hay algo que me gustaría tratar. Reunámonos cerca de Eitheldir, al norte, y hablaremos mientras realizo mi última patrulla del día.'","Habla con Prestadír y patrulla las ruinas de Eitheldir","'Por aquí, ${PLAYERNAME:mi nuevo amigo[m]|mi nueva amiga[f]}.'","Recuerdos lejanos"},
[8120]={"'Traerás esperanza a mis hermanos con tus actos de valentía.'","Una justicia bien tardía","Derrota a los Caciques créoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aprentices y discípulos créoth vencidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El deseo de Dannasen de vengarse de los Montañeses del Rhudaur es compartido por Emelin, el líder de las sombras de Arthedain que habitan en el pantano del sur.","Emelin reside con sus hermanos en la región más al sur de Harloeg.\
\
Te enviaron a destruir a los Montañeses del Rhudaur que habitan en Garth Agarwen. Tu victoria no fue completa, pero asestaste un golpe contundente contra los Montañeses. Emelin debería ser informado de tus esfuerzos.","Caciques créoth vencidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los vigilantes créoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Habla ahora con Emelin en Harloeg.'","'Los Montañeses eran traidores en mi época, y aún lo son.'","Vigilantes créoth vencidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'${PLAYER}, una vez más me animas a retomar mi lucha contra la Doncella Roja. Para encontrar el descanso, debemos redimir a la Doncella Roja o destruirla. Me gustaría verla redimida, pero mientras estos hombres continúen con sus ritos sangrientos, eso no será posible.'","'Has llevado a cabo nuestra venganza contra los Montañeses. Te debemos nuestra gratitud.'","Derrota a los aprendices y discípulos créoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'En años pasados, los Angmarim y los Montañeses del Rhudaur hicieron la guerra al Reino de Arthedain, mi pueblo. Fue una guerra injusta y la causa de mucho derramamiento de sangre innecesario, pero los Montañeses adoraban al Rey Brujo de Angmar y hacían todo lo que él les ordenaba. Así fue como hicieron sacrificios a su nombre y profanaron la tierra hasta que las aguas parecieron sangre.\
\
'Y así surgió la Dama Roja. No sabíamos qué era ni qué había sido. Muchos incluso entre los Montañeses huyeron ante la criatura, pero muchos otros permanecieron y la adoraron.\
\
'Los Montañeses causaron que esta criatura viniera a existir, y también nuestra maldición. La justicia se ha retrasado demasiado. Destrúyelos, y cumpliremos nuestra maldición. Ellos custodian Garth Agarwen, la fortaleza de la Doncella Roja en el noreste de Agamaur.'","Los Montañeses del Rhudaur ocupan las antiguas ruinas llamadas Garth Agarwen, al noreste de Agamaur. Los seguidores siguen a la Doncella Roja, pero no son verdaderamente Montañeses; provienen de los Créoth siniestros, aprendices créoth y discípulos créoth. Los devotos provienen de los Créoth devotos y los Créoth vigilantes, y los maestros, de los caciques créoth.\
\
El espectro te explicó que fueron ellos quienes dieron vida a la Dama Roja, una criatura malvada de gran poder, y que de alguna manera también son responsables de la maldición que mantiene a las sombras de Arthedain en la Tierra Media. Te ha pedido que destruyas a los Montañeses, lo que les permitirá a él y a sus hermanos cumplir su maldición."},
[8121]={"Ramdir has one request before he prevails upon Hestil to get her band of adventurers moving: he wishes to see the Argonath.","Talk to Ramdir beneath the shadow of the Argonath","'Behold the Pillars of the Kings, ${PLAYER}. I wish I had the words to explain to you what I am feeling, but I simply do not. Isildur. Anárion. It is... overwhelming.\
\
'The Wardens of Minas Ithil have long fought on in the memory of the Tower of the Moon, though it has been lost to the Enemy for so many years. It is called Minas Morgul now, and those of us who remember what it once stood for are few. Many of my fellows abandoned the cause, because it seemed impossible to go on. They said we toiled for naught.\
\
'Would they think so if they could stand where I stand now and gaze upon these likenesses of Isildur and Anárion? They are a reminder, ${PLAYER}, that the works of Men will last, that the spirit of Man cannot be crushed, despite adversity and the passage of time. Even the Orcs cannot tear them down, and if they sought to, my heart sings that Men would take the pieces and build them anew.'","'Before I prevail upon Hestil to get her band of adventurers moving, I have a request, ${PLAYER}. I wish to see the Argonath. The Pillars of the Kings stand in the cliffs north of here.\
\
'It would mean a great deal to me to see them. I will meet you in their shadow, ${PLAYER}, and we will speak again.'","'I will meet you north of here, in the shadow of the Argonath. I wish to gaze upon the Pillars of the Kings.'","Ramdir wants to speak with you in the shadow of the Argonath, north along the Anduin.\
\
Ramdir has wanted to gaze upon the Pillars of the Kings for many years, and he has asked to meet you at a place where he has a good vantage point of them.","Long-awaited Sight"},
[8122]={"'Las cosas han sido difíciles con solo Alwin y yo cuidando de la granja y esos orcos por todas partes. Lo siento por pensar que eras un poco ${PLAYERNAME:sospechoso[m]|sospechosa[f]} cuando llegaste por primera vez.''","'Buen trabajo guiando al becerro. Hazle saber a Gilmar que has vuelto, ha estado preocupado desde que te fuiste.'","Los becerros de uro se encuentran entre el pequeño rebaño al sureste de la granja de Gatson.\
\
Gilmar, el ayudante de Gatson, te ha pedido que elijas un becerro de uro del rebaño local y lo lleves a su pasto.","El joven uro muge lastimosamente y corre delante de ti.","Gilmar ha vuelto a la granja de Gatson.\
\
Has llevado el becerro de uro al pasto de Gatson, ahora deberías regresar con Gilmar para contarle tu éxito.","'Supongo que me equivoqué contigo. Has hecho un buen trabajo, duro trabajo.'","'Ah, es cierto que las incursiones de orcos han reducido el rebaño a casi nada. Un becerro de uro ayudaría mucho a recuperarlo.'","'En una granja todos deben aportar, incluso los forasteros elegantes del sur. Aquí estamos ocupados con la cosecha y preocupados por esos orcos cercanos.\
\
De cualquier modo, el pequeño rebaño de Gatson necesita sangre nueva. Los uros salvajes serían perfectos, pero los machos son demasiado agresivos para llevarlos al pasto. Así que quiero que elijas un buen becerro del rebaño salvaje que está al sureste.\
\
Un uro joven debería ser bastante dócil... no te interpongas entre los machos y todo irá bien. Ah, y últimamente he visto algunos orcos por ahí, así que ten cuidado también, ¿me oyes?'","'Un becerro de uro es justo lo que necesitamos para revivir el rebaño. Vi un rebaño salvaje con un becerro el otro día, justo detrás de la colina.'","'¡Buen trabajo, muy buen trabajo! Gracias por tu ayuda con ese uro. El maestro Gatson me pidió que te diera este pequeño pago por tu trabajo.'","Has escoltado al becerro de uro a un lugar seguro","'Si quieres demostrar tu valía por aquí, ¿me traerás ese uro? Muchas gracias.'","Cuernos largos","'Los becerros se asustan fácilmente. Es mejor mantenerlo en un lugar tranquilo. Pero no te preocupes, pronto estará corriendo por ahí.'","Encuentra un becerro de uro","Gilmar, el ayudante del granjero Gatson, dice que se necesita sangre nueva para el rebaño. Un toro de uro sería ideal, pero los toros salvajes son demasiado agresivos para llevarlos al pasto. Gilmar te ha pedido que consigas un becerro en su lugar."},
[8123]={"'It is a worthwhile trade! I am glad you agree. This is all I have though. Perhaps I will acquire more Motes soon!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will remove 15 Marks of the Longbeards.</rgb>","Longbeard Marks for Motes","The Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster has a small quantity of Motes available.","Talk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster to trade Longbeard Marks for Motes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","Talk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster","'If you are looking for Motes, I have just a few. I would be willing to part with them if you have any Marks of the Longbeards.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>"},
