<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","Talk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster","'It is a worthwhile trade! I am glad you agree. This is all I have though. Perhaps I will acquire more Motes soon!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will remove 20 Marks of the Longbeards.</rgb>"},
[8125]={"${CLASS},\
\
Si esta carta llega a alguien, que venga al Bosque de los Trolls y encuentre el campamento improvisado que estoy compartiendo con un elfo engreído. ¡Y todo porque uno de los nuestros se perdió mientras avanzábamos hacia el este!\
\
El campamento está al sureste del Último Puente, asentado en una elevación rodeada de piedras lisas.\
\
Heithur Puñohierro","Barbiluengos en Apuros","Descubriste una carta escrita por un enano que decía haberse separado de un amigo en las tierras salvajes del Bosque de los Trolls.","El campamento mencionado en el mensaje se encuentra al sureste del Último Puente, a poca distancia del camino. Verás colinas que se alzan de forma abrupta y un pequeño risco rodeado de piedras a modo de pilares. Heithur debe estar allí.\
\
Un enano, Heithur Puñohierro, envió un mensaje a cualquier alma dispuesta a acudir en su ayuda en el Bosque de los Trolls.","'Desconfiaré de ti por un tiempo, desde luego, pero parece que encontraste mi carta y has venido a ayudar. Si quieres ganarte un poco de mi confianza, habla con el elfo.\
\
'No me agradan demasiado, pero este empieza a caerme bien cuanto más tiempo paso aquí con él.\
\
'Oh... gracias por venir.'","Habla con Heithur Puñohierro en el Bosque de los Trolls"},
[8126]={"'Ahora podemos quemar todo esto. Que sea la única hoguera que el Enemigo vea esta noche.'","Arcos largos recogidos de Tham Laegamon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tham Laegamon está al suroeste del campamento de los Montaraces en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Rodlam te ha pedido que te aventures en Tham Laegamon y recojas los arcos largos de los saqueadores de tumbas que hay allí.","Arcos largos de Tham Laegamon","Rodlam está en el campamento de los Montaraces en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Rodlam querrá ver los arcos largos que recogiste en Tham Laegamon.","'Si al menos podemos movernos durante la noche, empezaremos a avanzar por el Camino de los Reyes.'","Lleva los arcos largos a Rodlam","Tham Laegamon es una ruina que domina el Camino de los Reyes y la entrada a la ciudad de Annúminas.","Recoge arcos largos de Tham Laegamon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Al igual que los saqueadores de tumbas de Tham Sarch, los que acampan en Tham Laegamon también están alertando a Angmar de nuestras actividades, pero de una manera diferente.\
\
'Portan arcos largos con los que nos disparan flechas incendiarias. Eso les permite rastrearnos en la noche y nos impide acercarnos en sigilo. Nos causa muchas dificultades.\
\
'Me gustaría que les quitaras los arcos largos. Si no podemos movernos libremente por el Camino de los Reyes, no podemos avanzar... y debemos avanzar.'"},
[8127]={"Longo Madriguera está en su granja en el Camino de Cepeda, al este de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Muy preocupada por la desaparición de su primo, Esilia Tuk te ha pedido que hables con Longo Madriguera para saber si ha visto a Gerebert.","Esilia Tuk descubrió en el diario de su primo que Gerebert fue retado a esconderse en el carro de un granjero local de hierba de pipa, Longo Madriguera, mientras se dirigía hacia el este. Está cada vez más preocupada, ya que la entrada en el diario fue escrita hace algún tiempo y la granja de Longo Madriguera no está tan lejos.","'¿Qué? ¿Vienes a hablarme de un tonto de los Tuk? Bueno. Puede que lo haya visto, pero no te voy a contar lo que he visto por nada. No, primero vas a tener que hacerme un favor.'","El carro de hojas de Longo","'Oh, cielos. Bueno, parece que Gerebert se ha metido en un buen lío. La última entrada en su diario dice que nuestro tonto primo Pippin lo retó a esconderse en uno de los carros de Longo Madriguera que iba hacia el este. Lo más extraño es que esto fue escrito hace algún tiempo -- Pippin ha estado fuera en Hobbiton -- y la granja de Longo no está tan lejos.\
\
'Hmm, tal vez deberías hablar con Longo para ver si ha visto a Gerebert. La granja de Longo está en el Camino de Cepeda al este de Alforzaburgo.\
\
'¡Cuanto más pienso en esto, más preocupado estoy por el pobre Gerebert!'","'¿Has encontrado a Gerebert? ¡Por favor, encuéntralo!'"},
[8128]={"Rollo Boffin se encuentra en el centro de Casa del Bosque.\
\
En la clara del Camino de Cepeda, encontraste un carro abandonado. Tu examen del carro reveló que una vez transportó hierba de pipa, pero toda la hierba de pipa fue retirada y llevada al sur.","El carro de Longo podría estar en la clara del Camino de Cepeda, justo al oeste de Casa del Bosque, junto al Puente del Pozo.\
\
Rollo Boffin no tenía ninguna información específica sobre Gerebert Tuk, pero ahora se pregunta si la desaparición de Gerebert y la del carro de Longo Madriguera están conectadas de alguna manera. Te ha pedido que vayas a buscar en una clara cerca del Camino de Cepeda cualquier señal del carro desaparecido.","'Muy curioso. ¿Dices que este carro abandonado tenía una rueda más pequeña que las otras? Eso suena como uno de los carros de Longo. Le advertí que no era seguro, pero no quiso escucharme.\
\
'Bueno, supongo que la única forma de averiguar qué fue de esa hoja, y quizás de Gerebert Tuk, es seguir el rastro de hojas hacia el sur.'","'Hace un tiempo esperaba la llegada de uno de los carros de Longo Madriguera, pero el tonto nunca apareció. Envié un mensaje a Longo, pero nunca respondió. En ese momento, supuse que nunca había enviado el carro o que no le importaba, pero ahora me haces dudar.\
\
'Hay una clara al norte del Camino de Cepeda donde los carros se detienen ocasionalmente. Está justo al oeste de Casa del Bosque, junto al Puente del Pozo. Tal vez allí encuentres alguna señal del carro de Longo o de este Gerebert Tuk que buscas.\
\
'Tendré que investigar más a fondo este asunto. Siempre me pareció extraño que a Longo no le preocupara demasiado su carro desaparecido.'","El carro desaparecido de Longo","'Unos cuantos carros que van hacia Casa del Bosque se detienen en la clara al norte del Camino de Cepeda, cerca del Puente del Pozo. Podría ser un buen lugar para buscar ese carro de Longo, si es que realmente falta. Está justo al oeste de Casa del Bosque.'","Encuentras hojas sueltas de hierba de pipa en el carro","Busca el carro desaparecido de Longo","Rollo Boffin, que supervisa los carros de hojas que pasan por Casa del Bosque, mencionó que uno de los carros de Longo Madriguera desapareció hace un tiempo y cree que quizás esté relacionado con la desaparición de Gerebert Tuk."},
[8129]={"Encuentra un lugar para contemplar el lago Evendim","En un día despejado, puedes ver casi toda la extensión del lago Evendim.","Orchalwë querrá saber qué pensaste mientras mirabas al horizonte.","Orchalwë habló de pasar tiempo en la orilla mirando hacia el lejano horizonte.","'Antes de que la ciudad se convirtiera en un campo de batalla, solía venir a este lugar a sentarme y mirar el agua. Pasaba horas dejando volar mi imaginación mientras contemplaba las pequeñas ondas.\
\
'Hace mucho tiempo que no siento una paz y satisfacción semejantes. Es algo que echo mucho de menos, y espero poder sentarme algún día y disfrutar de ese sentimiento de nuevo.\
\
'Tomémonos un pequeño momento para descansar y olvidar estos tiempos terribles en los que vivimos. <rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> al horizonte conmigo y deseemos tiempos más felices.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> al horizonte","'¿Tú también lo has visto? ¿La pequeña luz en el horizonte en medio de la oscuridad de las nubes? Aún hay esperanza para todos nosotros. Resistiremos esta tormenta.'","Aunque todo ante ti parezca sombrío, la esperanza brilla en la distancia","Mirar al horizonte","Habla con Orchalwë","Este es un buen lugar para <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> al horizonte"},
[8134]={"Looking for Work","Berion has asked you to speak with some tradespeople on his behalf.\
\
Talk to tradespeople in Ost Anglebed.","'Berion needs work, you say? Need I remind him that the last time he came to visit me he didn't make it within fifteen feet before the smell of the tannery stole the lunch from his stomach?'","'Excuse me. My name is Berion. I believe you saw me earlier, sitting by the front gate.\
\
'I've been a soldier ever since I was tall enough and strong enough to hold a spear. I can't imagine doing anything else in life, but I can't carry on being a guardsman anymore.\
\
'I was thinking of seeking apprenticeship with one of the tradespeople here in Ost Anglebed. If one of them accepts me, I may quit the guard knowing I'll still be able to provide for myself.\
\
'Could you speak with the smith, the baker, and the tanner while I meet with others? We can meet back here later.'","Berion would like your help speaking with tradespeople around town.","Talk to Eithriel","Talk to Brechan","Eithriel laughs at you.\
\
'Do I want an apprentice? I wake up before the cocks crow and move my own weight in dough twice over before dawn rears its head. Of course I want an apprentice!\
\
'The trouble is, I haven't coin enough to hire one.\
\
'You tell Berion that I'm sorry, and to come see me for some free bread if he ever needs it, assuming his pride will allow it.'","The smith makes a long, low growling sound that you think might have been speech.\
\
'My father regretfully declines to take any new apprentices at this time,' his daughter translates.\
\
The old man grunts an affirmative.","You have spoken with the tradespeople only to learn that none can take on an apprentice. You'll have to deliver the bad news to Berion.\
\
Talk to Berion in Ost Anglebed.","His face falls when you deliver the news.\
\
'I had forgotten about that incident with Brechan. Ah, well, I suppose there's nothing to do but speak with the sergeant. Thank you for trying, friend.'","Talk to Raithgam","Talk to Berion"},
[8135]={"Examine suspicious cargo in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})\
<rgb=#FF0000>Suspicious cargo can only be found at night.</rgb>","You have arrived at the old smugglers' den within Lake-town, and you hear hushed voices within...","Search for more signs of foul play in Lake-town","Talk to King Thorin III","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> closely to the voices within the old smugglers' den","Scattered drops of blood snake through Lake-town...","Dagrun, Master of Lake-town, can be found in the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
You have uncovered a curious plot by Karazgar to obtain the bodies of numerous cold-drakelings, and you have also learned that Karazgar has departed the Dale-lands for the realm of Eryn Lasgalen. You should inform the Master of Lake-town of what you have discovered.","The old smugglers' den can be found in the easternmost section of Lake-town.\
\
You have followed a trail of blood to the old smugglers' den in Lake-town, and you hear the voices of what can only be two of Karazgar's agents within. You should listen to their conversation before returning to the Master of Lake-town.","'What can I do for you, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You inform Dagrun that King Thorin III has grown concerned that a rumour implying a connexion between the Cold-drake, Vethúg Wintermind, and the Herald of Winter has been spreading from Lake-town.\
\
'I admit I heard the rumour, but I dismissed it in my haste to restore order in Lake-town following the death of the Master. However, I do not recall hearing that cold-drake's name in any of the tellings. It is hard on the tongue of my folk, and I would have remembered it!\
\
'As for the Herald of Winter, I know little. The rumours spoke of great army rallying far to the North under the Herald of Winter, but who could remain to command such a force? The Enemy is defeated! It is nonsense!\
\
'However, I have heard tales of strange men about the docks at night loading suspicious bags of cargo onto the boats and rafts. My guards claim to have seen no such men, but if you were to investigate this matter, I would rest easier knowing all of this is just a story that got out of hand.'","Signs of foul play might be found on the docks of Lake-town.\
\
You have uncovered the grisly remains of numerous cold-drakelings in Lake-town, but you are uncertain why they have been slain. You should continue your search for Karazgar's agents amongst the docks of Lake-town.","King Thorin III can be found in Erebor.\
\
You have discovered Karazgar's activities in Lake-town and learned that the Weeping Warrior has passed into Eryn Lasgalen. You should return to King Thorin III at once.","'These rumours do not make sense to me, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Vethúg Wintermind is no foe of the Dale-folk or of the Lake-men, and he has not been seen in hundreds of years. If he even still lives, for what reason would he now abandon his hoards to assail our lands?\
\
'No! That Lake-man must have believed a connexion existed between this Herald of Winter and Vethúg Wintermind, but that cannot be so. The source of these rumours must have come from some unrest in Lake-town, and like Durin's Folk, they have had much to contend with as of late.\
\
'I hear a new Master has been named, and I would have you speak to them of these rumours. I do not believe they merely sprouted from a Lake-man's imagination, and I would like to know the truth of the matter.'","Approach the window and <rgb=#FF00FF>listen</rgb> closely to the voices within the old smugglers' den","Troubled by inconsistencies between Kynlig's tale of the fall of the Grey Mountains and the rumours spread by the Lake-man, King Thorin III seeks to uncover the true source of the rumours in Lake-town.","Inform the Master of Lake-town of the Weeping Warrior's plot","Talk to the Master of Lake-town","'You say that agents of the Weeping Warrior have been smuggling slain drakelings right under our noses? What grisly business!\
\
'We have seen none of their kind in the North since Smaug of old fell upon Esgaroth. It could be that they flew from the shadows of the Grey Mountains, but I fear they were captured by the Men of Mordor and brought hither. I do not find comfort in either of these explanations!\
\
'You should return to the King Under the Mountain and tell him that the Weeping Warrior has passed into the forest. I am sorry I cannot be of more aid to his people, but I will do what I can to free Lake-town of his servants.'","You are close enough to listen through the window...","Droplets of blood can be found snaking through eastern Lake-town.\
\
You have discovered a poorly-concealed trail of blood leading through Lake-town. You should follow it and see if it leads to Karazgar's agents.","Follow the trail of blood through Lake-town","Loose Tongues in Lake-town","Suspicious cargo can be found on and near the rowboats docked in Lake-town at night.\
\
Dagrun, Master of Lake-town, has asked you to investigate suspicious activity occurring at night in Lake-town. She believes that smugglers have been attempting to ferry illicit goods from Lake-town to forces of the Enemy.","The battered remains of several cold-drakelings have been stuffed into this sack...","Dagrun, Master of Lake-town, can be found in the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
Suspicious that Karazgar's agents might still lurk in Lake-town, King Thorin III has asked you to seek an audience with the Master of Lake-town.","Scattered drops of blood lead deeper into Lake-town...","'There is much to consider from what you have told me, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I have not met with King Thranduil since I became King Under the Mountain, but he and my father came to something of an understanding long ago. In time, it grew into a friendship, but we have not forgotten our conflicts of old. When it comes to matters between Elves and dwarves, I know well enough to keep our peoples separate.\
\
'Even so, the Weeping Warrior has now passed beyond my realm, and now he lurks within Eryn Lasgalen. I cannot allow an enemy of our peoples to pass unchecked through the North or threaten the friends of Durin's Folk.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Kings of Wood and Stone'</rgb>"},
[8137]={"Loot Reclamation","'If you are here to help, stranger, we could surely use it.\
\
'There is a camp of robbers in the cliffs to the north called Kidu-bâla. They have stolen much from the Beltáni, and anyone travelling alone along the Great Road. If you go to Kidu-bâla, please retrieve our valuables, and return them to Ahâba.'","You have reclaimed many items stolen by the robbers.\
\
You should return to Kûrmi in Ahâba with the items.","Kûrmi has asked you to retrieve the items stolen from the Beltáni.\
\
You should travel to the robber camp, Kidu-bâla, and retrieve the stolen valuables.","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I will ensure these items are all returned to their true owners.\
\
'Perhaps you really are a friend to the Beltáni.'","The robbers in Kidu-bâla have stolen many valuables from the Beltáni and other travellers. They should be reclaimed and returned to their rightful owners.","Talk to Kûrmi","Collect stolen valuables (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected stolen valuables (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8138]={"Defeated a Dunlending looter (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Dunlending looters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Looters and Defilers","You have driven off a number of Dunlending looters for the sake of the fallen Rohirrim at the Fords of Isen.","Completado","Dunlending looters have already begun searching the bodies of the fallen Rohirrim, defiling them where they died.\
\
You should drive off the looters to show them that Rohan has not yet fallen while the Free Peoples still stand.","Dunlending looters defile the corpses of the noble Rohirrim soldiers who fell at the Fords of Isen.","Dunlending looters can be found rummaging around near the bodies of the fallen Rohirrim at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should drive off Dunlending looters."},
[8139]={"'${PLAYER}, muchos Galadhrim han caído en batalla aquí, a las puertas de Lothlórien. Los malditos Orcos de Moria se han llevado trofeos de sus víctimas... objetos que pertenecen a los Elfos que cayeron.\
\
'¿Viajarás a Bolg Maufulug, uno de los campamentos orcos en Fanuidhol, y verás si puedes recuperar alguno de estos objetos? Sería una pena que los Orcos los profanaran, aunque es probable que ya lo hayan hecho.\
\
'Bolg Maufulug se encuentra al oeste y un poco al norte de aquí. Cualquier cosa que traigas de vuelta será muy apreciada.'","Cajas de pertenencias robadas en Bolg Maufulug recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿No pudiste recuperar las pertenencias robadas de Bolg Maufulug?'","Bolg Maufulug se encuentra al oeste y un poco al norte de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Faelleron te ha pedido que entres en Bolg Maufulug y recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres allí.","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Faelleron está en Talan Fanuidhol, al este y un poco al sur de Bolg Maufulug.\
\
Debes regresar a Faelleron con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste.","'Has encontrado más de lo que pensé que encontrarías, y muchos de estos objetos aún no han sido profanados.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}... devolveré estos objetos a las familias de los desaparecidos.'","Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Faelleron en Talan Fanuidhol","Saqueando Bolg Maufulug","'Los Galadhrim estarán agradecidos por cualquier pertenencia robada que puedas devolvernos.'","Recoge cajas de pertenencias robadas en Bolg Maufulug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8140]={"Saqueando Drûmaudhul","'Has recuperado más de lo que podría haber soñado posible, ${PLAYER}. Gracias por tus sinceros esfuerzos.'","Recoge cajas de pertenencias robadas en Drûmaudhul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Drûmaudhul se encuentra al noroeste de Talan Gwilith.\
\
Maeriel te ha pedido que entres en Drûmaudhul y recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres allí.","'Los Galadhrim estarán agradecidos por cualquier pertenencia robada que puedas devolvernos.'","Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Maeriel en Talan Gwilith","'Muchos Galadhrim han caído a las espadas de los Orcos de Mazog, ${PLAYER}. Los Orcos se han llevado muchos objetos pertenecientes a esos Elfos como trofeos, y deseamos que nos los devuelvan.\
\
'¿Viajarás al campamento de leñadores de Drûmaudhul y buscarás cualquiera de estas pertenencias robadas? El campamento es grande y seguramente está bien custodiado, pero confío en tus habilidades.\
\
'Drûmaudhul se encuentra al noroeste de aquí. Recupera lo que puedas y tráemelo, y serás recompensado.'","'¿No pudiste recuperar las pertenencias robadas de Drûmaudhul, ${PLAYER}?'","Maeriel está en Talan Gwilith, al sureste de Drûmaudhul.\
\
Debes regresar a Maeriel con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste.","Cajas de pertenencias robadas en Drûmaudhul recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8141]={"Unlock Orc lockboxes and collect the treasure within (4/6)","'I am sure the Orcs guarding the lockboxes will have keys for the treasure, whatever it is. I am very curious about their hoard!'","Collected Elf-treasure (6/6)","'You found Elf-treasure in the lockboxes? How strange that the Orcs would endeavour to keep it and guard it so jealously.\
\
'I wonder if this particular band of Orcs are on the run from their masters, looting as they escape to survive wherever they land.'","Looting Lockboxes","Collected Elf-treasure (1/6)","Bring the Elf-treasure to Renfaer","Renfaer, the scout of southern Thinglad, awaits you at his watch-post.\
\
You should bring the treasure you gathered to Renfaer.","Unlock Orc lockboxes and collect the treasure within (2/6)","Unlock Orc lockboxes and collect the treasure within (0/6)","'The Orcs that have settled in the south of Thinglad were spotted carrying strange lockboxes with them. We wish to see what they are hiding and why they are here.\
\
'When you kill Orcs in Thinglad, you should search them for keys. I am curious about what may be so precious to Orcs that they store them away in little locked boxes.'","Collected an Elf-treasure (3/6)","Collected Elf-treasure (5/6)","Unlock Orc lockboxes and collect the treasure within (1/6)","Unlock Orc lockboxes and collect the treasure within (3/6)","Collected Elf-treasure (2/6)","Unlock Orc lockboxes and collect the treasure within (5/6)","Orc-guarded lockboxes can be found in Hîs-urdan in southern Thinglad.\
\
You should examine the contents of the lockboxes, but first you will likely need to pry keys from the Orcs who hoard them.","Renfaer has noticed the Orcs of Thinglad greedily hoarding locked chests of loot, and he is curious to see what the enemies hold so dear.","Collected an Elf-treasure (4/6)"},
[8142]={"'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. La mayoría de estos objetos permanecen intactos y pueden ser devueltos a las familias de sus legítimos propietarios.'","'Esto no es aceptable, ${PLAYER}... los Orcos de Moria han profanado los cuerpos de nuestros valientes defensores que han caído y se han llevado trofeos. ¡Esas pertenencias robadas deben ser recuperadas!\
\
'Ve a Mokûrz Gundul, uno de los campamentos orcos en Fanuidhol, y recupera cualquiera de los objetos robados que puedas encontrar. Pertenecen a las familias que quedaron atrás.\
\
'Mokûrz Gundul se encuentra al norte de aquí. Cualquier cosa que traigas de vuelta será apreciada.'","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Faelleron está en Talan Fanuidhol, al sur de Mokûrz Gundul.\
\
Debes regresar a Faelleron con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste.","Cajas de pertenencias robadas en Mokûrz Gundul recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge cajas de pertenencias robadas en Mokûrz Gundul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Faelleron en Talan Fanuidhol","Saqueando Mokûrz Gundul","'Los Galadhrim estarán agradecidos por cualquier pertenencia robada que puedas devolvernos.'","Mokûrz Gundul se encuentra al noroeste de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Faelleron te ha pedido que entres en Mokûrz Gundul y recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres allí.","'¿No pudiste recuperar las pertenencias robadas de Mokûrz Gundul, ${PLAYER}?'"},
[8143]={"Nardur-stazg se encuentra al noroeste de Talan Gwilith.\
\
Maeriel te ha pedido que entres en Nardur-stazg y recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres allí.","Cajas de pertenencias robadas en Nardur-stazg recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los Orcos de Moria han robado muchos objetos queridos de los cuerpos de aquellos que han caído defendiendo Lothlórien de sus asaltos. No dudo que muchos han sido profanados o destruidos, pero debe haber algunos que puedan ser recuperados y llevados a las familias de los perdidos.\
\
'Nardur-stazg es el campamento principal de los Orcos en el Fanuidhol y el más peligroso de atacar, pero ¿podrías ir allí y recuperar lo que puedas? Estoy seguro de que algunos de los mejores trofeos han sido enviados allí.\
\
'Nardur-stazg se encuentra al noroeste de aquí. Trae cualquier objeto robado que encuentres, y serás recompensado.'","Saqueando Nardur-stazg","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Maeriel está en Talan Gwilith, al sureste de Nardur-stazg.\
\
Debes regresar a Maeriel con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste.","'¿No pudiste recuperar las pertenencias robadas de Nardur-stazg?'","'Los Galadhrim estarán agradecidos por cualquier pertenencia robada que puedas devolvernos.'","Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Maeriel en Talan Gwilith","'Tu valentía es innegable, ${PLAYER}. No muchos se atreverían a entrar en Nardur-stazg para recuperar trofeos para los Elfos sentimentales.'","Recoge cajas de pertenencias robadas en Nardur-stazg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8144]={"¡Escapa del campamento antes de que lleguen los refuerzos!","¡Los refuerzos llegaron y evitaron tu escape!","Roba oro del campamento de Ekhamâti (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Khisónto derrotado","Escapa del campamento antes de que lleguen los refuerzos","¡Lograste escapar del campamento antes de que llegaran los refuerzos!","Derrota a Omurtóko","Saqueando los suministros","Tu misión es viajar al campamento de Ekhamâti, derrotar a los dôla y robarles su oro para abastecer a las fuerzas de Mizâdi.","Oro robado del campamento de Ekhamâti (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Khisónto","Omurtóko derrotado","Purombóro derrotado","Derrota a Purombóro","'¡Rápido! Debemos regresar a Setokúli antes de que lleguen los refuerzos.'"},
[8146]={"Lord Celeborn and Lady Galadriel can be found outside their house, high atop the greatest mallorn in Lothlórien. The carpeted path near Forbad winds up to the flet beneath the House of Celeborn.\
\
Forbad has recommended that you speak with Celeborn and Galadriel and to take advantage of the opportunity to see the view from the top.","Forbad is at the base of the carpeted path that climbs the mallorn to the House of Celeborn.\
\
You have spoken with Lord Celeborn and Lady Galadriel and should now return to Forbad.","'You are welcome in Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}.'","Talk to Lord Celeborn in the House of Celeborn","'You have come to Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}, and it is to be hoped that you will do what you can to ensure its safety and the well-being of its people.'","'Do your best to aid the Elves of Lothlórien with their concerns.'","'This carpeted path will take you to the flet just below the House of Celeborn. You should climb up the mallorn and speak to Lord Celeborn and Lady Galadriel...and admire the view from the top as well!'","Talk to Forbad at the base of the carpeted path beneath the House of Celeborn","'Welcome to Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}. I hope you have had a comfortable stay in our city and that you will carry the memory of it with you when again you depart.'","'I am pleased that you visited the Lord and Lady, ${PLAYER}, and trust you were welcomed by them to Caras Galadhon? Good. They are always gracious to their guests.\
\
'Take this golden leaf as a keepsake of your visit.'","Forbad thinks you should meet with Lord Celeborn and Lady Galadriel outside their majestic house.","'Mae govannen, ${PLAYER}. This carpeted path winds its way up this tree, the mightiest mallorn in all of Lothlórien, until it arrives finally just beneath the House of Celeborn.\
\
'You should climb your way up and speak with Lord Celeborn and Lady Galadriel outside their house and tell them what you think of your stay here in Caras Galadhon so far.\
\
'Additionally, it will be a good excuse to see the view from high atop the mallorn!'","'This path runs up to the flet beneath the House of Celeborn.'","'Make the most of your time here in Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}, and do what you can to remedy the worries of its people.'","Lord and Lady of the Golden Wood","'It is your fate to help those who need you, ${PLAYER}.'","'You are welcome in Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}. Remember your time here always and do so fondly.'","Talk to Lady Galadriel in the House of Celeborn","'The ways of Caras Galadhon are open to you.'","'Follow this path to wind your way up the mightiest mallorn in Lothlórien.'"},
[8147]={"Thindiel is at the way-post atop Amon Angeled, east of Fállug.\
\
You should bring news of your victory against Agonglok to Thindiel.","Defeated Agonglok","'Our scouts patrol more freely, now that Agonglok is no more.'","Lord of Beasts","'Agonglok has been defeated? That is a relief, ${PLAYER}. You have well-earned this reward.'","'You may find Agonglok in the ruins of Fállug to the west.'","'Thank you for your assistance, ${PLAYER}... though we still must find more arrows.'","'At Fállug, our scouts have encountered a vicious Warg, who stalked them all the way back to our encampments. This creature is a threat to those of us who continue to patrol the wilds of Southern Mirkwood.\
\
'Travel to Fállug, if you would, ${PLAYER}, and put an end to this beast. For such a deed, you will receive what reward I may offer.\
\
'Hurry, ${PLAYER}! We cannot allow this Warg to continue harrying our scouts.'","Agonglok may be found around the ruins of Fállug, west of Amon Angeled.\
\
Thindiel has asked you to defeat the Warg Agonglok.","Talk to Thindiel atop Amon Angened","Defeat Agonglok at Fállug","The Elves at the way-post atop Amon Angeled provide supplies and provisions for the main force of the Malledhrim in the east."},
[8148]={"Táni está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Has derrotado a Barashal, el Señor de los Gertheryg, en combate y deberías regresar con Táni para contarle tu éxito.","Barashal está en Carn Dûm, al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
Táni quedó impresionado por tus esfuerzos para purgar a los trolls de Urugarth y te ha enviado en otra misión: derrotar a Barashal, el líder de los Gertheryg.","'¡Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un gran héroe[m]|una gran heroína[f]}! ¡Con unos pocos como tú, seguro que podremos cambiar el curso contra el Enemigo!'","Luchaste con gran éxito contra los trolls de Urugarth, pero el líder de los Gertheryg sigue siendo una amenaza.","Señor de los Gertheryg","'Ve a Carn Dûm y derrota a Barashal, el líder de los Gertheryg.'","'Ya veo por qué te enviaron hasta aquí para ayudarnos. Hiciste un trabajo encomiable contra los trolls, pero aún queda trabajo por hacer.\
\
'Los Gertheryg de Carn Dûm están comandados por un vil engendro llamado Barashal. Debes ir allí y derrotarlo.\
\
'Barashal no caerá sin luchar, así que asegúrate de descansar bien antes de dirigirte al oeste, a Carn Dûm.'"},
[8149]={"Defeat brigands at Helstor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Brigands can be found at Helstor, north of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to defeat brigands at their encampment in the Brown Lands.","Lords of the Desolation","Defeated brigands at Helstor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have found the brigands' hideaway, and that is a small victory for us. We must move quickly to render them useless to the Khundolar. They fancy themselves the lords of the Brown Lands... but whether this land holds any value or not, it belongs to the Lord of the Mark.\
\
'Let us deliver this message to the brigands at Helstor. Enter therein and defeat many of their fellows. That will be a harsh lesson to them, but an effective one, I think.'","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, south of Helstor.\
\
You should return to Céola with news of your success.","Ever since the Brown Lands became the barren waste-land they now are, brigands have used them for a hideaway from those who would seek to bring them to justice.","'Have you dealt with the brigands yet?'","'You have delivered a mighty blow against the brigands, but not one strong enough to remove their threat, I wager.\
\
'Nevertheless, I thank you.'"},
[8150]={"La identidad de los que una vez residieron en Tham Varan se ha perdido en la historia. Quizá las ruinas todavía conserven la respuesta.","Los restos ruinosos de este sello ofrecen poca información de a quién podría haber pertenecido. Quizá si hicieras calcos de varios de los sellos por Tham Varan y los llevaras a los Montaraces, ellos podrían ser capaces de identificarlos.","Inspecciona los sellos agrietados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tham Varan está al este de Tinnudir y más allá de Tham Nambarth.\
\
Gúrhebnir te ha pedido que te aventuras en Tham Varan e investigues los sellos agrietados para determinar la historia de las ruinas.","La mayor parte del sello ha sido destruido, pero unas pocas líneas son todavía legibles","Habla con Gúrhebnir en Tinnudir","Señores de las tierras","Los Montaraces están en Tinnudir, al oeste de Tham Varan y Tham Nambarth.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces estará interesado en saber de los varios linajes que has sido capaz de identificar.","'Me pregunto quiénes serían en su día los señores y señoras de Than Varan...'","'Estos linajes que lees me indican que Tham Varan pertenecía a una familia del sur, seguramente de Gondor. Esto es muy interesante.'"},
[8153]={"Busca a la liebre en apuros","Radagast el Pardo está en Barad Dhorn.\
\
Has traído a la liebre sana y salva de regreso a Radagast. Deberías hablar con él para ver qué más te pedirá.","${PLAYERNAME:Maestro del Saber: Amigo[m]|Maestra del Saber: Amiga[f]} de las liebres","La madriguera de la liebre se encuentra a lo largo del acantilado en el borde suroeste del Círculo de Sangre.\
\
Radagast te ha pedido que pongas a salvo a un conejo, enseñándote la importancia del vínculo con las criaturas más gentiles de la naturaleza.","Radagast está en Barad Dhorn, en Agamaur.\
\
Radagast te ha pedido que pongas a salvo a un conejo, enseñándote la importancia del vínculo con las criaturas más gentiles de la naturaleza.","El conejo asustado sale de la madriguera ante tu llamada","Radagast te ha dicho que muchas de las criaturas de Garth Agarwen están en peligro debido a la corrupción que se extiende por la tierra.","'¡Bien hecho, joven ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Vas por buen camino, pero aún tenemos más criaturas que rescatar.'","No has logrado traer de vuelta a la liebre a tiempo","'¡Ah! Llegas en el momento oportuno, pues eres exactamente ${PLAYERNAME:el Maestro[m]|la Maestra[f]} del Saber que necesito, . Al parecer, más de mis pequeños amigos están en peligro.\
\
'Tú también tienes afinidad con los animales, ¿verdad? Si les haces un bien, sentirán una gran lealtad hacia ti, y podrás llamar a estos amigos animales como yo hago, para que se sienten contigo cuando te sientas ${PLAYERNAME:solo[m]|sola[f]}.\
\
'Hay una liebre en grave peligro, escondida en su madriguera al suroeste de aquí. ¡Por favor, date prisa y tráemela de vuelta! Relacionarte con las criaturas más dóciles es un paso importante en tu camino para convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un verdadero maestro[m]|una verdadera maestra[f]} del saber.'","Guía a la liebre de vuelta con Radagast"},
[8154]={"Radagast el Pardo está en Barad Dhorn.\
\
Deberías hablar con Radagast para ver qué más desea que hagas.","Radagast te ha pedido ayuda para salvar a una última criatura de los pantanos de Harloeg: un gorrión cuyo nido está rodeado por vigilantes del Pantano.","'Hay una última criatura que necesita nuestra ayuda. Mi amigo el sapo me ha hablado de un gorrión atrapado en su nido. Ese nido se encuentra en las ruinas del suroeste de los pantanos de Harloeg.\
\
'Los gorriones no son fáciles de guiar, pero si puedes traer a este hasta aquí, creo que podrás entablar amistad con cualquier criatura gentil. Buena suerte, ${PLAYER}.'","'Ah, lo has hecho muy bien. Puedo ver que eres verdaderamente ${PLAYERNAME:un amigo[m]|una amiga[f]} de la naturaleza. Las criaturas salvajes ahora confiarán en ti y acudirán a tu llamada, si aprendes cómo hacerlo.\
\
'Permíteme mostrarte. Toma este tomo y léelo. Una vez que lo hagas, podrás invocar a un compañero apacible. Aunque no pueda ayudarte en combate, seguirá siendo un amigo valioso, como todas las criaturas del mundo natural.'","Radagast el Pardo está en Barad Dhorn, en Agamaur.\
\
Debes traer rápidamente el gorrión de vuelta con Radagast antes de que se asuste y regrese a su nido.","Trae el gorrión de vuelta con Radagast","Busca al gorrión en apuros","El gorrión asustado sale del nido ante tu llamada","${PLAYERNAME:Maestro del Saber: Amigo[m]|Maestra del Saber: Amiga[f]} de los gorriones","No has logrado traer de vuelta al gorrión a tiempo","El nido del gorrión se encuentra entre las ruinas en el suroeste de Harloeg, muy al sur de Agamaur.\
\
Radagast el Pardo te ha encomendado rescatar al gorrión de Haragmar."},
[8155]={"'Hay otra criatura que necesita ser rescatada: una tortuga, atrapada en el borde del Círculo de Sangre por los muertos que no deberían caminar.\
\
'Una tortuga puede ser difícil de atraer, pero responderá al saludo de ${PLAYERNAME:un verdadero maestro[m]|una verdadera maestra[f]} del saber. Prueba tu voz con ella y tráela aquí.'","Radagast el Pardo está en Barad Dhorn.\
\
Deberías averiguar si Radagast el Pardo tiene algo más que pedirte.","La tortuga se esconde entre piedras caídas justo al este del Círculo de Sangre.\
\
Radagast te ha pedido que pongas a salvo a la tortuga, enseñándote la importancia del vínculo con las criaturas más gentiles de la naturaleza.","Radagast el Pardo está en Barad Dhorn, en Agamaur.\
\
Radagast te ha pedido que pongas a salvo a una tortuga, enseñándote la importancia del vínculo con las criaturas más gentiles de la naturaleza.","${PLAYERNAME:Maestro del Saber: Amigo[m]|Maestra del Saber: Amiga[f]} de las tortugas","No has logrado traer de vuelta a la tortuga a tiempo","Busca a la tortuga en apuros","Radagast te ha pedido que encuentres a una tortuga que se esconde en un tocón en Harloeg.","Trae la tortuga de vuelta con Radagast","'Ah, lo has hecho bien, pero aún queda más por hacer.'","La tortuga asustada sale de su escondite ante tu llamada"},
[8156]={"'${PLAYER:Maestro[m]|Maestra[f]} del Saber , qué alegría verte. ¿Espero que no haya sido demasiado difícil encontrarme?\
\
'Entiendo que has llegado a un punto de tus estudios que requerirá una investigación más profunda y exigente para seguir perfeccionando tus habilidades. Creo saber exactamente lo que necesitas para continuar avanzando.\
\
'Veamos cómo podemos ayudarnos mutuamente.'","Habla con Winiel en las Obras Hidráulicas","Winiel te ha convocado a su presencia para continuar tu entrenamiento de Maestro del Saber.","Winiel está en las Obras Hidráulicas de Moria.\
\
Se te ha indicado buscar a la Maestra del Saber Winiel.","Winiel te ha convocado a su presencia.","Maestro del Saber: Senda de la Maestra Antigua"},
[8157]={"Como Sabio, has alcanzado tal renombre que has recibido una convocatoria de Isdi de Edhelion, en Ered Luin.\
\
Deberías buscar a Isdi para recibir más entrenamiento en tu clase.","Los misterios del pasado se abren ante ti, pero aún buscas descubrir más, sin descansar en tu búsqueda de conocimiento.","'Me alegra conocerte al fin, ${PLAYER}. Los años pueden ser largos, pero están llenos de alegría para quienes buscan el conocimiento. El paso de las estaciones no puede embotar la mente aguda que ansía sabiduría.'","Reúnete con Isdi para continuar tu entrenamiento como Sabio","Isdi está en las ruinas de Edhelion, en las laderas sobre el Salón de Thorin, en Ered Luin.\
\
Se te ha dicho que hables con la Sabia Isdi, pues puede que tenga algunas palabras sabias que compartir contigo.","Sabio: El camino más sabio es la contemplación"},
[8158]={"Lleva los objetos a Skalli","Las pertenencias de Skalli han salido volando por toda la zona de las carreras. Deberías consultar la nota que te dio para obtener pistas sobre dónde podrían estar los objetos perdidos.\
\
Debes reunir todos los objetos perdidos de Skalli y devolvérselos.","Has recuperado la lanza","Encuentra la joya de la suerte de Skalli","Encuentra la jarra de Skalli","Skalli se encuentra en las carreras de barriles del Festival de Verano, probablemente todavía dándole patadas al mismo carro y maldiciendo su mala suerte (y a los festivales).\
\
Deberías llevarle a Skalli sus pertenencias recuperadas e intentar animarlo.","Skalli ha intentado una y otra vez adivinar quién ganaría las carreras y, por desgracia, no ha tenido mucha suerte. Sin embargo, no solo ha perdido sus apuestas; debido a sus numerosas rabietas, también ha perdido todas sus pertenencias.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","'¡Estoy tan furioso que podría gritar!'\
\
El enano da una patada con fuerza a un carro cercano.\
\
'Sigo apostando en las carreras. Cada vez que elijo al enano que creo que va a ganar, y cada vez, sin excepción, ¡ese enano PIERDE! ¿A quién se le ocurrió una idea tan horrible para un festival? ¡ODIO LOS FESTIVALES!\
\
'Por si fuera poco, cada vez que pierdo entro en una rabieta ciega y termino lanzando algo a lo lejos. Aunque me desahoga, a menudo me doy cuenta de que lo que he lanzado era mío. ¿Podrías ayudarme a encontrar mis pertenencias perdidas? Aquí tienes un pequeño resumen de lo que he hecho hoy.'","Encuentra el escudo de Skalli","Encuentra el pico de minería de Skalli","Has recuperado el escudo","Has recuperado la jarra","Has recuperado la joya de la suerte","'¿Qué? ¡Te he dado una lista! ¿Qué más quieres?'","Encuentra la lanza de Skalli","'¡Mis cosas! ¡La lanza, el escudo, la jarra… todo! Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Ahora puedo volver a enfurruñarme sin tener que preocuparme por mis pertenencias perdidas.'","Perder más que una apuesta","Has recuperado el pico de minería"},
[8159]={"Osbenn can be found in the village of Lancrath, far to the south-east of Morlad.\
\
Rosfin has asked you to travel to the village of Lancrath and aid the people in repelling the Orcs of the White Mountains.","Osbenn has asked that you speak to the refugees of Tingobel","Eager for vengeance and hoping to limit their losses, Rosfin seeks to eliminate the Orkish threat and protect what people remain in Lancrath.","'Hail, traveller. You must be a friend of Lady Rosfin, for none have been so bold... or foolish enough to journey here as of late.\
\
'The Orcs have starved us for resources by sacking Tingobel and its mine, and it is unlikely that we can hold out much longer. I must admit, I know less than I would like to about what occurred to the north, but the people who escaped know it well.\
\
'If you would aid us, I ask that you speak to them, for they might be able to aid you in planning an attack.'","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Osbenn in Lancrath","'We have waited long enough, ${PLAYER}. If the Dead seek to overrun the vale, we cannot abide another Orc. We must crush their forces at Tingobel and ready ourselves for war.\
\
'Far to the south-east, you will find Lancrath nestled in the hills. There, seek a man named Osbenn. He is a wise hunter, and though he is no longer fit for battle, he can aid you in directing the attack on Tingobel.\
\
'Go with haste, ${PLAYER}. Every minute we delay allows the Orcs to creep further south towards Lamedon.'","Loss for Loss"},
[8160]={"'Saludos, Etelä-vieras. Te doy la bienvenida a Forochel. ¿Buscarías ayudar a los Lumi-väki? Si es así, tengo una tarea para ti.\
\
'Los Lumi-väki nos hemos vuelto maestros de este reino helado, usando nuestras lanzas con punta de hueso para protegernos de las grandes bestias que nos amenazan durante las cacerías. Por supuesto, no todas las lanzas dan en el blanco. Se pierden muchas puntas de lanza. Y como son tan difíciles de fabricar, la pérdida incluso de una sola es amarga para nosotros.\
\
'Si encuentras alguna de nuestras puntas de lanza y me la traes, ganarás la gratitud de todo el pueblo Lumi-väki.'","Puntas de Lanza Lossoth — Introducción","Puntas de lanza lossoth recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge puntas de lanza lossoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Juha está en Sûri-kylä y en Pynti-peldot, en Forochel.\
\
Juha te ha pedido que le lleves todas las puntas de lanza lossoth que encuentres durante tus viajes.","Juha te explicó cómo los Lossoth se protegen de las criaturas agresivas de Forochel usando sus lanzas con punta de hueso.","Lleva las puntas de lanza lossoth a Juha","'¡Ah, muy bien! ¡Has encontrado algunas de nuestras puntas de lanza! Pronto podremos volver a ponerlas en uso.\
\
'Agradeceré con gusto cualquier otra que encuentres.'","'¿Has encontrado ya alguna de nuestras puntas de lanza? Perdemos muchas en las pieles de las grandes bestias que cazamos. Quizá, si derrotas a una de esas bestias, encuentres alguna.'"},
[8161]={"Entrega el pelaje albino a Kaleva en Sûri-kylä en Forochel","Se busca: Pelaje albino de las bestias que rodean Sûri-kylä.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar pelaje albino de las bestias que rodean Sûri-kylä en Forochel. Los objetos deben ser entregados a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","Pelaje albino recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Un Lossoth, Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä está recolectando pelaje albino en la capital de Lossoth.","'Las bestias a menudo nos proporcionan piel y sus orejas para ropa y mitones. Quizás también te ofrezcan estos regalos.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de Lossoth: Pelaje albino","Recoger pelaje albino (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Haremos uso de estos. Gracias.'","Se busca: Pelaje albino de las bestias que rodean Sûri-kylä. Entrega los objetos a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth."},
[8162]={"Entregar la piel albina a Kaleva en Sûri-kylä en Forochel","Un Lossoth, Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä está recolectando piel albina en la capital de Lossoth.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar piel albina de las bestias y sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","'Encontraremos muchos usos para estos, de eso estoy seguro. Gracias.'","'A menudo usamos la piel de los sierpes y las bestias para nuestra ropa y armadura.'","Recolectar piel albina (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Piel albina de bestias y sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Piel albina recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Piel albina","Se busca: Piel albina de bestias y sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä. Entregar los artículos a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth."},
[8163]={"'Esto será de gran ayuda para los Lossoth. Gracias.'","Entregar el polvo brillante a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta en Forochel","'Los espíritus caídos del frío amenazan a nuestro pueblo, pero traen consigo maravillas que ayudan a nuestro pueblo. Si encuentras alguna de estas maravillas, tráemelas.'","Santtu en el puesto de avanzada de Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta espera una entrega de polvo brillante.","Se busca: Polvo brillante de los espíritus caídos que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta. Entregue los artículos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta.","Polvo brillante recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar polvo brillante de los espíritus caídos en las áreas que rodean Kauppa-khota a Santtu, un Lossoth que vigila el puesto de avanzada.","Recoger polvo brillante (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Polvo brillante","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Polvo brillante de los espíritus caídos que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta."},
[8164]={"Se busca: mandobles rotos de las criaturas inteligentes que conspiran contra los Lossoth.","'Hay muchas criaturas que no pertenecen a los bosques o valles helados del norte que nos atacan e intentan robarnos. Llevan grandes espadas y finas vainas de espada. Queremos que sean eliminados de nuestros cotos de caza.'","Mandobles rotos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar mandobles rotos de las criaturas inteligentes en los bosques que rodean Kauppa-khota y los valles helados del norte a Santtu, un Lossoth que vigila el puesto de avanzada.","Entrega los mandobles rotos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta","Se busca: mandobles rotos de las criaturas inteligentes que conspiran contra los Lossoth. Entrega los objetos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta.","Santtu en el puesto de avanzada de Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta espera una entrega de mandobles rotos.","Recoger mandobles rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Mandobles rotos","'Es bueno saber que ahora hay menos de estas criaturas para hacernos daño. Gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[8165]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar mandobles rotos de los Gauredain que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot a Lauri, un explorador Lossoth.","Mandobles rotos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar los mandobles rotos a Lauri en Pynti-peldot en Forochel","El explorador Lossoth Lauri en Pynti-peldot espera la entrega de mandobles rotos.","Recoger mandobles rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Mandobles rotos","'Estos hombres que tratan con tales bestias son nuestros enemigos. Gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: mandobles rotos de los Susi-väki que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot. Entregar los artículos a Lauri, uno de los exploradores Lossoth.","Se busca: mandobles rotos de los Susi-väki que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot.","'Los hombres que veneran al lobo han sido durante mucho tiempo un enemigo en nuestros terrenos de caza, pero el viento helado del este los ha cambiado, los ha vuelto más agresivos y ahora se esfuerzan por matar a nuestra gente. Hay que hacer algo y hay que dar pruebas.'"},
[8166]={"Un Lossoth, Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä está recolectando garrotes de madera rotos en la capital de Lossoth.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar garrotes de madera rotos de los invasores de Angmarim que rodean Sûri-kylä en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","Entregar los garrotes de madera rotos a Kaleva en Sûri-kylä en Forochel","'Cuando el viento vino del este, también vinieron los agentes del viento. Invaden nuestras tierras y ocupan tierras que una vez fueron tierras de Lossoth.'","'Es bueno ver que los invasores están siendo expulsados. Gracias.'","Tarea de Lossoth: Garrotes de madera rotos","Garrotes de madera rotos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoger garrotes de madera rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Garrotes de madera rotos de los invasores del este que rodean Sûri-kylä. Entregar los artículos a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","Se busca: Garrotes de madera rotos de los invasores del este que rodean Sûri-kylä."},
[8167]={"Vainas de espada doradas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar vainas de espada doradas de los Gauredain que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot a Lauri, un explorador Lossoth.","Tarea de Lossoth: Vainas de espada doradas","El explorador Lossoth Lauri en Pynti-peldot espera la entrega de vainas de espada doradas.","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los Susi-väki que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot.","Entregar las vainas de espada doradas a Lauri en Pynti-peldot en Forochel","'Estos hombres que tratan con tales bestias son nuestros enemigos. Gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los Susi-väki que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot. Entregar los artículos a Lauri, uno de los exploradores Lossoth en el campamento de Forochel.","Recoger vainas de espada doradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los hombres que veneran al lobo han sido durante mucho tiempo un enemigo en nuestros terrenos de caza, pero el viento helado del este los ha cambiado, los ha vuelto más agresivos y ahora se esfuerzan por matar a nuestra gente. Hay que hacer algo y hay que dar pruebas.'"},
[8168]={"'Es bueno saber que ahora hay menos enemigos que nos hagan daño. Gracias.'","Vainas de espada doradas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las vainas de espada doradas a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta en Forochel","'Hay trasgos en el bosque y hombres que se visten de lobos en los valles helados del norte. Llevan grandes espadas y finas vainas de espada. Queremos que los eliminen de nuestros cotos de caza.'","Tarea de Lossoth: Vainas de espada doradas","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de las criaturas inteligentes del norte y del oeste que conspiran contra los Lossoth. Entregue los objetos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta.","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de las criaturas inteligentes del norte y del oeste que conspiran contra los Lossoth.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoger vainas de espada doradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Santtu, en el puesto avanzado de los Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta, espera una entrega de vainas de espada doradas.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar vainas de espada doradas de las criaturas inteligentes del norte en los valles helados y en los bosques que rodean Kauppa-khota a Santtu, un Lossoth que vigila el puesto de avanzada."},
[8169]={"Entrega la gran suciedad a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta en Forochel","'Esto será de gran ayuda para los Lossoth. Gracias.'","Se busca: Gran suciedad de los espíritus caídos que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta.","'Los espíritus caídos del frío amenazan a nuestro pueblo, pero traen consigo maravillas que ayudan a nuestro pueblo. Si encuentras alguna de estas maravillas, tráemelas.'","Tarea de Lossoth: Gran suciedad","Se busca: Gran suciedad de los espíritus caídos que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta. Entrega los objetos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta.","Recoge gran suciedad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar gran suciedad de los espíritus caídos en las áreas que rodean Kauppa-khota a Santtu, un Lossoth que vigila el puesto de avanzada.","Gran suciedad recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Santtu, en el puesto de avanzada de Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta, espera una entrega de gran suciedad.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[8170]={"Un Lossoth, Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä está recolectando grandes escamas en la capital de Lossoth.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Grandes escamas de los sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä. Entregar los artículos a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","'Usamos todo lo que la tierra ofrece. Las escamas de los sierpes son uno de esos artículos.'","Recolectar grandes escamas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grandes escamas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Grandes escamas de los sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä.","Entregar las grandes escamas a Kaleva en Sûri-kylä en Forochel","Tarea de Lossoth: Grandes escamas","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar grandes escamas de los sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","'Haremos uso de estos. Gracias.'"},
[8171]={"Se busca: Orejas monstruosas de las bestias que rodean Sûri-kylä.","Se busca: Orejas monstruosas de las bestias que rodean Sûri-kylä. Entregue los artículos a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Un Lossoth, Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä está recogiendo orejas monstruosas en la capital de Lossoth.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar orejas monstruosas de las bestias que rodean Sûri-kylä en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","'Las bestias a menudo nos proporcionan piel y sus orejas para ropa y mitones. Quizás también te ofrezcan estos regalos.'","Orejas monstruosas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolectar orejas monstruosas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Orejas monstruosas","Entregar las orejas monstruosas a Kaleva en Sûri-kylä en Forochel","'Haremos uso de estos. Gracias.'"},
[8172]={"Recolectar pelaje negro puro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pelaje negro puro de las bestias que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta. Entrega los objetos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta.","'Nuestras cacerías se han ralentizado desde la llegada de los vientos del este. Estamos atrasados en la recolección de pieles de las bestias en el bosque.'","Tarea de Lossoth: Pelaje negro puro","Santtu en el puesto de avanzada de Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta espera una entrega de pelaje negro puro.","Entrega el pelaje negro puro a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta en Forochel","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar pelaje negro puro de las bestias en los bosques que rodean Kauppa-khota a Santtu, un Lossoth que vigila el puesto de avanzada.","Se busca: Pelaje negro puro de las bestias que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Pelaje negro puro recolectado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Esto nos ayuda a nosotros y a toda nuestra gente. Gracias.'"},
[8173]={"'Esto ayudará mucho a nuestra gente. Gracias.'","Recolectar pelaje negro puro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar el pelaje negro puro a Lauri en Pynti-peldot en Forochel","El explorador Lossoth Lauri en Pynti-peldot espera la entrega de pelaje negro puro.","Tarea de Lossoth: Pelaje negro puro","Se busca: Pelaje negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar pelaje negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot a Lauri, un explorador Lossoth.","Se busca: Pelaje negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot. Entregue los objetos a Lauri, uno de los exploradores Lossoth en el campamento de Forochel.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Pelaje negro puro recolectado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Nuestra caza y suministros han sufrido desde la llegada del viento del este. Nos estamos quedando sin pieles y pelajes de las bestias en la naturaleza.'"},
[8174]={"Se busca: Piel negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä. Entregar los artículos a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar piel negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados a Kaleva en la capital de Lossoth.","Entregar la piel negro puro a Kaleva en Sûri-kylä en Forochel","Piel negro puro recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las bestias y los sierpes dejan su piel para nuestros cazadores. Quizás te las dejen a ti.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoger piel negro puro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Piel negro puro","Se busca: Piel negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean Sûri-kylä.","Un Lossoth, Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä está recolectando piel negro puro en la capital de Lossoth.","'Haremos uso de estos. Gracias.'"},
[8175]={"'Nuestras cacerías se han ralentizado desde la llegada de los vientos del este. Estamos atrasados en la recolección de pieles de las bestias en el bosque.'","Se busca: Piel negra pura de las bestias que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta. Entregue los artículos a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar piel negra pura de las bestias en los bosques que rodean Kauppa-khota a Santtu, un Lossoth que vigila el puesto de avanzada.","Santtu en el puesto de avanzada de Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta espera una entrega de piel negra pura.","Entregar la piel negra pura a Santtu en Kauppa-kohta en Forochel","Piel negro puro recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Piel negra pura de las bestias que rodean el puesto de avanzada en Kauppa-kohta.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoger piel negro puro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Piel negro puro","'Esto nos ayuda a nosotros y a toda nuestra gente. Gracias.'"},
[8176]={"'Esto ayudará mucho a nuestra gente. Gracias.'","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar piel negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot a Lauri, un explorador Lossoth.","Entregar la piel negro puro a Lauri en Pynti-peldot en Forochel","Se busca: Piel negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot.","Piel negro puro recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Piel negro puro de las bestias y sierpes que rodean el campamento de Pynti-peldot. Entregar los artículos a Lauri, uno de los exploradores Lossoth en el campamento de Forochel.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoger piel negro puro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Lossoth: Piel negro puro","El explorador Lossoth Lauri en Pynti-peldot espera la entrega de piel negro puro.","'Nuestra caza y suministros han sufrido desde la llegada del viento del este. Nos estamos quedando sin pieles y pelajes de las bestias en la naturaleza.'"},
[8178]={"Perro perdido","El Barandalf está al norte y un poco al este de Dwaling.\
\
Ronald te ha pedido que busques a lo largo de las orillas del Brandivino, en las Marismas de Arena, para encontrar el juguete perdido de su hijo. Te dijo que quizá uno de los insectos excavadores lo tomó.","Encontraste el pequeño perro de plomo","'¿Pudiste encontrar el juguete, ${PLAYER}? Ah, ya veo que sí. ¡Muchísimas gracias!'","Habla con Ronald Dwalkien","El hijo de Ronald Dwalkien perdió un pequeño perro de juguete y está muy afligido.","Encuentra el pequeño perro de plomo","'Alguna de esas criaturas excavadoras en la ribera debe tener el juguete, ${PLAYER}.'","Ronald Dwalkien está en la casa de Hob Cimacolina, en el Prado del Toro Bramador en Dwaling, al sur del Barandalf.\
\
Debes devolver el perro de juguete a Ronald Dwalkien.","'Debe haber sido a comienzos del otoño; estaba con mi hijo en las orillas del Brandivino, disfrutando del sol, una buena comida y una pipa llena, mientras él se sentaba a jugar con su juguete favorito —una pieza de plomo moldeada como un pequeño perro— junto al río.\
\
'Mi muchacho está muy encariñado con ese juguete, pero cuando llegó la hora de irnos, no estaba por ninguna parte. Intenté consolarlo con una de mis historias. Inventé un cuento maravilloso sobre el paradero del juguete, pero si vas hacia allí, quizá puedas buscarlo tú mismo.\
\
'El juguete tiene que estar en algún lugar del Barandalf, los pantanos arenosos al norte y este de Dwaling. He oído que extrañas criaturas excavadoras han habitado la zona desde entonces. Es muy posible que una de ellas lo haya tragado, pensando que era comida.'","Lleva el perro de juguete a Ronald Dwalkien","'¿Encontraste ya el juguete? El Barandalf está al norte y al este de Dwaling.'"},
[8179]={"Probablemente, Flík se encuentre en un campamento no muy lejos de la carretera que atraviesa las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
El enano Flík ha desaparecido de la expedición y te han pedido que lo encuentres, ya que es hijo de un enano importante. Si no se encuentra a Flík, Styrr se verá en serios apuros por haber permitido que le ocurriera algo malo.'","'¿Quién eres? ¿Eres de los nuestros? ¿Te ha enviado Styrr a buscarme? ¡Espero que sí! Supliqué que me dieran esta misión, y ahora lo único que quiero es volver sano y salvo al campamento.'","'Esta será mi cabeza, sin duda. No debía enviar a Flík a realizar ninguna tarea, pero no paraba de suplicármelo.\
\
'Su padre dirige una de las partidas orientales de la expedición; si supiera que dejé que su hijo saliera ahí fuera y nunca regresara, ¡probablemente me arrojarían por una de estas fisuras!\
\
'Nunca más se sabrá nada de mí... a menos, claro está, que lo encuentres. ¡Me salvarías el pellejo si lo consigues!'","Flík salió a llevar provisiones a la Bodega Putrefacta y no ha regresado.","'¿Has encontrado a Flík ya?'","Encuentra a Flík","Enano perdido"},
[8181]={"Bienes perdidos","Has encontrado lo que parece ser parte de un envío de suministros al campamento de los elfos en Gwingris.","Lleva la bolsa a Gwingris","Gwingris se encuentra al oeste de los restos del envío de suministros.\
\
Deberías llevar la bolsa que has encontrado al campamento de los elfos en Gwingris.","Esta bolsa es claramente parte de un envío de suministros. Entre las marcas de garras y fauces de la sierpe, distingues un nombre élfico: 'Gwingris.'\
\
Gwingris está hacia el oeste. Deberías buscar allí a alguien que pueda saber algo sobre la bolsa.","'¿Qué es lo que me traes?\
\
'Se confirman mis temores. Nuestra última entrega desde Rivendel ha sido presa de las sierpes de Pend Eregion. Hace mucho que sabemos de las sierpes, pero hasta ahora no habían sido apenas más que una molestia.\
\
'Las noticias de un incremento de los ataques de las sierpes son graves para nuestro puesto avanzado.'","'¿Te puedo ayudar en algo?'"},
[8182]={"'Were you able to find success in Maurûsh?'\
\
You give the supplies you had recovered to Galâmka.\
\
'Aha! You have! This will be a great relief for the people here. I thank you for this, ${CLASS}.\
\
'If you wish to help more, I have made our plans with the information gathered from the scouting reports you retrieved. Return to me when you are ready and we can discuss them further.'","Gather the lost supplies for Galâmka from within Maurûsh.","Deliver the recovered supplies to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh.","Lost Hoard","Collected lost supplies in Maurûsh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Galâmka has asked you to retrieve supplies that were left behind in Maurush and bring them to Ub Nishir.","Collect lost supplies in Maurûsh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the lost supplies to Galâmka","'Ah, good, you have returned. There is still much I need to learn from the reports that you brought back. I have another task that needs your help, as we are beginning to run low on supplies in our camp here at Ub Nishir.\
\
'I believe I know where we can get some more, but I warn you: it may be dangerous.\
\
'When the Orcs flooded into Maurûsh and we were forced to flee, we left behind much of our stores. I believe that these stores remain intact, we only need someone to reclaim them. I ask for that someone to be you ${CLASS}. Go to these stores and bring back what supplies you can.'"},
[8183]={"Camélia te ha pedido que encuentres a los hobbits perdidos y los lleves de vuelta a la superficie. O al menos lo que quede de ellos.","Camélia Botónflor está desconsolada por un grupo de valientes hobbits que entraron en el túnel de las musarañas y aún no han regresado.","'¡Bendito sea el cielo, los encontraste vivos y sanos! Ya se han ido a tomar una pinta a algún lugar, dijo uno de ellos. ¡Qué alivio! Seguramente llegaste justo a tiempo para salvarlos de los peligros que hay dentro. Te lo agradezco mucho.'","Habla con Camélia Botónflor","Hobbits perdidos encontrados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hobbits perdidos","Has encontrado a los cuatro hobbits perdidos y les has dado indicaciones para regresar a la entrada del túnel. Debes regresar con Camélia Botónflor justo afuera de la cueva, al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo.","'¿Vas a entrar en el túnel? Ten cuidado, otros han entrado antes que tú y no han regresado. ¡Temo que estén perdidos para siempre, mis pobres y queridos hobbits perdidos! Si los encuentras... o lo que quede de ellos, por favor devuélvelos a nosotros. Son tan valientes y no merecen tal destino.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>'","Encuentra a los hobbits perdidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8184]={"Invitaciones perdidas","Percy Lindebosque ha perdido las invitaciones que tenía la intención de enviar para informar a todos sobre el festival de aniversario.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Percy Lindebosque está cerca de la fuente del Jabalí en Bree.\
\
Deberías devolverle las invitaciones que has encontrado a Percy Lindebosque.","'¡Saludos! ¿Podría pedirte un favor?\
\
'Mi tarea era enviar invitaciones a los residentes de Bree para informarles de los eventos del festival en curso. ¿Quizás recibiste una tú también? Pues bien, estaba a punto de enviar otro paquete de sobres cuando llegó un fuerte viento y los voló a todos. ¿Puedes recoger las invitaciones por la ciudad para mí?'","Los sobres están esparcidos por Bree.\
\
Percy Lindebosque te ha pedido que mires dentro de los sobres esparcidos por la ciudad y le devuelvas las invitaciones que encuentres.","Invitaciones recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las invitaciones a Percy Lindebosque en Bree","'Gracias por las invitaciones, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'¡Eso estuvo cerca de ser un desastre, pero ahora podemos difundir la noticia sobre el festival!'","'Busca en Bree las cartas que se han volado. No podrían haber ido muy lejos...'","Abre los sobres que encuentres para recoger las invitaciones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8185]={"Little is known of the time following the defeat of the False King of Angmar, but the forces of the Iron Crown have come to dwell in the shadow of Mount Gundabad.","Collect Angmarim tomes in Tûr Ágal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmarim scrolls and tomes can be found in the tower, Tûr Ágal, at Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has asked you to collect Angmarim scrolls and tomes from the forces of the Iron Crown at Caivád Sâr.","Collected Angmarim tomes in Tûr Ágal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Now, let's see....'\
\
Múta looks over the scrolls and tomes you've collected.\
\
'Hmmph. All this talk of False Kings and secret rifts... it is too much to read on my own!\
\
'You've done well, though. I'll see that these are brought to our allies at Annâk-khurfu.'","Collected Angmarim scrolls in Tûr Ágal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Angmarim scrolls in Tûr Ágal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lost Knowledge","Múta can be found outside Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade.\
\
You have collected many tomes and scrolls from the forces of the Iron Crown at Caivád Sâr. You should deliver them to Múta.","'Oh, and one more thing!\
\
'This settlement is of particular interest to the Gabil'akkâ. After all, we had not expected to encounter forces of the Iron Crown in our march on Gundabad.\
\
'We do not know why they have chosen to return to these lands, but Commander Glóin believes it wise to learn their purpose in Elderslade. I have seen Angmarim bearing scrolls and tomes into their tower, and I think they might allow us the chance to learn more of what the Iron Crown has done since Angmar again fell into ruin.\
\
'Find your way into their tower and recover whatever information you can!'","Deliver the Angmarim scrolls and tomes to Múta"},
[8193]={"Collect Page 16","Collect Page 2","Collect Page 13","You have gathered the pages, but the binding is still missing, and the author still unknown. You recall Narthavron at the Udûn Foothold mentioned fighting in the War of the Last Alliance; perhaps he knows more about these pages.","'Ah, yes I do know of these pages, for I am the author! One of the Captain's spies made off with this journal when we first arrived, and I was only able to recover the binding. The pages were nowhere to be found. It is truly miraculous that you were able to find them!\
\
'Here, allow me to re-bind this tome for you. You may keep it for your efforts, and as a warning. We must never again allow evil to regain its footing here, lest it will fester and grow.'","Collect Page 1","Soot-smudged pages can be found scattered around Udûn.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the story.","Soot-smudged pages can be found scattered around Udûn. Perhaps you can complete the story if you find them all.","Collect Page 15","Collect Page 7","Collect Page 8","Collect Page 5","Collect Page 6","Collect Page 14","Collect Page 10","Completado.","Collect Page 11","You've found the page of a journal, written in an Elvish script, and ripped from its binding. It has small, sooty handprints on it. Perhaps you can find other pages around Udûn and complete the story.","Collect Page 3","Collect Page 4","Lost Lore of Gorgoroth: Udûn","Narthavron can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Narthavron.","Collect Page 9","Completado","Collect Page 12","Talk to Narthavron"},
[8198]={"Collect Page 16","Collect Page 17","Talk to Elendil","Collect Page 26","Continue adventuring in Mordor Besieged","Stark-white pages can be found scattered throughout Mordor Besieged.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the story.","Pages of a journal can be found scattered across Mordor Besieged. Perhaps you can complete it if you find them all.","Collect Page 20","Collect Page 2","Collect Page 22","Lost Lore of the Great Alliance","Collect Page 13","Collect Page 19","Collect Page 24","Collect Page 21","Collect Page 1","Collect Page 15","Collect Page 7","Collect Page 8","Collect Page 5","Collect Page 25","Collect Page 27","Collect Page 14","Collect Page 10","Collect Page 6","Completado.","Collect Page 11","Collect Page 3","You have found lost pages of a journal authored by Elendil.\
\
You should continue adventuring in Mordor Besieged.","'Hail, friend, what have you there?'\
\
You show the High King the pages you have collected.\
\
'Ah, I had thought this journal lost! You are quite resourceful to have reconstructed this account.\
\
'Indeed, the words here-in are mine. All who were present were shaken to the core by the storm Gil-galad brought forth that day. I am sure you feel the same. Does that surprise you? Even Kings feel fear in the face of real power. And still, the knowledge that the Dark Lord has a ring of power all his own brings me pause. We must bury that fear, and hold on to our courage. This is our last stand against the darkness; Courage is our greatest weapon.'\
\
He hands you the spine from which the journal pages originated.\
\
'Keep this journal for yourself. Let it be a constant reminder of the power of our Great Alliance, and give you hope in the battles to come. The Enemy may have great power, but so do we.'","Collect Page 18","Collect Page 4","High King Elendil can be found in Adambel.\
\
If he is missing, he will return after the Council of the Kings.","You have found the page of a journal, stark-white in contrast to the battle-scarred plain of Gorgoroth. Perhaps you can find other pages in Mordor Besieged and complete the story.","Collect Page 9","The story is complete. You believe this is an account of Gil-galad's shattering of the Morannon written by High King Elendil himself. Perhaps if you bring it to him, he will be able to comment further.","Completado","Collect Page 12","Collect Page 23"},
[8207]={"Inir awaits rescue in the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should escort Inir to the mine entrance.","Cada is outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Cada with news of Inir's rescue.","'Ah! I never thought to see the face of ${RACE} in this mine, for there are so many of the filthy bugan! Will you help me to escape?\
\
'I can offer no reward, but perhaps Cada will part with something?'","Talk to Inir","The miner Inir was wounded during the attempt to flee the Barnavon Mine, but managed to hide from the bugan.","Lost Miner -- Inir","Escorted Inir to safety","Talk to Cada at the mine","'Aye, Inir has returned already, and his wounds are being tended.\
\
'You have our gratitude, ${PLAYER}.'","'I am ready to go... lead on, friend!'"},
[8208]={"The miner Siam was wounded during the attempt to flee the Barnavon Mine, but managed to hide from the bugan.","Talk to Siam","Lost Miner -- Siam","'Ah! Help has come at last! I have been trapped here for days... will you help me to escape?\
\
'I have little to offer, but perhaps Cada can part with some gold?'","'Aye, Siam just returned, and his wounds are now being tended.\
\
'Thank you for your assistance, ${PLAYER}.'","Siam is awaiting rescue in the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should escort Siam to the mine entrance.","Escorted Siam to safety","Talk to Cada at the mine","Cada is outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Cada and let him know that Siam is safe.","'I am ready to go, friend. Thank you for your help!'"},
[8209]={"Escorted Wilim to safety","'Aye, Wilim has returned already, and his wounds are being tended to.\
\
'Thank you, ${PLAYER}, for your aid.'","'Ah! You have come to find me? I have been trapped here since the bugan attacked and could not escape on my own because of my wounds.\
\
'Will you help me escape? The Turch-lûth are a poor people, and I cannot offer much, but perhaps Cada will have something with which to rewards you?'","The miner Wilim was wounded during the attempt to flee the mine, but managed to hide from the bugan.","Talk to Wilim","Talk to Cada at the mine","Wilim awaits rescue in the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should escort Wilim to the mine entrance.","Cada is outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Cada and let him know that you escorted Wilim to freedom.","Lost Miner -- Wilim","'I am ready to go... lead on, friend!'"},
[8210]={"The miner Wilim has been rescued from the clutches of the bugan in the Barnavon Mine.","'There were rumours of troubles at the mine, and I feared for the workers. Thank you for bringing this joyous news!'","Lost Miner I, Part 2","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Cada asked you to bring the good news of Wilim's survival to Gwilum.","'${PLAYER}, you have done well by rescuing Wilim from the mine and have proven yourself a friend. Will you, then, as a friend grant me a favour?\
\
'Go to Barnavon-town and tell Gwilum that he still lives and is being cared for here. He will return when he is well enough to travel or when we can spare someone to escort him.'"},
[8211]={"'${PLAYER}, you have done well by rescuing Siam from the mine and have proven yourself a friend. Will you, then, as a friend grant me a favour?\
\
'Go to Barnavon-town and tell Gwilum that he still lives and is being cared for here. He will return when he is well enough to travel or when we can spare someone to escort him.'","'Siam lives? So joyous a day! Would that we could feast, but we will thank the spirits for Siam's life, nevertheless.'","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Lost Miner II, Part 2","Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Cada has asked you to bring the good tidings of Siam's survival to Gwilum.","The miner Siam has been rescued from the clutches of the bugan in the Barnavon Mine."},
[8212]={"'Inir is safe and will return soon? My thanks to you for bringing this news! We shall speak a prayer of gratitude for you to the spirits.'","Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Cada asked you to take the good tidings of Inir's survival to Gwilum.","The miner Inir has been rescued from the clutches of the bugan in the Barnavon Mine.","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Lost Miner III, Part 2","'${PLAYER}, you have done well by rescuing Inir from the mine and have proven yourself a friend. Will you, then, as a friend grant me a favour?\
\
'Go to Barnavon-town and tell Gwilum that he still lives and is being cared for here. He will return when he is well enough to travel or when we can spare someone to escort him.'"},
[8213]={"Canicas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las canicas a Warstang","'¡Ah, gracias a los cielos! Las echaba de menos… ¿quieres verme hacer malabares con ellas? ¿No? En fin.\
\
'Por desgracia, las canicas perdidas no han sido el peor de mis problemas…'","Recoge canicas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","He perdido mis canicas","'Disculpa, buen ${RACE}, pero ¿podrías ayudar a un Eglan lejos de su hogar? ¡Estoy teniendo la peor de las suertes! La bolsa en la que llevaba mis canicas se abrió y, cuando me di cuenta, ya habían desaparecido todas. \
\
'Luego, para empeorar las cosas, vi a una bestia allí entre las nieves tragarse una de ellas. Y me temo que no fue la única canica que se perdió de ese modo.\
\
'Es un poco desagradable, estoy de acuerdo, pero necesito recuperar esas canicas. ¡Un saqueador necesita su bolsa completa de trucos! Tráeme de vuelta mis canicas: apostaría a que tendrás que rebuscar en el estómago de más de una clase de criatura.'","Puede que encuentres a las bestias que se comieron las canicas de Warstang repartidas por toda Länsi-mâ.\
\
Encuentra las canicas perdidas de Warstang en los vientres de las bestias que las devoraron y devuélveselas en el puesto avanzado enano de Zigilgund.","Warstang, un saqueador que reside actualmente en Zigilgund, ha perdido sus canicas. Al parecer se dispersaron y fueron devoradas por diversas bestias, y quiere tu ayuda para recuperarlas.","'¿Dónde están mis canicas? ¿No has tenido suerte?'"},
[8214]={"'The moment I saw you holding that knife, I should have realized it was mine. But I didn't dare hope... hope left me long ago.\
\
'These Corsairs have been allowed to harass us for too long. The rest of the kingdom has moved on from the war, and yet Anfalas has been left to fester.\
\
'Still... not all is lost. A stranger was kind enough to help my son and daughter, asking for nothing in return.' A grin breaks across Udnerth's face before he turns to Hedra.\
\
'Let's go home.'","Find Corsair captives at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor","You have found a Corsair captive at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.\
\
You should talk to him.","Hedra has asked you to free Corsair captives at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor, if there are any.\
\
You should first find them.","Talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor","Relinquishing her father's knife to you, Hedra instead hopes you can use it to free the Corsairs' captives.","Talk to the Corsair captive","You have found the last surviving Corsair captive at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.\
\
You should free Udnerth from his bindings.","'My name's Udnerth. I'll spare you the trouble of searching for more survivors; I'm the last one.\
\
'You say there's a girl from Melgobas waiting nearby? Get me out of here, and I'll make a run for it.'\
\
He glances at the knife in your hands. Something changes in his weather-worn face, but you can't quite figure out what.\
\
'After you free me from my bindings, could you give me that? I haven't got anything to defend myself with.'","Lost No More","'None of this feels right.'\
\
She looks down at her father's knife in her hands.\
\
'Take this away from me, please. I don't think Father would want me risking my life to hurt people with it... but what if you used it to free other captives? There must be some still surviving. There must be a chance...\
\
'I'll wait here. If you find any captives, I can guide them to Melgobas.'","Free Udnerth from his bindings","The captive squints at you","You've done what you set out to do.\
\
You should talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor."},
[8216]={"Recupera las cajas de provisiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Este campamento es de gran importancia para nuestra expedición. Desde aquí podemos montar guardia para detectar cualquier cosa que se mueva entre el Camino de Durin y la Gran Excavación hacia el sur.\
\
'¡Sin esos suministros, podríamos estar forzados a abandonar este puesto crucial!'","'¿Líkmund te envía para ayudarme? Bueno, llegas justo a tiempo entonces, ${PLAYER}. Tengo la tarea apropiada para alguien como tú.\
\
'Nos estamos quedando peligrosamente cortos de provisiones. Traía un carro desde el Umbral de Durin, pero fuimos emboscados en el exterior de Manarbul. Fuimos dispersados antes de que los refuerzos pudieran llegar, ¡y los trasgos nos arrebataron los suministros!\
\
'Apreciaría en gran medida que pudieras recuperar las cajas desaparecidas. Será una semana escasa antes de que llegue el próximo envío, e incluso podríamos ser forzados a abandonar este campamento. Los trasgos huyeron hacia el norte, a Mdmulzarâk.'","Unos enanos que escoltaban un carro de provisiones desde el Umbral de Durin fueron emboscados justo al oeste de Manarbul. El carro fue destruido y las cajas de provisiones robadas.","Lleva las cajas de provisiones a Gansi","'Por favor, recupera esas cajas, ${PLAYER}. Dudo que podamos mantener nuestro puesto sin esos suministros.'","Provisiones perdidas","Cajas de provisiones recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los trasgos ladrones fueron vistos por última vez huyendo hacia el norte por el camino que lleva a Mudmulzarâk.\
\
Gansi te ha pedido que recuperes las cajas de provisiones robadas por los trasgos.","Gansi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al sur de Mudmulzarâk.\
\
Has recuperado las cajas de provisiones robadas por los trasgos y deberías llevárselas a Gansi sin demora."},
[8217]={"The bandits attacked the waggon along the Road of Riches to the east of Iridír. You should defeat the bandits in that area and recover the lost trade-goods.","Defeated bandits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dashên has had a shipment of trade-goods stolen by bandits. He has asked for your help in getting them back.","Recover stolen trade-goods (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The carrier said he was robbed along the road between here and the Wrackwade to the east. I will pay you what I am able for the return of my trade-goods.'","'Níkhu! My goods! Thank you so much ${PLAYER}, you have saved my business. I do hope peace is restored to Ambarûl soon. Many bandits are Ordâkhai deserters, and the sooner the Dumûri can make them leave, the better.'","Lost Trade-goods","Defeat bandits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recovered stolen trade-goods (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Dashên with the recovered trade-goods","You have defeated the bandits and recovered the stolen trade-goods. You should return to Iridír and speak to Dashên.","'Hashtal-gûr, traveller. Tell me, are you looking for work? I have been waiting for a new shipment of trade-goods from the south. My carrier made it here, but the goods did not. He said he was waylaid by bandits on the road and was greatly outnumbered. He gave them the goods in exchange for his life. It was the right decision, but I still need my trade-goods back or I cannot pay my debts. Please, would you lend me your aid?\
\
'He said he was stopped along the road between here and the Wrackwade to the east. I will pay you what I am able for their return.'"},
[8218]={"Habla con Reginard fuera de Lhúngobel","Reginard te está esperando en el exterior de Lhúngobel.\
\
Vuelve con él con su mochila y lo que queda de sus pertenencias.","Reginard te ha invitado a que te encuentres con él de vuelta en su campamento.\
\
Su campamento se encuentra en la ciénaga al sur de Lhúngobel.","Libera a Reginard de sus ataduras.","Objetos perdidos","Encuentra la mochila de Reginard","Libera a Reginard de sus ataduras","A Reginard se le cae el alma a los pies al sopesar la mochila en sus manos.\
\
'Supongo que a los trasgos no les gustaban mucho mis cosas. Solo quedan unos cuantos frascos de especias...\
\
'Esper. ¿Dó... dónde está mi trébol de la suerte? ¡No puedo volver sin él! Ese trébol fue un regalo de... de...'\
\
Respira honda y temblorosamente varias veces para calmarse.\
\
'No hay mucho que se pueda hacer, ¿no? No podemos peinar todo este lugar en busca de un simple trébol. Esto... ¡solo será un contratiempo menor en mi aventura! Sí, eso es.\
\
'¿Por qué no preparo algo de vuelta en el campamento? ¡Es lo justo después de todo lo que has hecho! Me encontraré allí contigo... necesito dar un paseo a solas.'","Habla con Reginard","Has encontrado a Reginard de vuelta en su campamento.\
\
Habla con él.","La mochila parece desafortunadamente ligera","'Podré irme sin problemas una vez me desates, ¡pero tienes que buscar mi mochila! Tiene mi trébol de cuatro hojas de la suerte. Mientras tenga mi trébol, todo estará bien.\
\
'Los trasgos se llevaron mi mochila a saber dónde... ¡aunque sospecho que no muy lejos!\
\
'Te esperaré fuera de las ruinas.'","Reginard te ha pedido que recuperes su mochila, que debe estar en algún lugar de Lhúngobel.","Has encontrado la mochila de Reginard con la mayoría de su contenido arruinado.\
\
Devuélvele la mochila.","Encuentras a Reginard mirando cabizbajo a la hoguera apagada","Has encontrado a Reginard. Ahora falta encontrar sus pertenencias.","Vuelve con Reginard al campamento en la ciénaga","Recupera la mochila de Reginard","'Oh, hola. He recogido leña de camino hacia aquí pero hum... tropecé y se me cayó la mayoría al río...'","La comida y hierba para pipa de Reginard ha sido esparcida por el suelo y arruinada"},
[8219]={"Search for Edâkhi near the Falls of Ilûritu","Return to Kiga in Ub Nishir","Speak with Edâkhi","Return to Kiga in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and let her know about Edâkhi.","Kiga has asked you to search for the leader of her group, Edâkhi, near the Falls of Ilûritu.","Kiga has asked that you find her expedition leader, Edâkhi, near the Falls of Ilûritu because she has yet to return to Ub Nishir.","'And who are you, ${CLASS}?'\
\
Edâkhi looks at you and stands ready to fight, unsure if you are friend or foe as you explain that Kiga sent you.\
\
'Ah, dear Kiga. I am glad you found me. Please return to Ub Nishir and tell her that I am safe. The Falls of Ilûritu are truly wondrous, and I wish to learn more of its secrets. As Kiga told you, we are searching for Enârshan, the river-maiden who is said to be here.\
\
'I am only finishing what I can, then I will return when the roads are safe.'","Lost by the Falls","Speak to Edâkhi and tell her that Kiga is worried about her.","Found expedition camp","'You have returned, and without Edâkhi.'\
\
You explain to Kiga that you found Edâkhi at the camp near the falls and told her of Kiga's concerns. She said she will return to Ub Nishir when she can.\
\
'Oh! What a true relief. I am so glad that she is safe. I can not thank you enough! We are all dedicated to our work, but there is a reason she is the leader of our group. So I will understand her needing to get all that she needs before returning.\
\
'Again, thank you, ${CLASS}. A weight has been lifted and I will await Edâkhi's return.'","'I have not seen you before, you must be the one of which Galâmka spoke?\
\
'I am Kiga, and I ask for your help. I fear someone dear to me may be in danger. You see, I am part of an expedition group who has been researching the Falls of Ilûritu to the north, and searching for the river-maiden, Enârshan, who is said to reside there.\
\
'When Utug-bûr opened, we fled from the Orcs roaming the land and came across Ub Nishir and Galâmka, who offered us safety.\
\
'The leader of our expedition, Edâkhi, went back to our camp near the falls to retrieve our research that we had to leave behind. She has not yet returned and so I must ask that you travel to the falls and see if you can find her. I ask that you return to me with any discoveries you can, good or bad. I must know of her fate.'"},
[8221]={"Busca señales de Mellanion","'Hemos estado aquí, en Sírlond, investigando la situación con los orcos y, más recientemente, con los muertos sin descanso. Aunque la animé a que lo dejara en casa, Annaethel insistió en traer a su hijo pequeño, Mellanion. El niño desapareció durante un ataque de los orcos. Annaethel estaba convencida de que había sobrevivido, pero tras varios días sin encontrarlo, se tomó la pérdida muy mal.\
\
'El dolor de Annaethel no podía aliviarse, y con él llegó una locura que nunca había visto antes. Empezó a alejarse de nuestro campamento y desapareció una noche. ¡He estado buscándola a ella y a Mellanion desde entonces, y estoy encantado de que la hayas encontrado! Sin embargo, mi corazón tiembla al pensar que ha secuestrado al hijo de otra persona.\
\
Temo por la seguridad de Annaethel, pero aún más por la de su hijo. Me atrevo a esperar que aún viva, pero si es así, es prisionero de los orcos que habitan en Caranost. Debido a su gran número, no puedo adentrarme en la ciudad en ruinas, ¡pero quizá tú tengas éxito donde yo he fracasado! Por favor, busca señales de Mellanion.'","Dale el caballito de juguete a Mellanion","La manta que has encontrado es sin duda de tejido élfico. ¿Podría haber pertenecido al niño elfo desaparecido? Deberías seguir buscando señales de Mellanion en Caranost, en el centro de Cardolan.","Vuelve a Sírlond","Con los orcos distraídos, ¡Mellanion pudo escapar! Deberías comprobar que ha regresado a Sírlond.\
\
Sírlond se encuentra en el centro de Cardolan.","Sigue buscando señales de Mellanion.","Sigue buscando señales de Mellanion","El propio hijo perdido de la mujer que llora puede ser la clave para liberarla del dolor que la está llevando a la locura.","'¡Saludos, saludos! ¿Vienes de Sírlond? ¡Qué alivio!\
\
'¡Llevo días atrapado aquí abajo! Logré escapar de mis captores y esconderme aquí abajo, pero me están buscando y patrullan sin cesar arriba. Temía no poder escapar nunca, ¡pero ahora estás aquí!\
\
'Puedo salir de aquí por mi cuenta, pero necesito una distracción. Cuando los llevaba en mi persecución hace unos días, vi una caja curiosa en la torre que hay sobre estos escalones. Creo que si le prendo fuego a esa caja, se producirá una explosión fantástica. Si lo haces, los guardias que patrullan se distraerán el tiempo suficiente para que yo pueda escapar. ¿Me ayudarás?.'","Grethron quiere que le devuelvas el caballito de juguete a Mellanion.\
\
Mellanion está en Sírlond, gracias a ti.","Enciende la caja de polvora negra","'¡Qué alegría volver a verte! ¡Mellanion ha regresado y nos ha contado tus hazañas! ¡No hay palabras suficientes para agradecerte lo que has hecho! Además, mientras estabas fuera, un explorador regresó con noticias de Annaethel. La encontraron en las ruinas al sur de aquí, pero huyó cuando se acercaron a ella.\
\
'Veo que también has encontrado el caballito de juguete del niño. ¡Creo que podemos usarlo para llegar a su madre!\
\
'Devuelve el juguete a Mellanion. Tengo una idea.'","¡El caballito de juguete de un niño! ¿Podría haber estado aquí?","'¡Saludos de nuevo! Esta vez en circunstancias mucho mejores. Gracias por rescatarme y por devolverme mi caballito, aunque parece que lo han mordido. Nos habrían mordido mucho más a ambos si no hubiera sido por su ayuda.'","Perdido en Caranost","¡Has encontrado una manta gastada de tejido muy fino!","Mellanion logró esconderse de sus captores, pero necesita ayuda para escapar. Quiere que enciendas la caja de polvora negra que vio en la torre sobre las escaleras.\
\
La torre está en Caranost.","¡Los gritos de los orcos enfurecidos llenan el aire!","El caballito de juguete parece que ha sido mordido, ¡pero esperemos que su dueño no lo haya sido! Sigue buscando señales de Mellanion en Caranost, en el centro de Cardolan.","Grethron cree que el hijo de Annaethel aún puede estar vivo. Deberías buscar señales de Mellanion en Caranost, en el centro de Cardolan."},
[8223]={"Candaith no puede descifrar las inscripciones que encontraste entre los orcos de las Tierras Solitarias, pero conoce a un Montaraz que podría hacerlo.","'La carta que encontraste en la Grieta Desolada también está escrita en la lengua negra. Necesitamos conocer las órdenes que contienen ambas cartas. No he estudiado esa lengua, pero conozco a un Montaraz que sí lo ha hecho.\
\
'Al norte de Bree, al este del Camino Verde, hay un campamento oculto que a veces sirve de punto de encuentro para los Montaraces. Saeradan suele hacer guardia allí; es un amigo mío. Quizá sepa lo suficiente sobre los sellos crueles como para entender al menos una parte de estas órdenes.\
\
'Ve hasta Bree. Desde la puerta oeste de Bree, ve hacia el norte, a lo largo del Camino Verde, hasta que veas el campamento de los Montaraces entre los árboles, al este del camino. El campamento está cerca del Taller de Espinar. Una vez que hayas encontrado a Saeradan, pídele que traduzca estas órdenes. ¡Date prisa!'","Saeradan está en el campamento de Montaraces situado a lo largo del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree y al este del camino, cerca del Taller de Espinar.\
\
Candaith te entregó las órdenes que habías recuperado y te pidió que se las llevaras a Saeradan el Montaraz.","El Montaraz Candaith está en su campamento, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Saeradan te ha revelado que orcos que se hacen llamar Uruk-hai han venido al norte para espiar la región y descubrir por qué sus primos del norte se dirigen hacia el sur. Te ha pedido que regreses rápidamente con Candaith para advertirle del peligro.","'¡No pierdas tiempo! ¡Vuelve rápidamente con Candaith en las Tierras Solitarias! Si estos Uruk-hai ocupan ahora las ruinas en la cima de Amon Sûl, corre un grave peligro.'","'Si los Uruk-hai han tomado Amon Sûl, todas las Tierras Solitarias están amenazadas.'","'¿Me traes noticias de Saeradan? ¿Qué hiciste con las órdenes?'","Lleva las órdenes de los orcos a Candaith","'¡Date prisa! La forma más rápida de llegar a la cabaña de Saeradan es a través de Bree. Una vez que llegues a la ciudad, sigue el Camino Verde hacia el norte y busca la cabaña al este del camino. El Taller de Espinar está muy cerca.'","'¿Qué te ha hecho venir desde tan lejos, ${PLAYER}? ¿Candaith, dices? Hace mucho que no hablo con él. Déjame ver las cartas que me envía. La lengua negra es áspera y cruel, y me duele tener que usarla. Aun así, es por eso que la he estudiado: para tener conocimientos de ella cuando sea necesario.\
\
'Estas cartas traen malas noticias, ${PLAYER}. Un orco de las Tierras del Sur, llamado Rigûl, ha sido encargado de averiguar qué ha provocado un gran movimiento de orcos hacia el sur desde el norte. Rigûl y sus compañeros se hacen llamar \\qUruk-hai\\q y están utilizando las ruinas en la cima de Amon Sûl como centro de sus actividades.\
\
'¡Vuelve a Candaith lo antes posible y adviértele! ¡Puede que esté en un peligro más terrible del que se da cuenta!'","'Parece que has hecho este viaje en vano, ya que parece que has olvidado las cartas de las que hablas. Si Candaith está preocupado, es probable que el tiempo apremie. Quizá deberías traerme las cartas para que pueda traducirlas.'","'Los orcos son un problema, dondequiera que se encuentren.'","'Saeradan es un buen hombre. Siempre me ha sido de gran ayuda.'","'Candaith es un buen Montaraz, pero no es tan cauteloso como debería ser.'","Lleva las órdenes de los orcos a Saeradan","Una cuestión de traducción","'Las noticias que me traes de Saeradan son sombrías. Debemos prepararnos. Si Amon Sûl está amenazado, entonces todas las Tierras Solitarias están en peligro.\
\
'Cuando estés listo, tengo más cosas que pedirte... pero no te demores demasiado. El tiempo apremia.'"},
[8224]={"Aided Nurnhoth in escaping from Dath Nethryn in Lhingris (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Nurnhoth can be found in Dath Nethryn.\
\
A Nurnhoth has asked you to find his companions, who have become lost and endangered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn.","After escaping their servitude in Dor Amarth and Talath Úrui, several Nurnhoth have become lost and endangered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn.","You have aided many of the Nurnhoth lost and endangered in the shallows of Dath Nethryn, and you have helped them escape both the oppressive might of Sauron's servants and the terrible creatures of Lhingris.","You have aided many of the Nurnhoth lost and endangered in the shallows of Dath Nethryn.","'No... No! I can't go back! Not after we've travelled so far!'\
\
You try to calm the Nurnhoth and explain that you mean him no harm.\
\
'Ah, I see. I am sorry, but when you have slaved for the Eye as long as myself and my companions, it is easy to see everyone as a foe. You see, my companions and I were on our way through a hidden pass out of Mordor, but we became separated. After all, it was not a swamp the last time we were sent here to gather ore from the caverns!\
\
'Something broke loose in those mountains when the Master's tower fell, I think, and now there's foetid water all about!\
\
'I cannot leave without my companions, but I have not the means to rescue them myself. These rags cannot defend against the blades of Orcs or the bites of spiders! Will you aid them and send them here to me?\
\
'Once that is done, we can leave this sorry land behind....'","Aid Nurnhoth in escaping from Dath Nethryn in Lhingris (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Completado","Lost in Lhingris"},
[8225]={"Randgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road.\
\
Inhild has asked you to go to the farmer Randgar and convince him to flee for her sake.","'My dear Inhild... she need not worry for me. Since I first gazed upon her in the market, I have been in love, and I will do anything to be near her. I refuse to leave for Edoras, for we may never meet again.\
\
'I appreciate your concerns, but I will not leave without seeing Inhild.'","Talk to Randgar at his farm","Inhild is worried about a young farmer named Randgar, whom she cares deeply for. Randgar has decided to risk his life outside of Cliving, rather than abandon the woman he loves.","'Hello, traveller. May I ask a favour of you? I am worried about a young man named Randgar, who lives on a farm outside of Cliving. I have heard countless stories of crofters coming under siege from fearsome Orcs and other beasts, and I pray that Randgar remains yet safe.\
\
'I care deeply for Randgar, but my father will not allow me to see him. He knows that Randgar is poor and believes he is unworthy of our concern. Please, visit his farm and ensure his safety. I love Randgar, but I would rather he flee to Edoras than come to harm for my sake.'","Lost in Love"},
[8226]={"Faramir, son of Ondoher can be found at the foot of Dol Acharn.\
\
You have discovered Faramir, son of Ondoher while searching for the remaining Rangers. You should speak to him.","Find the Rangers in the lost patrol (${NUMBER}/10)","After sending a company of Rangers to seek you on the battle plain, Anborn now hopes to see them safely return to Haerondir at your side.","You have discovered the spirit of Faramir floating near the foot of Dol Acharn!","Talk to Faramir at the foot of Dol Acharn","Search for the remaining Rangers near Dol Acharn","'As Laeglaw told you, I sent ten of my Rangers to seek you and the lore-master on the battle plain. They have not returned, and I would have you lead the search for them.\
\
'They took the road eastward toward the Slag-hills and were to move northward onto the battle plain to search for you and Artamir between the hills.\
\
'I would suggest you begin your search upon the battle plain itself. Let us hope the Enemy's forces have heeded their Master's orders and have not brought an ambush upon my men.\
\
'When you find them, send them back to Haerondir by our safest paths. They will know the way.'","'Do you believe my words now? Have you seen your allies fall now to unseen blades?\
\
'Tread carefully, ${CLASS}...\
\
'The Wainriders have claimed the site of their greatest defeat and now defile it with their very presence. You and any other Living that seek to pass through these lands have much to fear from their return.'","Dol Acharn can be found due east of Ondoher's Folly and the battle plain in Dagorlad.\
\
You have found six dead Rangers, but still seek the remaining four. You should search the foot of Dol Acharn for any survivors.","This Ranger lies slain, but is marked with no wounds...","Lost in Passing","The Rangers can be found somewhere to the north-east of Haerondir on the battle plain between Ondoher's Folly and Dol Acharn.\
\
Anborn has asked you to seek the lost company of Rangers that left Haerondir in search of you and Anborn. You should search for them in Dagorlad."},
[8227]={"'Aunque estos tesoros parezcan viejas monedas oxidadas, son objetos muy valiosos. Los clientes de Bree nos los intercambian regularmente por comida u otras mercancías. Si buscas lo suficiente en estas ruinas, encontrarás varias de estas monedas.\
\
'Las criaturas del norte también buscan activamente en las ruinas para encontrarlas.'","Perdidos en sus redes","'A lo largo de los años, hemos estudiado y coleccionado los objetos que se encuentran en estas ruinas. Han permitido a nuestro pueblo sobrevivir, pero muchos de estos tesoros se han perdido con el paso del tiempo en la guarida de las arañas.\
\
'Dado que debes ir a ese valle para ayudarnos a resolver el problema de las arañas, me gustaría que te tomaras el tiempo de recuperar esos tesoros para nosotros. Probablemente los encontrarás envueltos en gruesos capullos, esparcidos por todo el valle.\
\
'Rompe los capullos para recuperar los objetos y tráemelos.'","Tesoros de Eglain recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Encontrarás los tesoros de mi pueblo en el valle, debajo de Minas Eriol. Están atrapados en las telarañas que cubren el lugar. Rompe las telarañas y recupera esos objetos, nos serán de gran ayuda.'","Hunulf Mascador te ha hablado de los diversos tesoros perdidos en las telarañas, bajo Minas Eriol.","Las arañas han establecido su hogar debajo de las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al oeste del campamento de Hunulf. Allí se han perdido muchos objetos valiosos que necesitan los Eglain.\
\
Hunulf te ha pedido que vayas al peligroso valle situado bajo Minas Eriol, una fortaleza en ruinas infestada de trasgos. Te ha dicho que las arañas se han apoderado de muchos tesoros que los Eglain quieren recuperar.","Habla con Hunulf Mascador","Recupera los tesoros de los Eglain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8228]={"Felgar has asked you to deliver some missives to scouts.\
\
Two scouts are on the level below Felgar's location: one on a bridge to the east, the other to the west. The third scout is waiting two levels below Felgar's location, in Aslíf.","Deliver missives to dwarf scouts (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","An injured Felgar needs you to send missives to a couple of other scouts.","'Oi -- do me a favour, would you? I've got a job to do, but as you can see, I've landed myself in an embarrassing predicament.'\
\
She gestures to Thrúthug tending to her wounds and grimaces.\
\
'You need to send these missives to a few of the scouts. If nothing's gone horribly wrong, they should still be where they're stationed.\
\
'Two scouts are on the level below us; one's on a bridge to the east, keeping an eye on Durshulot. The other's watching Gazat-fark to the west. The third scout should be waiting in Aslíf, two levels below us.'","Completado","Lost in Transit","Delivered missives (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","You have completed Felgar's request. The scouts have received their missives, and Felgar will be back on her feet soon enough.","You have completed Felgar's request."},
[8229]={"'During the capture of the city, I lost an heirloom that has been in my family for longer than we can remember. It was the only thing I took with me when we fled Tol Ciryarani, and I cannot imagine leaving Pelargir without finding it.\
\
'Could you help me, ${PLAYER}? It would be located somewhere to the north of here, where a small band of us offered resistance against the Corsairs.'","Talk to Celebros","Clearing away the debris reveals an ash-stained lockbox","Search the area near the reflecting pool","The capture site can be found to the north-east of Celebros.\
\
You should search the capture site for signs of the missing heirloom.","Searched the scattered debris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","DNT - Not Used","'Somehow I knew you would return with it.\
\
'I know that it was selfish of me to ask you for help, but I know how much Faltharan wants us away from the war. It cannot replace what I've lost, but it can help me to forget... if only for a little while.'","A metallic shimmer underneath the debris catches your attention...","Search the scattered debris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect the lost heirloom","Lost in the Confusion","Collected the lost heirloom","Celebros, the wife of Lord Sirgon, lost a family heirloom during her capture. She has asked for your help in finding it.","Examine the shimmering debris","Celebros is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Celebros.","The shimmering debris is located near the reflecting pool of the capture site.\
\
You should examine the shimmering debris.","The heirloom box is located near the reflecting pool of the capture site.\
\
You should take the heirloom box."},
[8230]={"'I can't imagine it was a pleasant experience for any of them, but luckily, none of the miners look too much worse for the wear! I'm sure they'll be washing that glowing slime off their clothes for days, but they can do that back at Watchers' Roost.\
\
'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Talk to Lokur","'Even the more docile worms have become a nuisance!\
\
'It seems the glow-worms are uneasy with our presence here, which I can understand after so many years spent in solitude, but these are the lodes of Durin the Deathless! It is our right to explore them and reclaim them along with the rest of the Mountain-home. According to one of my miners, several others have been ensnared by the glow-worms and have become stuck in strands of glowing slime!\
\
'Would you help free them, ${PLAYER}? I would've tried to help them sooner, but if I got stuck too, I think we'd all be in a bad way.\
\
'If I don't hear back from you soon, I'll warn the others at Watchers' Roost!'","Lokur can be found in Ormgren.\
\
You have freed many of the ensnared Longbeard miners in Ormgren. You should return to Lokur.","After encountering a number of aggressive and unsettled glow-worms in Ormgren, several Longbeard miners have been ensnared by viscous glowing slime.","Lost in the Lodes","Freed ensnared Longbeard miners in Ormgren (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Free ensnared Longbeard miners in Ormgren (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Ensnared Longbeard miners can be found in Ormgren in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Lokur has informed you that several Longbeard miners exploring Ormgren have been ensnared by unsettled glow-worms. You should help free the ensnared miners."},
[8233]={"Defeated many lost spirits.","Completado","You have defeated many lost spirits along the river Gladden, making the Vales of Anduin safer.","Defeat lost spirits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A strange darkness has come to the Vales of Anduin. Lost spirits move along the river Gladden. These fell beings should be defeated if the Vales are to remain safe.","Lost spirits can be found along the river Gladden.\
\
You should defeat lost spirits.","Defeated lost spirits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lost in the Swamp","Lost spirits move along the river Gladden."},
[8234]={"Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.","You find Rhûd-pulo-Drât, unharmed, but he runs off before you get a chance to speak with him","'Tears of rain, yet another Drúadan missing. First Bhai-buri-Ghân, who die by foul, cursed Orc. Now Rhûd-pulo-Drât. You help find Rhûd-pulo-Drât. He know much of Drúedain beliefs and ancient rituals.'","The tracks meander slowly, moving deeper into the woods","Search for the missing Wose","There is an ancient darkness emanating from this mysterious foe","Arriving at the last known location of the Wose, Rhûd-pulo-Drât, you spot footprints","Defeat the unknown creature","Ghân-buri-Ghân, chieftain of the Drúedain, asks of you to find Rhûd-pulo-Drât, a Wose who has recently gone missing.","You describe to Ghân-buri-Ghân the strange creature that frightened Rhûd-pulo-Drât and attacked you.\
\
'You describe Dheghûn. They not from Drúadan Forest. Recently come here from unknown around same time Wood-troll turn to shadow. Dheghûn now threat too when they attack you and Rhûd-pulo-Drât. Must keep balance, yet so many pushing rocks.'","Defeat the strange creatures that scared off the Wose you found.","Speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân","The last place the missing Wose was seen was in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
You should search for the missing Wose.","Lost in the Wood","You should follow the footprints and continue searching for the missing Wose."},
[8236]={"Forced into the sewers of Osgiliath after a staggering defeat by the Morgul-host, Mablung and the Rangers of Ithilien struggle to survive beneath a stronghold of the Enemy.","Search for Mablung's Rangers in Osgiliath (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Mablung's Rangers can be found throughout Osgiliath.\
\
Mablung has asked you to seek the Rangers he sent to scout the surface of Osgiliath and order them to return to his post.","Found Mablung's Rangers in Osgiliath (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Lost, But Not Forgotten","'Ah, you have my thanks, ${PLAYER}. I see a few of my men have returned already, and I am certain the rest shall soon follow.\
\
'Yet, I know little of the fate of my captain, Faramir, and I shall not count him among the dead while he remains lost. I have a mind to search for him within Osgiliath, for none that survived our flight into the tunnels saw him escape.\
\
'If you will join me and my men in our search for Faramir, you are welcome among us for as long as your journey allows it.'","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have found several of Mablung's Rangers and should now return to him in the culverts.","Talk to Mablung in the sewers of Osgiliath","'It will be some time before I can return you to Arodor, stranger. Faramir is lost, as is Osgiliath, save for the secret ways beneath the city. You are fortunate, indeed, to have made it down here alive... for many of our company were not so swift.\
\
'Our number is few, but several of my men scout even now from hidden ways within the city's walls. However, we cannot remain scattered any longer if we are to hold against the Enemy, so I would ask that you seek my men among the Enemy's forces in the city and order their return. \
\
'If I know my men, they shall be well-hidden!'","The Ranger noticeably flinches and readies his weapon as you approach.\
\
'I feared my position was discovered... I am sorry, stranger. Mablung has sent you?\
\
'I shall return to the tunnels with haste, but I cannot abandon my post until my friend returns and we have saved more of our old records.'","'So, Mablung sends me to the surface to search for arms and now he wishes for me to return just as soon as I find a secure position? Faramir would not have us hide in the culverts and cower while our people die!\
\
'I will return when I finish my task, and not a moment sooner. If I should die, it will be in the aid of my brothers, not backed into a corner like a hunted beast.\
\
'The host of Minas Morgul has no shortage of workers and warriors, and I would deprive them of any advantage that may be left behind. Aid me, and I shall return!'","'You are fortunate that you did not bear the markings of the Morgul-host, stranger, else I would have struck you down before you dared step so close.\
\
'I shall heed Mablung's order in time, but if you wish to count yourself among us, you shall aid me first - for there are far more pressing matters at hand.\
\
'What shall it be, ${CLASS}?'","'You startled me, stranger! I have almost finished my patrol, but I could use your aid if I am to quicken my pace and return to the culverts.\
\
'I promise you, I shall be a more gracious companion than any others you might find roaming the City of Stars.'"},
[8237]={"Collect salvage wood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected salvage wood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Aradax","You have retrieved some salvage wood from around Lothgobel and should return it to Aradax in Lothgobel.\
\
Talk to Aradax in Lothgobel.","A Corsair has asked you to retrieve scrap wood from around town.","'Thank you. I appreciate your help.'","Lothgobel Salvage Wood","'The war has produced no shortage of scrap wood. Most woodworkers only want to work with fresh stock. They don't know how to make the most of their resources. But me? Well, those of us who have lived on the sea know treasure when we see it. I've struck a deal with some of the townspeople. They collect and lay out old wood for me, and I turn it into something useful and sell it back to them.\
\
'Take care of today's collections. My back can't handle the heavy lifting today.'","Aradax has asked you to collect scrap wood from around Tathrendalf."},
[8238]={"Find and confront Jajax","The smell of smoke on the air does not bode well","Lothgobel is in central Lamedon.\
\
You should investigate Lothgobel for signs of Corsair intrusion.","You have seen a great deal of evidence showing that the enemies here are uniformly loyal to a Corsair named Jajax.\
\
You should seek out this captain and confront him about his ransacking of Lothgobel.","The Watchman can be found in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with the Watchman about what should be done next against the Corsair threat.","Investigate the streets of Lothgobel for signs of Corsair intrusion","'I am Jajax, Captain of these men. What is it you seek? An honourable death? Or perhaps to join the Corsairs and seek riches across the wide world? Maybe you wish to kill me and all of my men. These are your choices three.'","Lothgobel and Reports of Corsairs","Homes can be found in Lothgobel in central Lamedon.\
\
You should search homes for signs of Gondorians or the invading Corsairs.","'I think we must look into the reports of Corsairs sighted in Lothgobel, just south down the road from here. They might need help, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Are you willing to look into it? Please be careful. The Corsairs are dangerous foes....'","Speak with the Watchman of Dínadab","Investigate homes in Lothgobel (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'I thank you for all that you have done for us, dear ${PLAYER}. It sounds as if the Corsairs mean to menace far more than our little corner of Gondor.\
\
'The Watchman surely has need of your aid, and we can ask no more of you.'","You should investigate the rumours of Corsairs in Lothgobel, to the south","You heard rumours that Corsairs were seen moving into Lothgobel in central Lamedon."},
[8239]={"Defeat vicious boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated vicious boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lothgobel's Wild Boar Problem","Alagiel has asked you to defeat vicious boars near Lothgobel.","Talk to Alagiel","'Vicious boars have been attacking my poor animals! Please do what you can to reduce their numbers.'","'Oh that sets my heart at ease. Thank you, traveller.'","Tell Alagiel that you have culled some boars.","A farmer asks you to help protect Lothgobel by fighting off wild boars."},
[8245]={"Recoge planes de batalla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los planes de batalla a Sileffind","'Ahora nos parece evidente que los orcos de Moria están planeando un ataque contra el Bosque de Oro, ${PLAYER}, y cuanto mejor preparados estemos, mejor será nuestra defensa.\
\
Busca orcos y trasgos allí donde los encuentres, tanto en las afueras de Lothlórien como por toda Moria, y recoge cualquier cosa que pueda darnos pistas sobre su plan de batalla.\
\
Difundiremos la noticia entre otros aventureros como tú: cuanto más aprendamos de los planes de los orcos, mejor preparados estaremos cuando llegue el ataque.'","Preparativos de Lothlórien I","Sileffind se encuentra en Caras Galadhon. Los orcos y trasgos en las afueras de Lothlórien y por toda Moria pueden llevar planes de batalla que ayuden a los elfos a prepararse para el ataque.\
\
Sileffind te ha pedido que derrotes a orcos y trasgos y recojas de ellos los planes de batalla.","'Te doy las gracias, ${PLAYER}, por estos numerosos planes. Estudiaremos las maquinaciones de los orcos para estar preparados para el ataque que sin duda se avecina.'","Planes de batalla recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sileffind cree que los orcos de Moria están planeando un ataque contra Lothlórien y quiere que busques sus planes de batalla.","'Sigo esperando más planes de batalla por tu parte, ${PLAYER}. La escritura de orcos y trasgos es oscura y desordenada, y necesitamos muchas páginas de sus notas si queremos desentrañar sus planes. Además, sus líderes no confían en las tropas con todos los detalles, de modo que cuantos más planes tengamos que examinar, más información obtendremos de ellos.'"},
[8246]={"Donndageth se encuentra en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has derrotado a numerosos orcos y trasgos en las peligrosas mazmorras de Moria y deberías regresar con Donndageth con noticias de tus victorias.","Derrota a orcos y trasgos en las mazmorras de Moria (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los orcos y trasgos más poderosos pueden encontrarse en las numerosas y peligrosas mazmorras de Moria: las Forjas de Khazad-Dûm, el Tesoro Olvidado, la Gran Escalera y la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Donndageth te ha pedido que derrotes orcos y trasgos en las peligrosas mazmorras de Moria para limitar las fuerzas que podrían atacar Lothlórien.","Preparativos de Lothlórien II","Orcos y trasgos derrotados en las mazmorras de Moria (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los orcos y trasgos más poderosos se encuentran en las mazmorras de Moria, ${PLAYER}: las Forjas de Khazad-Dûm, el Tesoro Olvidado, la Gran Escalera y la Sala Decimosexta. Derrota a muchos de ellos para que no puedan atacar el Bosque de Oro con toda su fuerza.'","Donndageth te ha pedido que derrotes orcos en las numerosas mazmorras de Moria para reducir las fuerzas disponibles para su inminente ataque contra Lothlórien.","'¡Muy bien, ${PLAYER}! Esos enemigos no participarán en el ataque contra Lothlórien gracias a ti.\
\
La batalla se acerca sin cesar, estoy seguro de ello, pero ellos se la perderán. ¡Nosotros, en cambio, no!'","Habla con Donndageth en Caras Galadhon","'Los orcos van a atacar Lothlórien, ${PLAYER}; eso está claro. Aún se desconoce cuándo lo harán, pero este conocimiento previo nos dará la fuerza para oponernos a ellos cuando llegue el momento.\
\
Muchos de sus combatientes más poderosos habitan en las mazmorras más profundas y oscuras de Moria: las Forjas de Khazad-Dûm, el Tesoro Olvidado, la Gran Escalera y la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Derrota a orcos y trasgos en estas mazmorras y regresa con la certeza de que hemos debilitado en cierta medida sus fuerzas de ataque.'"},
[8247]={"Un ataque contra Lothlórien por parte de los orcos de Moria está sin duda por venir, y Mithenn quiere asegurarse de que los puestos avanzados en la frontera expuesta de Fanuidhol estén abastecidos.","Habla con Faelleron en Talan Fanuidhol","Faelleron se encuentra en la base de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Has entregado una caja de suministros a Talan Fanuidhol y ahora deberías hablar con Faelleron.","'Dejé algunas cajas de suministros justo fuera de la entrada de Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}. Recoge una de ellas y llévala a la base de Talan Fanuidhol para que mis hermanos allí estén bien abastecidos cuando llegue el ataque de los orcos.'","Mithenn, dentro de Caras Galadhon, quiere que lleves los suministros que dejó fuera de las puertas de la ciudad hasta la base de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Mithenn quiere asegurarse de que las talan en las afueras del expuesto Fanuidhol estén bien abastecidas para el ataque de los orcos.","Preparativos de Lothlórien III","'No sé cuándo llegará el ataque de los orcos, ${PLAYER}, pero sin duda será pronto. Me preocupan mis hermanos en los puestos avanzados de la frontera de Fanuidhol, pues esa tierra está expuesta hacia el oeste y desde allí es probable que se lance el ataque.\
\
He estado llevando suministros justo fuera de la entrada de Caras Galadhon. Si llevas algunos de estos suministros a la base de Talan Fanuidhol, te lo agradeceré, y también lo harán mis hermanos.'","Has entregado los suministros a Talan Fanuidhol","'Gracias por traer estos suministros de parte de mi hermano Mithenn, ${PLAYER}. Parece cada vez más probable que los orcos inicien pronto su ataque, y nos alegraremos de contar con estos suministros.'","Recoge suministros fuera de la entrada de Caras Galadhon"},
[8248]={"Habla con Sileffind en la entrada de Caras Galadhon","'Puedes recoger una caja de la pila aquí y llevarla a Sileffind, ${PLAYER}. Él está ayudando a preparar la defensa en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.'","Una pila de cajas se encuentra junto a Aesgyl en Telain Galadhrim. Sileffind está en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Se te ha pedido que lleves una caja a Sileffind en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.","'Los Orcos de la Moria son un asunto de gran preocupación, ${PLAYER}, y necesitamos estar preparados para el ataque que seguramente se avecina.\
\
'Toma una caja de la pila y llévala a Sileffind en la entrada de la ciudad. ¡Pero ten cuidado, porque no podrás subir ninguna escalera mientras lleves la caja!'","'Necesitas hablar con Sileffind ahora que has entregado los suministros, ${PLAYER}.'","'¡Gracias por traer estos suministros, ${PLAYER}! Ahora estaremos mejor preparados para enfrentarnos a los Orcos.'","Sileffind está en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has entregado una caja a Sileffind y ahora deberías hablar con él.","Aesgyl ha preparado algunos suministros para ayudar en la defensa de Lothlórien contra los Orcos de Moria.","Recoge una caja de la pila cerca de Aesgyl","Preparativos en Lothlórien IV"},
[8249]={"Caught wayward verses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Were you able to find the verses? They must be around here somewhere!'","'What? Sleep overtook me again?! Oh, hello. I wonder if you’ve seen… well, this is rather embarrassing. I have been collecting bits of poetry and romantic verse… for, uhm, inspiration. Yes, that’s it. I need a poem to read for a performance at which my beloved… well, my eventual beloved, Lírveril, will be present. She loves poetry and attends the annual show here in Minas Tirith every year.\
\
'I collected some of the best verses from the old masters of the craft, and was in the process of organizing them into the best love poem that has ever existed! Or, I had been, that is. You see, I seem to have dozed off, during which time some dotard opened a nearby window!\
\
'All my hours of hard work, my years of longing, my very careful copying of the very best love poems - ah, that is, gathering inspiration. All of it! Ruined by one nap! Say, have you a few moments to help me find those pages, friend? I could make it worth your while! How far could they have even gotten? I was asleep a mere… well, best to get started!\
\
'Oh, my thanks, my thanks! I will look around the desk here if you will search the rest of the library.'","Colladan is located in the Houses of Lore in Minas Tirith.\
\
Bring the wayward verses to Colladan.","'It's a bit stuffy in here, do you not agree?'\
\
The young woman looks up towards where Colladan is with a smirk, then returns to reading her book.","'Were you able to find the verses? Ah, thank you, thank you! I must get back to compiling, er, writing the words with which I will win Lírveril's love!'","Catch wayward verses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wayward verses can be found around the Houses of Lore in Minas Tirith.\
\
You should collect wayward verses for the hopeful poet.","A romance stricken young man needs help impressing his poetry-loving lady friend.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Love Is In the Air","Bring the wayward verses to Colladan"},
[8250]={"'¡Excelente! Has logrado encontrar las flores perfectas para ayudarme a crear el ramo ideal para mi dulce dama. ¡Tienes muy buen ojo para las flores!\
\
'Aprecio sinceramente toda tu ayuda para encontrar estas flores tan raras. Ahora crearé un hermoso ramo digno de la mujer de mis sueños. ¡Estoy seguro de que este es el camino hacia su corazón!'","Recoge una violeta","Recoge una prímula","Lleva las flores a Avery Manzanagria","Has recogido una prímula","Las caléndulas pueden encontrarse cerca del círculo de piedra fuera de Cavada Grande, las violetas más allá de la Puerta Oeste de Bree, y las prímulas en el círculo de piedra sobre Celondim.\
\
Al darse cuenta de que no puede reunir el valor para hablar cara a cara con la dama de sus afectos, Avery Manzanagria te ha pedido ayuda para recolectar una combinación de flores de todos los rincones de Eriador.","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Me preguntaba si podrías ayudarme, pues estoy en una situación delicada. He descubierto que mis sentimientos por cierta mujer han crecido hasta un punto que ya no puedo ignorar. Ella es la flor más hermosa entre las malas hierbas. Camina en mis sueños y el sonido de su voz es una melodía que los bardos podrían cantar durante siglos. Claro que hay un pequeño problema... aún no he hablado con ella. Simplemente no logro reunir el valor para acercarme; solo la he observado desde lejos, paseando por la ciudad. ¿Qué podría decirle? Temo causar una pésima primera impresión.\
\
'Aquí entra mi petición, pues tengo un plan brillante para cortejar a la mujer de mis sueños. Por favor, ¿podrías recolectar tres tipos de flores en todo Eriador? Solo lo mejor para mi dulce dama. Tráemelas y crearé el ramo más hermoso que una mujer podría desear. Solo necesito tres variedades: una caléndula, una violeta y una prímula.\
\
'Las caléndulas pueden encontrarse cerca del círculo de piedra fuera de Cavada Grande, las violetas cerca del círculo de piedra más allá de la Puerta Oeste de Bree, y las prímulas cerca del círculo de piedra fuera de Celondim, en las Montañas Azules. ¡Ten cuidado y regresa tan pronto como puedas!'","Has recogido una caléndula","Has recogido una violeta","El amor es Como una Flor","Recoge una caléndula","El enamorado Avery Manzanagria ha caído rendido por una mujer a la que ha estado admirando desde lejos por Bree.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'¡Hola de nuevo! ¿Olvidaste dónde encontrar esas flores? Necesitaré caléndulas, violetas y prímulas. Espero que las encuentres pronto, porque no puedo esperar para crear un ramo digno de la mujer de mis sueños!'"},
[8251]={"Recolecta carne dura de jabalí en Minas Vrûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reservas de comida bajas","Los jabalíes han tomado las ruinas de Minas Vrûn, al este de Amon Raith.\
\
Amarion te ha pedido que caces los jabalíes de Minas Vrûn para que pueda alimentar a los granjeros que se han refugiado en Amon Raith.","Llevar carne dura de jabalí a Amarion","Carne dura de jabalí recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Eres ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} a descansar aquí un tiempo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, pero me temo que no encontrarás mucha paz. Cosas malignas se agitan en Fornost, mientras que las colinas de Annúndir al este son devastadas por los huargos. Estas personas cuentan conmigo para su defensa....\
\
'Alas, la comida escasea, y temo dejarlos solos mientras cazo. Amon Raith fue en tiempos una posición defensible, pero solo soy un hombre.\
\
'Si decides no hacer caso a mi advertencia y viajar al este, ¿podrías cazar los jabalíes que vagan por Minas Vrûn? Han tomado esas ruinas y no muestran señales de irse.''","'¡Eres tan hábil en la caza como ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]}, ! ¡Esta carne durará mucho tiempo! Los huargos y los trasgos no pueden quedarse en Annúndir para siempre, y con esta carne podré alimentar a las familias de Annúndir que han venido a mí en busca de protección. Te agradezco.''","'No confundas mi decepción con reproche, ${PLAYER}, pero esperaba que cazaran algunos de los jabalíes de Annundir al este y regresaran con algo de su carne. Mis reservas de comida no durarán para siempre, y aquí en Amon Raith hay muchas bocas que alimentar.\
\
'Si realmente debes cazar los jabalíes del Camino Verde, puedes hacerlo, pero puede que encuentres la tarea mucho más difícil.'","El montaraz Amarion está en Amon Raith, al oeste de Annúndir y al este del Camino Verde.\
\
Amarion espera que regreses con la carne de jabalí con la que espera alimentar a los granjeros bajo su cuidado.","El montaraz Amarion estaba acampado en Amon Raith, vigilando las tierras circundantes. No estaba preparado para cuidar de los granjeros que huían de la invasión de Angmar en Annúndir."},
[8252]={"'If you dally too long, those perfectly good oranges will not be so good anymore!'","You collected the perfectly good oranges you found lying on the ground. You should return to Meliri at Burukíri in Ambarûl.","Low Hanging Fruit","Meliri wants you to collect any perfectly good oranges you find lying on the ground. They are found in the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl.","Bring the oranges to Meliri","Collect perfectly good oranges (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You see, these oranges are perfectly good! Nothing wrong with them at all. Some may be a little ugly, but it all tastes the same. It is good they will not go to waste. Thank you for your hard work.'","Collected perfectly good oranges (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Say, while you are out there running about the orange trees, there is another useful thing you could be doing. Sometimes oranges fall off of the trees before we are able to harvest them. If you get them off the ground quickly enough, they are still perfectly good. No food should be left to go to waste. If you see any perfectly good oranges on the ground, pick them up, will you? I will pay you for the work, of course.'","Meliri insists that no food should go to waste and has asked you to pick up any perfectly good oranges off of the ground before they can go bad."},
[8253]={"Te has ganado la confianza de Naethmunn","Gánate la confianza de Forchon","'Siento mi desconfianza, pero estos son tiempos peligrosos y engañosos.'","Prueba de lealtad","Te has ganado la confianza de Astiul","Te has ganado la confianza de Forchon","'Gwindeth no se dignará a recibirte.'","Los montaraces Astiul, Forchon y Naethmunn están en el campamento de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido que ofrezcas tu ayuda a tres de sus hermanos. Cuando estén convencidos de que tu corazón es puro y no planeas saquear las tumbas de los Dúnedain, considerará de nuevo tu proposición.","'He tenido noticias de mis hermanos, ${PLAYER}, y me dicen que están convencidos de que eres quien dices que eres. Te pido disculpas por mi desconfianza, pero toda precaución es poca con desconocidos en estos días oscuros, sin importar qué cartas digan que portan.\
\
'Te ayudaré a conseguir el Silithar para mi señor Aragorn, aunqueo yo no tengo el poder para hacerlo. Debo ir a hablar con Gwindeth, y creo que es mejor que vaya solo.'","Gánate la confianza de Astiul","Gánate la confianza de Naethmunn","'Me pones en una situación difícil, ${PLAYER}. No puedo ayudarte sin primero realizar una prueba de actitud, pero si de verdad te envía Aragorn, cualquier retraso es una afrenta para mi señor.\
\
'No tomaré esta decisión solo. Presta tu ayuda al resto de mis hermanos: a Astiul, Forchon y Naethmunn. Una vez que estén seguros de que eres una persona de fiar y no te mueven motivos viles, consideraré una vez más tu petición.\
\
'Encontarás a mis compañeros montaraces aquí en Tinnudir. Si, de lo contrario, se demuestra que nos has mentido, 'te arrojaré al lago junto con tus amigos saqueadores de tumbas!'","Calenglad te ha pedido que ayudes a sus compañeros montaraces en Tinnudir. Una vez que estén satisfechos con la ayuda que prestes, considerará de nuevo tu propuesta.","Calenglad está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has convencido a sus hermanos de que tu corazón es puro y debes volver con Calenglad para pedirle de nuevo su ayuda para conseguir el Silithar para Aragorn.","'Encontrarás a Astiul, Forchon y Naethmunn aquí en Tinnudir. Préstales tu ayuda, y una vez que todos estén satisfechos con tu trabajo, reconsideraré tu petición.'"},
[8255]={"Everard te espera en su casa en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
Everard Holebourne estará encantado de recuperar su piedra de la suerte.","Recoge la piedra de la suerte","Busca la piedra de la suerte en la carcasa del ciervo","Lleva la piedra de la suerte a Everard Holebourne","La guarida del oso está al norte de Sobrecolina, en las laderas sobre las Piedras de Tronco.\
\
Everard Holebourne te ha pedido que recuperes su piedra de la suerte de la carcasa del ciervo que mató, la cual fue arrastrada a una guarida de osos.","Has recogido la piedra de la suerte","'¿No pudiste encontrar la carcasa del ciervo y mi piedra en la guarida del oso? Búscalas al norte de aquí, en las laderas al norte de las Piedras de Tronco.'","'¡He perdido mi piedra de la suerte! Acababa de abatir un ciervo cuando de repente un oso —un oso marrón enorme— se llevó la presa y la arrastró. No me importa el venado, pero necesito mi piedra de la suerte. ¡No puedo cazar sin ella!\
\
Por favor, ayúdame si puedes y recupera la piedra de la carcasa del ciervo. El oso la arrastró hasta esa gran guarida al norte de aquí. Seguramente está en las laderas al norte de las Piedras de Tronco, devorando el ciervo que maté.\
\
¡Toda mi suerte se fue con esa piedra!'","Piedra de la suerte","'¡Ahora que tengo de nuevo mi piedra de la suerte, siento que mi suerte está cambiando!'","'¡Sin mi piedra de la suerte, mi puntería era peor que nunca!'","'¡La has encontrado! ¡No sé cómo agradecerte! Esa piedra tiene toda mi suerte, lo sé!'","Everard Holebourne perdió su venado y su piedra favorita por culpa de un oso merodeador.","'¿Has encontrado ya mi piedra de la suerte? Estoy seguro de que la hallarás en la carcasa del ciervo, en la guarida del oso...'"},
[8256]={"Los cadáveres de orcos se encuentran esparcidos por las fronteras norte y sur de Lórien, al este de Echad Andestel.\
\
Celegúien te ha pedido que busques los cuerpos de orcos abatidos por flechas en las afueras de Lórien y te ha advertido que no te acerques demasiado a la frontera. Quiere que recuperes las flechas para que puedan volver a usarse contra los orcos.","'Los orcos de Moria son numerosos, ${PLAYER}, y en los últimos días se han vuelto más audaces que nunca. Algunos incluso han logrado cruzar la frontera del Bosque, aunque ninguno volverá a salir con vida de Lothlórien.\
\
'Los agudos ojos de los Galadhrim detectan rápidamente el paso de las huestes orcas, y cualquier orco que sea descubierto no puede esperar vivir mucho tiempo. Pero hay tantas de estas viles criaturas que las flechas de los Galadhrim pronto comenzarán a escasear.\
\
'Busca cuerpos de orcos a lo largo de la frontera del Bosque de Oro, al este de aquí, y recupera las flechas de sus cuerpos. No te acerques demasiado a la frontera, ¡pues los Galadhrim podrían dispararte desde las sombras si no te reconocen! No te acerques demasiado al límite si valoras tu vida.'","'Muy bien, ${PLAYER}. La flecha élfica que mata a más de un orco es, sin duda, una flecha afortunada.'","Afortunada la flecha que mata dos veces","Recupera flechas de cadáveres de orcos cerca de la frontera de Lórien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Celegúien te ha pedido que recuperes flechas de los arqueros Galadhrim que ya han sido usadas para abatir orcos en las afueras del Bosque de Oro.","Flechas recuperadas de cadáveres de orcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las flechas élficas a Celegúien","Celegúien se encuentra en Echad Andestel, el campamento en las riberas del Nimrodel, al oeste de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Has recuperado flechas de los orcos abatidos a lo largo de la frontera de Lórien y ahora deberías llevárselas a Celegúien.","'No has recuperado suficientes flechas de los orcos.'","'Los orcos que se acercan demasiado a las fronteras de Lórien son abatidos por las flechas de los elfos ocultos que protegen esta tierra. Viaja al este hasta la frontera del Bosque de Oro y recupera las flechas de los cadáveres de orcos para que puedan volver a usarse. Ten cuidado de no acercarte demasiado a la frontera, ¡o podrías ser alcanzado por los Galadhrim ocultos!'"},
[8257]={"Glân Vraig lay far to east and south of Lugazag.\
\
After taking Lugazag away from the Enemy, the army of the Free Peoples have sent you to Glân Vraig to request reinforcements for the tower.","Deliver the message without defeat","Your mission has failed","Lugazag is now under the control of the Free Peoples. In order to keep the tower under the ownership of the Free People reinforcements must be called to defend its walls.","Another has informed the Captain-General, support arrives shortly","Talk to Tordúr at Glân Vraig","Lugazag is fallen to the Army of Angmar","'Word must reach the Captain-General that Lugazag is wrested from the foe.'","'Forces will be dispatched to the tower at once. This news is well-received, my friend.'","Support must not be present at Lugazag","Lugazag Reinforcements","'This victory is hard won, and we must act swiftly to see that it is not in vain. The close proximity of the Enemy to this tower makes the acquisition of more forces imperative.\
\
'I need you to make your way to Glân Vraig to request those reinforcements from Captain-General Tordúr.\
\
'Be swift and safe and tell the Captain-General of our need.'","Angmar's Army must not control Lugazag"},
[8258]={"La placa dice: 'Luilloth, princesa, madre, esposa, campeona.' Detrás de la placa encuentras un pergamino","Habla con Rhiangar para escuchar su historia de Luilloth","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que encuentres una estatua de Luilloth en Dol Ernil y que busques pistas en su base.\
\
La estatua de Luilloth está en Dol Ernil.","'¡Has vuelto! Me alegro de volver a verte. ¿Qué traes?'\
\
Agarra el pergamino de tu mano y lo desenrolla cuidadosamente.\
\
'Esto es fascinante. Fascinante. Puedo leer un poco, pero la mayoría de las palabras son demasiado antiguas y no consigo entenderlas. ¡Pero reconozco el nombre de Luilloth! ¡Seguro que el pergamino habla de ella!'","Hace miles de años, una princesa dio descanso a los muertos y salvó el reino. Sin embargo, perdió todo al hacerlo.","Lleva el pergamino a Rhiangar","Luilloth, la princesa regente de Cardolan","Rhiangar sonríe al verte.","'Mi padre era la razón principal por la que volví, pero dice la verdad cuando dice que hubiera vuelto por mi cuenta también. He estado investigando acerca de una antigua regente de esta tierra, Luilloth. Hace mucho tiempo, fue la princesa regente, cuando su hijo era demasiado joven para ostentar el trono. Luilloth era muy querida por su gente, y bajo su reinado la tierra prosperó.\
\
'¡Cardolan fue antaño una poderosa región, con príncipes y princesas, caballeros y maestros artesanos! Ahora es todo ruinas, espíritus y criaturas peligrosas. La naturaleza ha reclamado las colinas, y las grandes murallas de las fortalezas han sido asediadas por el Bosque Viejo.\
\
'¿Escucharás mi historia de Luilloth?'","Encuentra a Rhiangar Nevit cerca de Dol Ernil","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que vayas a su encuentro cerca de Dol Ernil.\
\
Dorn Ernil está en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Busca la estatua de Luilloth","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que escuches su historia de Luilloth.\
\
Rhiangar se encuentra en la Posada de la Encrucijada, la posada de Herne.","¡Has descubierto un antiguo pergamino al examinar la estatua de Luilloth! Deberías llevarle el pergamino a Rhiangar.\
\
Rhiangar está al lado del camino, cerca de Dol Ernil.","'Luilloth era la princesa regente de Cardolan hace miles de años. Era famosa por su valentía y por la sabiduría y amabilidad con la que gobernaba como regente hasta que su hijo cumpliese la mayoría de edad. No queda mucho de su historia, sin embargo, pero mi madre me contaba sus historias cuando era joven. Como ves, mi madre viajó a DoL Ernil antes de mi nacimiento. Allí, leyó una inscripción en la base de una estatua antigua que decía que Luilloth expulsó a los espectros que asolaban la tierra.\
\
'Padre me alejó de ello, y no hay mucho que pueda hacer aquí ahora. ¡No puedo entrar a Dol Ernil sin estar en peligro, pero debo saber qué es lo que hay en la base de la estatua! A lo mejor puede ayudarnos a entender lo que está pasando en Cardolan.¡Por favor! ¡Vamos a Dol Ernil! ¡Yo esperaré junto al camino, donde es más seguro, pero tu no tendrás problema en buscar la estatua!'","'¡Gracias por venir a mi encuentro! Se dice que la estatua de Luilloth está en estas ruinas. No me atrevo a ir sola, pero tú eres muy capaz y no correrás peligro. ¡Busca la estatua, por favor!'"},
[8259]={"Luistin lossoth recogido","Recoge un luistin lossoth","'¿No has encontrado aún ninguno de nuestros luistin? No me sorprende, pues rara vez los perdemos. Pero si encuentras alguno, tráemelo y trataré de devolverlo a su propietario.'","Juha te explicó cómo los Lossoth pueden correr sobre el hielo a gran velocidad gracias a los huesos que atan a sus zapatos.","Juha está en Sûri-kylä y en Pynti-peldot, en Forochel.\
\
Juha te ha pedido que estés atento por si encuentras algún luistin que los Lossoth hayan perdido durante sus travesías por las tierras heladas y que se lo lleves.","Lleva el luistin a Juha","'Puedo ver que la fortuna sonrió a los Lumi-väki cuando llegaste a Forochel, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, pues mucho has hecho por ayudarnos. Y ahora quisiera pedirte otra ayuda, aunque menos urgente que otras.\
\
'Tal vez hayas visto a los Lumi-väki correr sobre el hielo. Lo hacemos gracias a unos huesos que atamos a nuestros zapatos —los llamamos luistin. Nuestro pueblo los ha usado durante siglos, recorriendo grandes distancias a gran velocidad sobre la tierra helada. A veces, sin embargo, uno puede tropezar y caer, y perder un luistin. Es una pérdida amarga, pues estos luistin son difíciles de fabricar.\
\
'Si encuentras algún luistin en tus viajes, tráemelo. Intentaré devolverlo a su dueño.'","Luistin — Introducción","'¡Has encontrado uno de nuestros luistin! Haré todo lo posible por averiguar quién es su dueño, pues seguramente lo estará echando en falta.\
\
'¡Gracias, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} !'"},
[8260]={"Scattered lumber collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Camaen is disturbed by all the lumber scattered around Parth Rest due to fauna disturbing the workers.","You have collected as much lumber as you can and returned it all to its proper place. You should report your success to Camaen.\
\
Camaen can be found in Parth Rest.","The lumber has been stacked","Collect scattered lumber (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you for your help ${PLAYER}. Everyone's contribution to the restoration is highly valuable, no matter how trivial the task.'","Talk to Camaen in Parth Rest","'The workers are constantly pestered by the local fauna, which means a lot of our supplies are sometimes left scattered about.\
\
'The war has left us wanting for able bodied workers, especially ones with stronger convictions. Whether it be the distraction of an adorable creature or fear of a larger predator, our workers just drop their quarry and run off into the horizon. We make do, I suppose.\
\
'Could you find any of the scattered lumber left by my distracted workers and place the pieces in a pile next to me?'","The lumber should be placed in its proper place by Camean in Parth Rest.","Camaen has asked you to collect the scattered lumber around Parth Rest.","Place the lumber in its proper place","Lumber Disarray"},
[8261]={"Talk to Dervorin in Ethring","Herion has asked you to investigate the missing lumber supplies from Ethring.\
\
Ethring can be found in Ringlo Vale to the north.","Talk to Raithir in Ethring","Raithir has told you that Dervorin should be able to help as Lord of the Vale.\
\
Dervorin can be found in Ethring.","'I take it things are back to normal at Barad Rill?\
\
'It is good to see the lighthouse be a guiding light for Gondor once more....\
\
'As I was saying, supplies to this camp from the lumber mills in Ringlo Vale have stopped. We have not yet heard word of why. Their lumber is vital to our efforts here. Many of my people have not yet returned, and I fear the worst.\
\
'Perhaps you could shed some light in this dark hour?'","Lumber from Ethring","'Another has come looking for their lumber I presume?\
\
'Wait, is that you, ${PLAYER}?'","'Who are you?\
\
'${PLAYER}?\
\
'Oh, you must be from Parth Rest looking for the lumber.\
\
'Look, I know nothing. But I would look for Dervorin. As Lord of the Vale, he should be able to help you with your inquiry.'","Herion is worried that the lumber supply from Ethring in Ringlo Vale has been disturbed."},
[8262]={"Coloca los trozos de madera en una caja de almacenamiento","Madera del Bosque Salvaje","Recoge trozos de madera en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes guardar los trozos de madera en una caja de almacenamiento.","Trozos de madera recogidos en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El anuncio del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesita: madera del Bosque Salvaje para obras y reparaciones. Se recompensará su esfuerzo.'","Alguien ha puesto una tarea para recoger madera en el Bosque Salvaje.","En el Bosque Salvaje hay árboles de los que se puede obtener madera.\
\
Deberías recoger los trozos de madera."},
[8263]={"El pozo minero cerca de Sori está repleto de gusanos luminiscentes, cuyas entrañas se pueden utilizar para fabricar una especie de antorchas.","'Bueno, como puedes ver, el pozo que hay justo a mi lado está completamente infestado de aquellos repugnantes gusanos luminiscentes. \
\
'Quizá puedas hacerme un favor y aplastar a esos asquerosos bichos y, ya que estás, recoger un poco de esa sustancia luminiscente que les da ese inquietante resplandor. Creo que puedo convertir parte de esa sustancia en una especie de antorcha que me ilumine el camino en esta maldita oscuridad.'","Lleva la sustancia luminosa a Sori","Sustancia luminosa conseguida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Ah, qué maravilla! Bueno... quizá no sea una maravilla, pero ya sabes a qué me refiero. Puedo untar esta sustancia pegajosa en cualquier cosa y me iluminará mientras deambulo en la oscuridad. ¡Probablemente me hayas salvado de más de un tropiezo, ${PLAYER}!'","Consigue sustancia luminosa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Recoge la sustancia luminosa de esos horribles gusanos luminiscentes, si no te importa. Creo que esa asquerosa sustancia me resultará de gran utilidad.'","Sustancia luminosa","Sori se encuentra en el pasadizo sur de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Sori con la sustancia luminosa que has recogido de los gusanos luminiscentes."},
[8264]={"Rocheledh is at Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt.\
\
You should bring the stingers you collected to Rocheledh so that he may craft a useful antidote from their luminous venom.","'Welcome to our small stronghold, good ${CLASS}. We are beset by dangers all around, both in the swamp-lands and beyond. There are many poisonous things, and while they do not threaten us, a great risk is posed to our horse-friends, and those of other races who travel with us as well.\
\
'I saw the fell glow of fireflies as we travelled here, and such a sickly light can only be poison from such a creature. Could you collect the stingers of these flies? I could use the venom stored within to craft an antidote, as a precaution.\
\
'Please collect for me as many stingers as you can, but be careful -- I do not wish to see you come to harm. These insects are strong and swift and will have no mercy upon any who draw too near.'","Rocheledh is concerned that many sources of poison are potential threats to those who assist the Golden Host on their venture through Mirkwood. He wishes to craft an antidote to have on hand against the firefly poison.","'You may find the stinging flies throughout the Drownholt, glowing among the darkness of these dense trees. Be wary of their poison, mellon!'","Aguijones luminosos recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los aguijones luminosos a Rocheledh en Estolad Mernael","Luz venenosa","'¿Has conseguido algún aguijón de las luciérnagas? Puedes encontrarlas por todo el Bosque Ahogado.'","Consigue aguijones luminosos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}; you have done well to bring me these. Now I can set to work at making a draught that will act against this venom.\
\
'What a sickly glow emanates from it still!'","Fireflies can be found throughout the Drownholt in Mirkwood.\
\
Rocheledh has asked you to collect the venomous stingers of fireflies so that he may craft an antidote against the poison. He fears for safety of the Elf-friends who travel with the Malledhrim."},
[8265]={"Defeat Orcs or hobgoblins in Lumrog","Completado.","Within the encampment of Lumrog, Orcs and hobgoblins serve foul hill-trolls that make this place home. If these creatures are dispatched, the trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow.","Defeated Orcs or hobgoblins in Lumrog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Without their lackeys, the hill-trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow. Lumrog has been made safer, if not completely safe, by your efforts.","The encampment of Lumrog echoes not only with the heavy footfalls of hill-trolls, but also with the shrieks and cries of their servants and allies. If these Orcs and hobgoblins are slain, the trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow.","Completado","Defeat Orcs or hobgoblins in Lumrog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lumrog Lackeys"},
[8266]={"Lumrog Stompers","Hill-trolls have settled in the Misthallow, and the sound of their heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around their encampment. These creatures pose a danger to any who draw too near to Lumrog and should be defeated.","The sound of heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around an encampment of Lumrog. Hill-trolls have settled here and they pose a danger to those in the area.","Completado.","Lumrog has long been a home to a group of hill-trolls in Misthallow. The sound of their heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around their encampment striking fear into the hearts of the nearby residents.","Defeat hill-trolls in Lumrog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat hill-trolls in Lumrog","Completado","The sound of the trolls stomping around Lumrog has quieted some, thanks to your efforts. Lumrog will never truly be safe, but you have lessened the danger these massive creatures pose for the residents of Misthallow, and that is a good deed.","Defeated hill-trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8267]={"Defeated bats in Lumul-nar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, can be found in Zirakzigil, to the north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads.\
\
Frár has asked you to clear the Lumul-nar of bats and merrevail to make the place more suitable for the dwarves to take over.","Defeat merrevail in Lumul-nar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The bats and winged creatures you seek will be in Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, to the north of here in Zirakzigil.'","Based on the sounds and odours wafting from near the entrance to Lumul-nar, Frár believes that the Hall of Mirrors is infested with bats... or worse. He does not think that the mirrors can be restored when their home is teeming with so many vile winged creatures.","'I believe Hrólfur wanted me to arrange this meeting with you because I am the only dwarf thus far to venture so near the entrance to Lumul-nar before my courage failed. I heard many chilling shrieks that made me tremble, and the smell was terrible.\
\
'All I could imagine was fluttering bat-wings blocking out the sun, and where there are bats, there are surely fearsome merrevail to be found as well. These hideous creatures cannot be allowed to continue their inhabitance of this promising hall if the rumours of the mirrors are true.\
\
'Go to Zirakzigil, north of here, and you will find the entrance to Lumul-nar as I did. If I were you, ${PLAYER}, I would bring a stout companion or two with you when you go.'","Frár is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, to the south of Lumul-nar.\
\
You should speak with Frár of your defeat of the many bat-creatures in the Hall of Mirrors.","'To defeat so many of the vile beasts was quite a feat, ${PLAYER}! You have done very well indeed against our foes in the Hall of Mirrors. We will surely be able to make progress there after your deeds today.'","Lumul-nar: Smothering the Sun","Defeat bats in Lumul-nar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Frár","Defeated merrevail in Lumul-nar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8268]={"Lumul-nar: The Bane of Illumination","'The creature is defeated? Then you have done what I could not! I applaud you, ${PLAYER}. Your services to the Iron Garrison will never be forgotten.'","Defeat the evil presence in the Hall of Mirrors","'The menace of Lumul-nar awaits you in the Hall of Mirrors, ${PLAYER}. You should strike north from here, towards Zirakzigil. The entrance to Lumul-nar is beyond there.'","The Hall of Mirrors can be found in Zirakzigil, to the north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads.\
\
Frár has asked you to defeat the menace that holds the Hall of Mirrors in its clutches. You should bring a friend or two on this dangerous venture.","Frár is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, to the south of Lumul-nar.\
\
You should speak with Frár and inform him of your success against Ergoth in the Hall of Mirrors.","'Hello, ${PLAYER}. Hrólfur tells me you are here to give us a leg up on our enemies. I will not turn my nose up at the help! The illumination of our halls will wreak havoc on the ill-accustomed eyes of Moria's foes.\
\
'When I was exploring Durin's Way, I very nearly found myself in Lumul-nar, where you plan to go. But some great evil there sapped my will, and I decided I valued my life more than my curiosity at that particular moment.\
\
'I saw and heard many clues of what terror may lurk within, but I do not wish to speak of it. All I ask is that you defeat whatever holds Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, in its evil clutches. But I beg you to bring a friend or two with you, for I had not the heart to make this venture alone.'","Frár of the Chamber of the Cross-roads explored near the entrance to Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, and recalls that a great feeling of menace turned him from his path.","Habla con Frár","Ergoth has been defeated"},
[8270]={"Almuerzo para las Vigilantes","Entrega comida y bebida a Lhian y Cledd.","'Gracias por ayudar. Estos son tiempos difíciles para Musgovilla, pero si nos apoyamos mutuamente, saldremos adelante, ¿verdad?'","'Lleva una cantimplora y un sándwich a cada persona en guardia, por favor.'","'¿Hmm? ¿Una entrega de almuerzo? Ah, para la gente nueva que olvida traer comida y bebida. Bien, una vigilante experimentada como yo recordó traer la suya.'\
\
Lhian te guiña un ojo y palmea la alforja en su cintura.\
\
'A menos que... ¿es pollo con champiñones y cebolla? ¿Con romero?'\
\
Lhian abre su alforja.\
\
'Dámelo, por favor.'","Entrega comida y bebida a Eryl.","'¡Disculpa! ¿Podría molestarte para que me ayudes con algunas entregas?\
\
'Más de nosotros nos estamos ofreciendo para turnos en las torres de guardia. La gente nueva olvida empacar un almuerzo. ¿Podrías llevar estos sándwiches y cantimploras a quienes estén de guardia?'","Debes informar a Rhedyn que completaste tus entregas.\
\
Habla con Rhedyn.","Rhedyn te pide llevar un pequeño refrigerio a cada guardia de torre a lo largo del muro.","'¿Cordero? ¡Oooh, me encanta el cordero! Cordero cordero hmm hmm como un caldero...\
\
'¡Oh! ¡Todavía estás aquí! ¿No... me oíste cantar una canción sobre el cordero, verdad? No estoy acostumbrado a... quedarme aquí parado sin hacer nada todo el día. Canto sobre las pequeñas cosas que veo para mantenerme ocupado.\
\
'...\
\
'Por favor no se lo cuentes a nadie.'","Gwion da un largo trago de la cantimplora antes de hablar.\
\
'Empaqué cerdo salado para comer. Olvidé traer algo para beber, y no sería apropiado que dejara mi puesto para buscar algo. Gracias por el agua, y dale mis gracias también a la panadera.'","Entrega comida y bebida a Gwion.","'¿Oooh almuerzo? ¡Eso es maravilloso! Uf, mi barriga estaba empezando a gruñir como un gato enfadado. Me ofrecí para tomar el turno del mediodía hasta el atardecer pensando \\qOh bueno, solo almorzaré fuerte y esperaré una gran cena. No necesitaré un tentempié.\\q Pero déjame decirte, estar parado horas sin nada que mirar excepto el pasto tiene una forma muy extraña de abrir el apetito.\
\
'Oh, pero no te entretengas con mis parloteos. Ahora vete y dile a la panadera que es encantadora y considerada. ¡Gracias a ambos!'","Entrega comida y bebida a Deris","Habla con Rhedyn","Entrega comida a los guardias en las torres a lo largo del muro defensivo de Musgovilla."},
[8272]={"Bog-lurkers have been creeping into Makham Mijann.","Defeat bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Makham Mijann has been overrun by bog-lurkers!","You should clear some bog-lurkers out of Makham Mijann to make their numbers more manageable.\
\
Makham Mijann is located to the north of Tadrent.","It seems that once dismantling efforts in Makham Mijann ground to a halt, bog-lurkers began creeping in.\
\
You should clear some out of the area to make their numbers more manageable.","You have defeated many bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann. When the residents of Tadrent return to dismantle the rest of the camp, they should have no problem with the bog-lurkers.","You have defeated many bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann.","Defeated bog-lurkers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lurkers in the Marsh","Completado","Defeat bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann"},
[8273]={"Bloody bog-lurkers can be found in the red waters of Agarnaith.\
\
You should defeat bloody bog-lurkers.","Lurking Hunger","Defeated bloody bog-lurkers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","'You know about Bog Lurkers? They bad news, and Agarnaith's are the worst. They out there, waitin'. Try to drown you and eat you! You find any, you kill them dead!'","Agarnaith's bog lurkers are even more dangerous than the normal variety, lurking under the water, waiting to drown their victims. Viznak has asked you to destroy any you find.","Defeat bloody bog-lurkers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Viznak","'Good riddance! Bog-lurkers are the worst. Try to eat me all the time! Not gonna, though. Viznak is too smart for them.'"},
[8275]={"Goblin looters can be found stealthily skulking near Ainhard's homestead.\
\
You should defeat goblin looters.","Defeated goblin looters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Goblins are still lurking in the forest near Ainhard's home, waiting for an opportunity to steal from him.","Lurking Looters","'Be on your guard, ${PLAYER}. I can still smell some goblins lurking nearby. I suspect they are waiting for us to leave, so they can kill Ainhard and steal from what remains of his home. We will show those cowardly vermin what happens to those who cross the Beornings!'","Defeat goblin looters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Langhár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","'Hah! That will teach them. The rest should scurry like rats back to the holes from which they crawled!'","Habla con Langhár"},
[8276]={"'That ought to raise the reputation of Mâr Naphra. The fewer of these filthy creatures roaming about the vicinity, the better.\
\
'Of course, a reward for honest work!'","Lurking in the Bogs","Defeat bog-lurkers in Basha Ghând (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You seen them nasty creatures out in the bogs to the north? Filthy. Disgusting.\
\
'Takes away from our most reputable establishment, wouldn't you agree? I'm looking for strong folk such as you to clear them out. They're gettin' aggressive and we can't have them roaming about causing the most prestigious clientele discomfort.\
\
'Do what you can, eh?'","Erothai has asked you to clean up the bogs to the north so that Mâr Naphra maintains such a high status as an establishment.","Talk to Erothai","Erothai is concerned that the bog-lurkers are becoming more aggressive, heightening the threat of attacks on Mâr Naphra.","You've done all you can to clear the bogs. You should talk to Erothai and give your full report.\
\
Erothai can be found in Mâr Naphra.","Defeated bog-lurkers in Basha Ghând (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8277]={"Worms and salamanders can be found in Talath Úrui, mainly near the Ghâshghurm.\
\
You should defeat any worms and salamanders that you encounter.","Sierpes derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Worms and salamanders thrive in the embrace of the Ghâshghurm.","Lurking in the Flames","Derrota sierpes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The safety of Talath Úrui is hampered by the many worms and salamanders encroaching the land thanks to Ghâshghurm. You should lower their numbers and thus their hold upon the realm.","Defeated salamander (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat salamanders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Talath Úrui is safer to cross now that you have defeated a great number of worms and salamanders.","Defeated many worms and salamanders in Talath Úrui."},
[8278]={"'Oh, por favor, no me hables hasta que puedas asegurarte de que esas cosas repugnantes ya no están aquí para atormentar mi imaginación.'","Nökkvi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Debes regresar a Nökkvi y asegurarle que has derrotado a las bestias sinnombre.","'Has aliviado mucho mi mente, ${PLAYER}. Ahora quizás pueda simplemente olvidar todo esto...\
\
¡¿Qué?! ¿Viste cadáveres de enanos allí? ¿Y estaban siendo devorados? ¡Ai-oi!'","Los Sinnombre se pueden encontrar en todas las Fundaciones de Piedra, especialmente a lo largo del borde oriental del lago.\
\
Nökkvi desea que te deshagas de los horrores sin nombre que lo han estado aterrorizando","Habla con Nökkvi en el Refugio Sombrío","Derrota a Sinnombre en las Fundaciones de Piedra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Ah! ¡Quizás puedas ayudar!\
\
¿Has visto a estas horribles criaturas sinnombre? Se han infestado especialmente en la zona de la orilla este del lago. Te ruego, ${CLASS}, que vayas allí y nos liberes de algunas de estas cosas repugnantes. \
\
¿Te has dado cuenta de que algunas ni siquiera tienen cabeza? ¡Qué asco!'","Acechando en las sombras","Nökkvi teme a las extrañas y sinnombre horrores que ha visto en las Fundaciones de Piedra.","Sinnombre derrotados en las Fundaciones de Piedra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8279]={"Esperando en la oscuridad","Los orcos pueden encontrarse en la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras al sur de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Sylfa te ha pedido que lances un ataque preventivo contra los orcos mientras sus compañeros avanzan hacia el oeste.","'¡Mantén a los orcos a raya! No queremos darles ni un centímetro para que lancen su propio asalto.'","Ansurr se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, al oeste de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras.\
\
Observaste que los orcos que derrotaste eran diferentes a los que habías visto en toda Moria, con extraños crecimientos cubriéndolos. Ansurr debería estar al tanto de esto.","'Gracias por mantenerlos a raya, ${PLAYER}. Nos diste el tiempo suficiente para llegar aquí. No es... ideal, pero servirá por ahora.\
\
'¿Estaban cubiertos de algún tipo de hongo, dices? Eso debe ser la razón por la que dejaron de atacarnos. Algo más los atacó... pero ¿qué podría ser? ¿Qué podría haber ahí abajo?'","Los orcos no han atacado el puesto de los enanos en la Bodega Putrefacta durante varios días. Sylfa teme que estén preparando un asalto mayor y quiere que presiones el ataque mientras la mayoría de los enanos de la Bodega Putrefacta avanzan hacia el oeste a un nuevo puesto avanzado.","Derrota a los orcos en la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcos derrotados en la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh","'Los ataques de los orcos que han llegado últimamente han sido terribles. Apenas pudimos repeler el último hace unos días, y luego de repente se detuvieron.\
\
'Sé que no los hemos matado a todos... Puedo sentirlos por la noche, merodeando más allá de la luz de las antorchas. Temo que estén preparando un asalto final que será nuestra perdición. No podemos esperar a que caiga el martillo, ${PLAYER}. Debemos llevar la batalla a ellos antes de que estén listos y alejarnos de su ataque.\
\
'Ese es tu papel aquí. Quiero que los tomes por sorpresa. Su campamento se encuentra cerca de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras al sur. Mientras presionas el ataque, varios de mis hombres se moverán hacia el oeste a un nuevo puesto avanzado. Cuando hayas terminado, reúnete con Ansurr allí.'"},
[8280]={"En el Páramo Alto propinaste un golpe rápido y mortal a un lince de hermosa piel. La bestia se abalanzó sobre ti y, tras derrotarla, reclamaste un digno trofeo con la esperanza de encontrar un sastre élfico que pudiera usar la piel para confeccionar una capa elegante.","Los Elfos habitan en el valle oculto de Rivendel, en los límites orientales del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Atacado por el Lince del Páramo Alto, venciste a la bestia y descubriste que tus golpes no dejaron marca alguna en su piel. Tras retirar la piel con destreza, deberías buscar a un armero élfico que pudiera convertirla en una capa magnífica.","Capa de Piel de Lince","'En todos mis años, no he visto al lince acechando entre las rocas. Sin embargo, he vivido largo tiempo dentro de la seguridad de Imladris. Las bestias salvajes se vuelven más agresivas con cada día que pasa y el Mal despierta en el corazón de la Tierra Media.\
\
'Tu victoria demuestra tu astucia y tu habilidad, y tejeré una capa con este manto que esté a la altura de tu hazaña.'","Lleva la piel de lince a un armero élfico para que confeccione una capa","Aunque es hermosa, hay poco que puedas hacer con esta piel de lince. Si encontraras a un sastre élfico hábil, quizá podrías convencerlo de trabajar la piel y convertirla en una capa elegante."},
[8285]={"You have restored honour to Léofdag's name","Léofdag's wife, Fleda, is in Aldburg.\
\
Burnoth asked you to return Léofdag's body to his wife, Fleda, and tell the people of Aldburg of his valour and honour in the Battle of the Hornburg.","'I thank you, ${PLAYER}, for all you have done for me and my family. I knew that my father's accusations were unjust and remained faithful to my husband. I would never have believed that my father would repent of his error, but you made him see that he was blinded by his wrath at the death of Éomund.\
\
'You have been a friend to Léofdag...will you accept this gift?'","Fleda is in Aldburg.\
\
Now that the memorial for Léofdag has ended, you should speak with Fleda.","'It is well that we will remember Léofdag's courage and honour, ${PLAYER}, but it is not enough. He was accused falsely by his wife's father, Gartorn of Aldburg, and because of it, his family suffers disgrace. Léofdag should be returned to his family to be buried in honour...would you return his body to his wife, Fleda, in Aldburg and tell the people of his heroism in the Battle of the Hornburg?\
\
'The dishonour he suffered at Gartorn's prompting must be put right, and as a witness of his valour and honour, you are the best suited to do so.'","Speak with Burnoth to return Léofdag's body to Fleda in Aldburg","Talk to Fleda","Léofdag's Return","Léofdag perished at the Battle of the Hornburg, vindicating himself from the accusations against his honour."},
[8286]={"'Te doy la bienvenida a la Cámara de la Encrucijada, ${PLAYER}. Estamos bastante ocupados por aquí, como sin duda puedes ver, y ciertamente nos vendría bien tu ayuda. Nuestro campamento es un enlace vital en la cadena de suministros entre el Umbral de Durin y la Sala Vigesimoprimera, lejos hacia el este. Es también casi imposible que nada pase ante nosotros sin que lo detectemos, ¡así que es muy importante que defendamos esta cámara contra los trasgos y los orcos!\
\
'Si tienes a bien ayudarnos, deberías hablar con Fostólf, Rink y Gansi... tienen asuntos bastante importantes que necesitan atención, o eso me han dicho.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que yo también puedo encontrar alguna tarea para ti.'","Has ayudado a Fostólf","Ayuda a Fostólf","Ayuda a Rink","Los enanos de la Cámara de la Encrucijada necesitan ayuda para establecerse allí.","'Gracias por ayudarnos, ${PLAYER}. Ahora que hemos asegurado nuestra posición en esta cámara, ¡podemos dedicar nuestra atención a otros asuntos urgentes!'","Los compañeros de Líkmund","Fostólf, Rink y Gansi están en la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Líkmund te ha sugerido que hables con Fostólf, Rink y Gansi, y averigües qué tareas podrían tener para ti.","Has ayudado a Gansi","'Ayuda a Fostólf, Rink y Gansi. No tiene sentido deambular en la oscuridad sin un propósito... ¡serías la carne fresca del próximo estofado de un trasgo!'","Has ayudado a Rink","Habla con Líkmund en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Ayuda a Gansi","Líkmund está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\\Deberías volver a ver a Líkmund y hablarle sobre tus esfuerzos ayudando a Fostólf, Rink y Gansi."},
[8288]={"Dile a Murdaigán que Machan está a salvo.","'¡Maldita sea mi orgullosa estupidez! Nunca debí aventurarme en esta guarida de sierpes por mi cuenta. Son demasiados, y ahora que he encontrado este lugar seguro, no me atrevo a intentar escapar por mi cuenta. \
\
¿Puedes ayudarme a escapar? Te pediría que no se lo digas a los otros cazadores, ¡me ridiculizarían por el resto de mi vida!'","La locura de Machan","'Entonces Machan está a salvo, ¿no? Bien. Es un hombre impulsivo y orgulloso, y temía que pudiera haberse metido en problemas por su cuenta.\
\
No es que algo así pueda suceder, ni que su orgullo le permita ser rescatado si lo hiciera.'\
\
'Sospecho que yo... y Machan... te debemos más gracias de las que tu historia sugiere, así que te doy las gracias más sinceramente.'","Ayuda a Machan a salir de la guarida de los sierpes de fuego.","Machan buscó tonta y solitariamente cazar sierpes de fuego y terminó atrapado y herido.","Habla con Machan cuando puedas ayudarlo","Has salvado a Machan"},
[8289]={"Siege machines can be found at Nîn-stazg to the south-east of Floodwend.\
\
You should destroy siege-weapons that you find in the woods.","Talk to Radwig at Nîn-stazg","Find out why Etta suddenly protests","The young Thane Radwig is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Radwig.","Destroy siege-machines (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'While you were gone, we lost control of one of our watch-towers, and the Orcs who took it renamed the encampment Nîn-stazg.\
\
'These enemies are from Mordor, ${PLAYER}. Mordor! I understand you have experience with such foes. I will go there myself and fight them, and I hope you will join me.\
\
'Ah... my mother wishes to say something. Well, please do not take too long. I will meet you out on the field of battle, my friend -- at Nîn-stazg!'","Thane Radwig is on a hill overlooking Nîn-stazg.\
\
You should speak with Thane Radwig.","Radwig wishes to meet you outside of Nîn-stazg, an Orc-encampment in the south-east of the Wold.\
\
You should search for Radwig near Nîn-stazg, for he wishes to help you drive out the Orcs there.","Machines of War","'Do not encourage him, ${PLAYER}! Radwig is no warrior yet, and he endangers his life with such mad ideas.\
\
'No, Radwig, you must not go to this Orc encampment.'","'I long for the day when I can fight my own battles without adults interfering....'","'My lady Etta has sent us to protect the Thane. He should not go into battle, but he may observe the battle from here, should he wish it.'","Return to Radwig outside of Nîn-stazg","Destroyed siege-machines (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hear Radwig's reply","Etta, mother of Thane Radwig, is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Etta.","Machines of war are being constructed at Nîn-stazg, and their purpose is to lay Floodwend to ruin. Radwig wishes to go fight the forces of Mordor himself, but his mother is not thrilled with this idea.","You encourage the youth Radwig to remain safe with his guards, for these Mordor Orcs are fierce, and his people need him","'Nonsense. My father would never have stood by while the forces of Mordor captured our defences. I will go and fight these Orcs. How else will I command the respect of my people?\
\
'My mother cannot change my mind.\
\
'I will see you at Nîn-stazg, ${PLAYER}! I look forward to drawing my sword with yours.'","'It was a pleasure to watch you fight, ${PLAYER}! I have never seen such bravery on the training ground. When I saw you fight, I imagined my father in battle, and it gave me heart.\
\
'You were good to destroy those siege-machines. They would have done Floodwend much harm. The next time Orcs attack our lands, it will be me hewing at their limbs!'","'My... my mother sent these guards to keep me out of harm's way, and now they will not let me anywhere nearer Nîn-stazg than this. So many Orcs! Yet I yearn to prove myself in battle....'\
\
Your heart goes out to this bold young man, but it is clear that this is not the time for him to be fighting.\
\
He was brave for venturing out, but he is not ready, and he is of more use to his folk alive than dead. You tell him what you think."},
[8290]={"Men cast aside their weapons and shields when they fled in terror from their posts along the wall at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
Ingold has asked you to retrieve the weapons and shields the men dropped when they fled.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Find frightened soldiers and convince them to return (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'${PLAYER}! An icy chill grips my heart, and it takes all of my strength to stand here at the wall; my heart quails, and would have me fly from my post in terror!'\
\
Ingold lowers his voice and speaks in hushed tones.\
\
'The Enemy has catapulted vile ammunition onto the city: heads they have taken from soldiers caught outside the walls, in the Pelennor and Talath Anor. The barrage has caused men to cast down their weapons, fleeing from the sight of friends and family returned in this horrible fashion. I am not immune to this weapon of Mordor! I have recognized faces in that terrible rain: it was the fate of Barathant, ${PLAYER}, and I wept to see it.\
\
'Can you gather up the weapons and shields that were dropped by frightened men as they fled their stations? We need that equipment, and those men, if we are to stand against the armies of Mordor!'","'Thank you for gathering up that equipment, my friend. Now we need men to wield them once again!\
\
'I do not blame them for running. Evil are the sights in war, but this is worse than even a hardened soldier of Gondor could expect. But we must not give up hope! If the men who ran do not return and fight, they will prove great allies to the foes outside the city. Only by returning to their posts and facing their fears can they strike a blow against such evil!\
\
'Find the men who ran, ${PLAYER}. Tell them to return! We need every soldier of Gondor to master his fear and stand against the host of Mordor, or all is already lost.'","Ingold is the besieged city, atop the wall at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
You have retrieved weapons and shields cast aside by men when they fled, and should return now to Ingold.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","'Find the men who ran, ${PLAYER}. Tell them to return! We need every soldier of Gondor to master his fear and stand against the host of Mordor, or all is already lost.'","Retrieve abandoned shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Retrieve abandoned weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Gather up the weapons and shields that were dropped by frightened men as they fled their stations, ${PLAYER}. We need that equipment, and those men, if we are to stand against the armies of Mordor!'","Retrieved abandoned shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Retrieved abandoned weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ingold is in the besieged city, atop the wall at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
You have convinced some of the fleeing men to return to their posts, despite their terror.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Frightened soldiers can be found in the besieged city, at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
Ingold has asked you to convince the men that ran from their posts to return.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","You have found Ingold engaged in the defence of the city, and he struggles against the pall of terror that has fallen upon Minas Tirith.","'You did well, my friend. I, too, will fight until the last of my courage is spent, in order to avenge the sad fate of my friends! Barathant will be avenged, and if it is in my power to prevent the destruction of Gondor, I will do it!'","Mad With Terror","Talk to Ingold in the besieged city, atop the wall at the north end of the Third Circle"},
[8291]={"Talk to Halhir","Freed imprisoned Rangers of Ithilien (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Have you passed through the square, stranger? I doubt you have... for your head still sits upon your neck.\
\
'They gather the imprisoned in the theatre to the south, and then they drag them out into the square to be tortured... and beheaded. They play with the bodies, and they toss around the heads laughing with those horrible Orkish tongues. After a time they burn the corpses, but the heads they keep, and I do not know to what vile end - nor do I wish to.\
\
'This is war, ${PLAYER}... make no mistake of that. If you are to be one of us, you must know the horrors we have endured. Make for the square and free any of our men that yet live, and slay any of those Troll-men that stand in your way!'","Free imprisoned Rangers of Ithilien (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Imprisoned Rangers can be found in and around Meneldil's Square in western Osgiliath.\
\
Halhir has asked you to free imprisoned Rangers of Ithilien before they are executed in Meneldil's Square.","While scouting the western side of Osgiliath, Halhir learned of the horrible fate that awaits all who are captured by the Morgul-host.","Halhir can be found due east of the Palace of Eldacar in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have rescued many imprisoned Rangers and should now return to Halhir.","'It pains me to see so few left alive, but any who were spared that fate have truly been granted a new life.\
\
'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Made to Suffer"},
[8293]={"Search for the source of the spiders' madness in Lhingroth","The cave of Lhingroth can be found in the hills to the east of Sardol.\
\
Amathon has asked you to brave the depths of Lhingroth in hopes of finding what has roused the spiders.","Amathon can be found in Sardol, to the west of Lhingroth.\
\
You have been confronted by an oath-breaker of the Ruthless Dead who warned of their intent to break their curse without fulfilling it.","A grim altar reminiscent of the Paths of the Dead stands before you...","'The Dead have never left the hill before... this does not bode well for the vale, nor does it bode well for Gondor.\
\
'If the Dead have somehow managed to pledge themselves to this powerful ally, their aggression is likely being guided. They must know that such an agreement is folly though... the curse can only be broken by one.\
\
'I must think on what is to be done, but Malthellam must be told of this... and soon!'","A queer chill seems to be emanating from this path...","Examine the skeleton beneath the altar in Lhingroth","Madness Under The Mountain","DNT -- will not be seen","As you examine the bones, a ghastly oath-breaker rises forth to attack!","The spiders of Blackroot Vale have grown far more violent and bold in recent days, and Amathon of Sardol hopes to discover what caused this furor.","Talk to Amathon","A suspiciously preserved skeleton can be found in the depths of Lhingroth.\
\
You have found a strange altar, and what appear to be preserved bones. You should examine them before returning to Amathon.","You have slain the oath-breaker, but must bring these ill tidings to Amathon","Search for the source of the chill in Lhingroth","'Before you go, I have something else to ask of you.\
\
'Spiders have long lived under Tarlang's Peaks, but we have never seen them in such force until very recently. I am hesitant to suggest this... but if the Dead have returned to the vale, I cannot help but think they may be involved somehow.\
\
'You are the mightiest among us, ${PLAYER}, and I would ask that you search Lhingroth for anything that could be agitating the spiders. Please... I wish to be wrong, but I cannot quiet these thoughts until I know the truth.'","The chill seems to be emanating from the path to the right in Lhingroth.\
\
You feel a peculiar chill inside Lhingroth and should investigate further."},
[8294]={"La entrada a las quebradas residenciales de Imladris se encuentra al sur de las caballerizas de Rivendel. Hirthamel te ha sugerido explorar las colinas y hondonadas, y quizás considerar vivir allí tú mismo.","Observas colinas onduladas cubiertas de densas hojas otoñales","Visita la plaza del vallón","Visita una gran villa","Maedol N'i-Mâr Dhín","Una propiedad hermosa, lista para ser decorada con cuidado y dedicación","Visita una cabaña sencilla","Visita la entrada del barrio","'¡Saludos! Confío en que nuestro hermoso valle haya sido un paseo agradable para ti. Hay espacio de sobra, si te enamoraste de él tanto como yo.\
\
'No hallarás mejor lugar para encender tu hogar, colgar tu sombrero y disfrutar del amanecer y el atardecer con un reconfortante trago de tu preferencia.'","Encuentra una buena vista del valle","Una vista sobrecogedora, enmarcada por los picos de las Montañas Nubladas","'Mae-govannen, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Provengo del humilde valle de Imladris. Debes haber viajado mucho y tus pies estarán cansados. Te invito a buscar asiento y descanso en el Valle... aunque quizá no estés tan cansado como para no contemplar primero sus hermosas vistas.\
\
'Sé que los Hombres de Bree prosperan entre el bullicio de mercados densos y edificios amontonados unos sobre otros. Yo, en cambio, prefiero un lugar tranquilo al que llamar hogar; por eso este valle me resulta tan atractivo. Aunque, siendo sincero, es el único lugar que he llamado hogar. ¿Acaso compartes ese sentir?'","regresa con Hirthamel","Debes regresar con Hirthamel para contarle lo que has visto","Sin duda una morada con amplio espacio tanto para hermandad como familia","Puede verse la alegre actividad mientras los Elfos de Rivendel trabajan y comercian con gozo","Una pequeña pero cómoda cabaña se encuentra aquí, con vistas sobre el valle","Una brillante puerta dorada marca la entrada al valle superior","Visita una villa","Encaramados en lo alto de las colinas que dominan Imladris, los Elfos de Rivendel dan la bienvenida a todos los que buscan hogar y fuego, entre las hojas encendidas y las aguas murmurantes del Bosque de los Trolls.","Encuentra una vista del Bosque de los Trolls"},
[8295]={"Destroyed blood orbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy blood orbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have found a strange orb filled with what you believe is blood in Kaslokroz. It gives you an uneasy feeling; perhaps it is used by The Pale Herald for his dark sorceries. You decide that destroying it, and others like it, is probably in your best interests.","Habla con Legolas.","You tell Legolas of the strange blood orbs you destroyed in Kaslokroz.\
\
'Unusual. I have not heard of these before, but I suspect they are in some way related to his sorcery. Perhaps it is a vessel for when a living host is unavailable. You did well to destroy them, ${PLAYER}.'","Blood orbs can be found in Kaslokroz, an Uruk-hai camp.\
\
You should destroy the blood orbs.","You have destroyed the blood orbs in Rûkhor's camp.\
\
You should report your success to Legolas near Kaslokroz.","Magic of the Pale Herald","Strange orbs filled with blood and sorcery dot Kaslokroz, a camp of the Uruk-hai."},
[8296]={"Defeated Urâshi sandstorms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Shukûri","Shukûri has asked you to thin the numbers of wasps and sandstorms within the Gorge of Woe.","Derrota a las avispas Urâshi (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I see you have returned from the Gorge of Woe.\
\
'I thank you for your help with this, ${CLASS}. My journey is now much safer because of your actions this day. I must finish my preparations now as I have a long road ahead.'","Make Safe the Gorge","Defeat Urâshi sandstorms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'If you can spare the effort, I could use your help to clear out the Gorge of Woe.\
\
'I am making my preparations to leave this place, and the path is no longer safe now that it has become infested with dangers. I ask that you rid the area of the wasps and sandstorms that reside here while I finish what I must do.'","Return to Shukûri in the Gorge of Woe and let her know that you have thinned the number of enemies in the area.","Defeated Urâshi wasps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Shukûri in the Gorge of Woe has asked you to help her with thinning the number of wasps and sandstorms in the area."},
[8298]={"Dry driftwood collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Mae govannen. Recently, the lumber supply from Ethring has ceased. This has put a strain on our supplies for the rebuilding of Barad Rill, but nature provides! \
\
'The rivers that run from Ringlo Vale may have salvageable driftwood. Could you see if you can find anything worth keeping?'","Narthrien suggests you collect driftwood that is dry enough to be salvageable.","Talk to Narthrien in Parth Rest","You have collected a healthy amount of driftwood that could be of use as lumber in Parth Rest. You should bring it back to Narthrien.\
\
Narthrien can be found in Parth Rest.","Make Use of Nature's Gift","Collect dry driftwood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'We must make use of what nature provides, ${PLAYER}. This includes all the resources that are scattered due to the war.\
\
'This driftwood should be valuable as lumber while we wait for supplies to come back from Ethring.'","Narthrien may have a solution to Parth Rest's supply chain issue."},
[8299]={"Fastred will be pleased to hear that you have added to the collection of Orc heads outside Snowbourn. \
\
Fastred can be found inside the mead-hall in Snowbourn.","Beheaded Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fastred wants you to gather Orc heads to add to the grim display outside Snowbourn. \
\
Orcs can be found throughout the Sutcrofts.","'I am not certain that you saw it before you travelled out this way, but I have amassed a rather sizeable collection of Orc heads outside Snowbourn.\
\
'If you would be so kind as to provide more for my collection, I am certain I can find space enough for them. Now then, I will take my leave.'","Behead Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, beautiful work... your name?\
\
'${PLAYER}? Very well.\
\
'${PLAYER}, I am well aware of the problems facing this city as well as the rest of the Sutcrofts. \
\
'Our enemies have grown in number and I have heard grim news from the Wold. Nevertheless, Snowbourn remains strong and should it fall to me, I will ensure the survival of the Eastemnet myself!'","Fastred's hatred for the Orcs has shaped Snowbourn as of late. He has asked that you collect Orc heads to decorate the pikes outside the city as he returns to the mead-hall.","Making An Example","Talk to Fastred in Snowbourn's mead-hall"},
[8300]={"'Offram sent you with this pie? Thank you... it will go far to feed my family.'","Trozos de carne de uro reunidos(${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Take meat, flour, and vegetables to Ordbéorth's oven and bake meat-pies","Deliver meat-pies (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Offram outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth","'${PLAYER}, please take the meat you brought me and make some meat-pies for the people of Eaworth. You will need other ingredients, as well.\
\
'You will find sacks of flour and vegetables in the Vendor Hall. Take the ingredients to the oven behind Ordbéorth's house in the northern part of the city.\
\
'When you have finished baking the pies, bring them to the people in need of them, then return to me.'","'Have you something for me?'","Offram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth.\
\
You should return to Offram and let him know that you have delivered the meat-pies.","Making Meat-pies","Collected sacks of vegetables (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected sacks of flour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reúne trozos de carne de uro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pleased with your hunting prowess and offering of aurochs-meat, hides, and ivory, Offram has recruited you to perform more tasks.","'Dark times come, and this pie shall be a blessing in amid the storm. Thank you.'","'The people of Eaworth will remember your kindness, ${PLAYER}. Thank you!'","'We thank you for this gift, ${PLAYER}... you are a friend to the people of Eaworth.'","'This pie is an adequate compensation for the use of my oven.'","Delivered meat-pies (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Collect sacks of vegetables (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect sacks of flour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Offram knows the needs of my family. Thank you for this gift of food.'","Sacks of flour and vegetables can be found within the Eaworth Vendor Hall.\
\
Offram wants you to collect sacks of flour and vegetables to finish making meat-pies for the inhabitants of Eaworth.","Ordbéorth's oven can be found behind his house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Offram wants you to take the meat, flour, and vegetables to Ordbéorth's oven and bake meat-pies for the inhabitants of Eaworth.","People in need of provisions can be found throughout Eaworth.\
\
Offram wants you to take the meat-pies you baked to people in need of provisions for the siege."},
[8301]={"Find a good place to set off the fireworks","'If you can pick the pockets of those silly distracted patrons, I'll have a great deal of respect for you, ${PLAYER}. Money is wasted on folk like them!'","Pick pockets of wealthy patrons (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Many wealthy patrons have been distracted by your mischief!\
\
You should pick the pockets of the wealthy patrons for coins to give to the poor.","You have set off some distracting fireworks","Making Mischief","You will earn the respect of Gareth Rust if you manage to make trouble at the Festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","'Times have never been harder. A little money would go a long way amongst the workers.'","Gareth Rust is in the workers' area in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Gareth Rust and find out if he saw your excellent firework display.","The fireworks are stored at the top of the stairs overlooking the Festival Square.\
\
You should set off the fireworks to distract the wealthy patrons of the Festival.","Return to Gareth Rust with the pilfered coins","'Back again? Maybe I spoke unjustly the first time we met. Mayor Goodnough's wish to please folk like you is the reason folk like me go hungry this winter. But you don't seem like a bad sort, despite the Mayor seeming to like you.\
\
'If you want to earn yet more favour with me and my fellows here, you surely won't object to playing a little prank on the Mayor for the sport of the real townsfolk.\
\
'The mayor has some fireworks stored near the festival area, and he's intent on saving them for just the right moment. If you set them off where they are, you'll ruin the show (at least for him.) While the patrons are distracted, you should pinch Frostbluff Coins from their pockets! I can think of better uses for those coins....'","Looted a distracted patron (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'That was quite a display, ${PLAYER}! And judging from how close they were, I'll warrant you sent the mayor into a fit and disrupted things rather nicely!\
\
'Well done, well done. Here, you should keep half of what you managed to collect. These coins here will be enough to spread out among my friends so that they won't go hungry tonight!'"},
[8302]={"'I have stacked some reeds on the other side of the yard. Pick up a bundle and bring it to the workbench. First, you will use a knife to remove the green skin and then slice the inside of the reed into thin strips. Next, weave the strips together in a crosshatch pattern. Once that is done, with cloth on either side, the papyrus is pressed beneath a heavy weight.\
\
'Do you think you will remember all that? Get to it!'","Talk to Sûlmur","'Skilfully done! However, I must admit that if you return in three days you will not have usable papyrus. Once cut, the strips of reeds need to be soaked in water for three days to release the gum in the fibres that allow the papyrus to stick together. Your papyrus will fall apart.'\
\
She gives you an amused laugh.\
\
'But now you know how it is made. You are not angry, I hope.'","Use the workbench to press the woven reeds under a weight","Sûlmur has offered to walk you through making papyrus.","Papyrus reeds peeled and cut into strips","Papyrus strips woven together","You have completed all the steps of making papyrus. You should talk to Sûlmur.","Use the workbench to weave the strips together","You have a pile of papyrus reeds. Take them to the workbench, remove the green skin, and cut them into strips.","Collect reeds from the pile across the yard at Mehêtur, and bring them to the workbench.","You have peeled the papyrus and cut the inside of the reeds into thin strips. Now you should weave them together at the workbench.","Woven reeds pressed under weight","Use the workbench to prepare the reeds","Pick up a pile of papyrus reeds","You have woven the papyrus strips together. The next step is to press them under a heavy weight.","Making Papyrus"},
[8303]={"Saddled a horse (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The refugees' horses can be found at the head of their camp, north of Marton.\
\
You should saddle the horses to ready them for the dangerous journey to Helm's Deep.","Collected a saddle (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Agelwyn is in the refugees' small camp in the ravine north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","Agelwyn has asked you to ready the horses for travel, and to gather the weapons and shields for delivery to Helm's Deep.","Saddle the horses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect saddles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect spears and shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I suppose we must make ready now. Would you be so kind as to ready the horses and gather anything that we might need for our journey?\
\
'We must travel light, but I expect some spears and shields will come in handy. If we do not need them, the guardians of the Hornburg will want them.'","Speak with Agelwyn","Gathered a bundle of weapons and spears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Making Ready to Flee","'You work quickly, ${PLAYER}! I had hoped you would take longer, for I dread this next step.\
\
'I'll now see if I have what it takes to motivate my people. I cannot delay any longer. I hope you will come with us, my friend! You and Elstan strengthen my will.'","Shields, spears, and saddles can be found throughout the refugees' small camp north of Marton.\
\
You should collect spears, shields, and saddles for the journey, and ready the horses."},
[8304]={"'Captain Merenir sent you to spar with the lads? You have my permission to do what you can, ${CLASS}, but take it easy on them! Imloth Melui has need of fighters, and these recruits are the best we can manage at the moment. Can you believe it? These youths are the best warriors we have!\
\
'Do not break them! I need them back when you are finished! Just teach them what you can!'","'I have seen no real combat, and I wish I might keep it that way! You will go easy on me, will you not? You seem to be a fierce ${CLASS}, and I do not want to get hurt!'","'Ah, you did very well, ${PLAYER}, and I think you managed not to bruise too many of these warriors-to-be beyond repair. Every injury will teach them something important about combat, and they will be better prepared for facing a real enemy!\
\
'If every youth in Gondor learned to fight as you do, the kingdom would not want for warriors!'","The sparring area is high up in Imloth Melui, west of Lady Vanyalos' quarters.\
\
Fresh recruits are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills.","Hathalon can be found at the sparring area high up in Imloth Melui, west of the Hall of Lady Vanyalos.\
\
You helped Hathalon train some of the new recruits, and should see what he thought of your lessons.","Talk to Hathalon on the height, north-west of the Hall of Lady Vanyalos","Talk to one more young recruit at the sparring area in Imloth Melui","'Most of the warriors have been called away to war, and the few recruits that remain are young and untested. Our Master-at-arms, Hathalon, has his hands quite full trying to turn these boys into fighters. I know he could use your help, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The sparring circle is high above us, north-west of Lady Vanyalos's hall. Find Hathalon and offer your services, and I know he will make use of your skills. Imloth Melui needs as many warriors as she can get, even if she has to make them herself!'","Making Warriors","'I watched you fight, ${PLAYER}, and I am ready for your tricks. You will not defeat me so easily!'","Captain Merenir feels that if you sparred with some of his guards, it would raise their spirits and improve their form.","Hathalon can be found at the sparring area high up in Imloth Melui, north-west of the Hall of Lady Vanyalos.\
\
Captain Merenir has asked you to help Hathalon train some of the new recruits.","'I do not question your skills, ${PLAYER}. I have seen enough to know that you are a fierce opponent, but I am ready to face you. Underestimate me at your peril! Prepare for battle!'","Talk to another young recruit at the sparring area in Imloth Melui","Talk to a young recruit at the sparring area in Imloth Melui"},
[8305]={"Talk to Rhosun Turio at Maur Tulhau","Collect stag-antlers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rhosun Turio is an artist in Maur Tulhau who works with stag-ivory scrimshaw.","White stags can be found throughout the Gloomglens in Enedwaith.\
\
Rhosun Turio has asked you to collect stag-antlers for her to continue her scrimshaw.","'I'll need more antlers to continue my work, Duvodiad!'","'Have ye found such antlers as I need, giant?'","'Ho there... are ye that giant Rhus Cornchúthur befriended? I can't say I approve... what should we have to do with duvodiad? Well, while you're here, I suppose I could make use of ye.\
\
'I'm an artist, you see, and need materials for my work. I make art from the antlers of the white stags. Unfortunately, I usually have to settle with ivory that our hunters collect from stags which the Rhi Helvarch has slain... they are too afraid to hunt the stags themselves.\
\
'If ye could hunt some of the white stags and bring me their antlers... well, ye might make more of an impression on me.'","'Oh my! These antlers are most beautiful... they will become more beautiful yet at my hand!\
\
'Thank ye, Duvodiad! You've proven your worthiness to me.'","Rhosun Turio can be found in Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the stag-antlers you collected back to Rhosun Turio.","Collected stag-antlers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Making a Point"},
[8306]={"Talk to Dashên","Bring the provisions to Tibira in Western Khanâg","'If you are available, I am in need of someone who can brave the roads. As you can see, we do not have much in the way of farmland here. Most fruits and vegetables must be imported from other areas through trade.\
\
'Take this copper bar to Iridír. It is in Ambarûl, to the north, across the Ikorbân. Find the man called Dashên, and give him the copper bar for as much fresh produce as he will give for it, and then return here.\
\
'I hope you will do this, as you would not only be helping my business but also helping my customers have access to a variety of foods.'","'Hashtal-gûr! Back again, are we?'\
\
You tell Dashên that you are trading on behalf of Tibira in Western Khanâg and would like to buy produce.\
\
'One moment!'","You have traded Tibira's copper ingot to Dashên at Iridír in Ambarûl for fresh produce. You should return to Tibira at Western Khanâg in Khûd Zagin with the crate.","Bring the ingot to Dashên in Iridír","Tibira has asked you to take her copper ingot to Dashên at Iridír in Ambarûl and trade it for fresh produce.","Making a Trade","Dashên takes the copper ingot and hands you a crate loaded with a generous variety of fruits, vegetables, nuts, and a jar of honey.\
\
'There we are. Give Tibira my thanks for her business.'","Tibira has asked you to take her copper ingot to Dashên at Iridír in Ambarûl and trade it for fresh produce. You should talk to Dashên.","'${PLAYER}, you have the produce?'\
\
You give her the crate.\
\
'Dashên was kind to us today. It seems copper is fetching a fine price. Thank you for your help once again.'","Tibira has need of someone to travel to Ambarûl and make a trade for her."},
[8307]={"'¿Tienes esos huevos de los nidos? Solo necesito cuatro o más para esos cocineros.'","'¡Buen día para ti, joven ${PLAYER:dama[f]|amigo}. Parece que tengo un problema y me pregunto si podrías ayudarme.\
\
'Verás, tengo un par de cocineros esperando huevos de mis gallinas, pero el problema es que me he lastimado la pierna. No es nada grave, pero no puedo salir a recoger los huevos que necesitan los cocineros. No quiero decepcionarlos, así que me preguntaba si podrías revisar los nidos y buscar huevos.\
\
'Los nidos están justo en el patio. Cuatro huevos deberían bastar. Un aviso: no dejes que el gallo te vea recogiendo huevos. Si lo hace, dará un grito que pondrá nerviosas a todas las gallinas, y peor aún, ¡seguro que te sorprenderás tanto que dejarás caer los huevos que recogiste!'","'Solo sal y busca en los nidos huevos. No debería ser muy difícil encontrar suficientes.\
\
'Recuerda, no dejes que el gallo te vea, o pondrá a toda la bandada alterada, ¡y las gallinas no pondrán huevos durante días! Peor aún, ¡canta tan de repente que puede asustar a alguien con fuerza, podrías dejar caer los huevos!'","El granjero Arenilla está en su granja, al oeste de El Cruce.\
\
Lograste recoger suficientes huevos sin que el gallo te viera. Deberías llevarlos de vuelta al granjero Arenilla.","Huevos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Bien, has encontrado los huevos!\
\
Si aún puedes ayudarme, tengo más trabajo para ti. Con mi pierna lastimada, no podría entregarlos yo mismo!'","Llevar los huevos al granjero Arenilla","Los nidos de gallinas están alrededor del patio del granjero Arenilla.\
\
El granjero Arenilla te ha pedido que recojas algunos huevos de los nidos de sus gallinas, pero te advirtió que te mantuvieras alejado del gallo. Si te ve mientras recoges los huevos, llamará y molestará a las demás gallinas. Además, ¡seguro que dejarás caer los huevos que has recogido!","El granjero Arenilla se ha lastimado la pierna y no puede atender a sus gallinas ni a sus nidos.","El gallo te ha visto. Has fallado","No encuentras huevos en el nido","Recoger huevos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Haciendo las rondas","Evitar el gallo"},
[8308]={"You defeated the deadly stray warg, ensuring it cannot endanger Tadrent","'If you will leave Tadrent by the northern entrance and then circle around the town to the left, keeping an eye out for anything suspicious, you will be doing me a favour.'","Making the Rounds At Tadrent","Osbenn, an exhausted guard at Tadrent, has asked you to make his rounds for him.","Examine the Corsair corpse and remain alert","'You look like a reliable sort. Can I ask you to make my rounds for me? I am just exhausted.\
\
'You see, villagers reported hearing a howling in the hills, and I have spent all day tracking down the source of it... but I have nothing to show for it except my weary, aching bones. If you will leave Tadrent by the northern entrance and then circle around the town to the left, keeping an eye out for anything suspicious, you will be doing me a favour.'","Leave Tadrent by the northern entrance and circle around the town to the left","With a ferocious growl, a deadly warg leaps to attack!","Continue circling the town of Tadrent for Guard Osbenn","You have have begun making Osbenn's rounds for him, and should continue to circle the town of Tadrent on his behalf.","Guard Osbenn is in the centre of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","Osbenn asked you to leave Tadrent by the northern entrance and circle the town to the left.","This location marks the start of Osbenn's rounds; or it would, if he were making them","While making his rounds for Guard Osbenn, you have found the corpse of a Corsair.","This is the halfway point of Osbenn's rounds, which he is not making","Talk to Guard Osbenn in Tadrent, King's Gondor","If Osbenn were here, he would see the Corsair corpse in the grass. Instead... you do","'A dead Corsair? And a deadly warg? I am tired just thinking about the adventure I narrowly avoided, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Thank you for helping me with this, and for defeating the warg for which I spent most of the day searching! All's well that ends well, I suppose.'","You have reached the halfway point of Osbenn's rounds, and should continue to circle the town of Tadrent on his behalf."},
[8309]={"La salud de un tipo particular de abedul, llamado malbrethil por los elfos, parece afectar en gran medida a la salud general del bosque. Mallendathor está preocupado por su disminución y su estado y quiere que investigues la causa.","Las ramas de este retoño están caídas y su corteza parece frágil","Examina retoños de malbrethil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se pueden encontrar retoños de malbrethil en Taur Hith, al noreste de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Mallendathor quiere que encuentres y examines algunos retoños de malbrethil.","'¿Corteza frágil? ¿Ramas caídas? No son signos de ninguna dolencia que me resulte conocida. Creo que tendremos que buscar consejo sobre esto.'","Mallendathor se encuentra cerca de Cerin Amroth, al suroeste de Taur Hith.\
\
Deberías contarle a Mallendathor lo que has visto sobre los retoños de malbrethil.","Habla con Mallendathor en Cerin Amroth","'¿Qué aflige a los retoños de Taur Hith? ¿Podrías averiguarlo por mí?'","'Mae govannen, ${CLASS}. Soy Mallendathor, uno de los guardianes de los venerados bosques de Cerin Amroth. Mis compañeros y yo hemos aceptado la solemne tarea de custodia; velamos por que los bosques no pierdan su equilibrio.\
\
'Un problema ha llegado a mi atención en las últimas décadas: un tipo de abedul en particular, el malbrethil, ya no se ve con tanta frecuencia como antaño, y cuando aparece, los retoños parecen débiles y demasiado delicados. Me gustaría que encontraras y examinaras algunos de estos retoños para poder determinar la causa de su mal.\
\
'Te sugiero dirigirte hacia el este, y luego al noreste una vez que hayas superado el bajo acantilado blanco.'","'Me preocupa nuestro querido malbrethil, ${PLAYER}.'","Retoños de malbrethil"},
[8310]={"Recoge polvo precioso (${NUMBER}/10)","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir polvo precioso.","Montones de polvo precioso recogidos (${NUMBER}/10)","Se busca: Polvo precioso tomado de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Polvo precioso","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar montones de polvo precioso. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega el polvo precioso en una caja de recolección","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de polvo precioso."},
[8311]={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones afilados.","Se busca: Caparazones afilados tomados de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar caparazones afilados. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Caparazones afilados recogidos (${NUMBER}/10)","Tarea de Malledhrim: Caparazón afilado","Recoge caparazones afilados (${NUMBER}/10)","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de caparazones afilados.","Entrega los caparazones afilados en una caja de recolección"},
[8312]={"Entrega las esencias viles en una caja de recolección","Montones de esencias viles recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Tarea de Malledhrim: Esencia vil","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar esencias viles. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Esencias viles tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir esencias viles.","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de esencias viles.","Recoge esencias viles (${NUMBER}/10)"},
[8313]={"Montones de suciedad vil recogidos (${NUMBER}/10)","Entrega la suciedad vil en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Suciedad vil tomada de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de suciedad vil.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar suciedad vil. Se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Suciedad vil","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad vil.","Recoge suciedad vil (${NUMBER}/10)"},
[8314]={"Montones de viles huesos de los dedos recogidos (${NUMBER}/10)","Has entregado un número respetable de viles huesos de los dedos.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Hueso de dedo vil","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir viles huesos de los dedos.","Recoge huesos de dedos viles (${NUMBER}/10)","Se busca: Huesos de dedos viles tomados de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Entrega los huesos de dedos viles en una caja de recolección","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar viles huesos de los dedos. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."},
[8315]={"Defeat Ungoladan devoted (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Legolas has asked you to defeat Ungoladan devoted in Cadar Skûs.","Legolas has asked you to defeat any Ungoledain priestesses you find in Cadar Skûs, as they are the ones who claim leadership of the clan.","'From my observations, it is clear Ungoledain society is matriarchal, and those highest in the social ladder are the priestesses of Mam Murgwid. We should find and defeat them to sow confusion in their ranks.'","Habla con Legolas.","'Those that devote themselves to the worship of Ungwetári will forever be our enemies. If they ever learn this lesson, the bloodshed can be spared.'","Mam Murgwid's Devoted","Defeated Ungoladan Devoted (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated the highest ranking Ungoledain at Cadar Skûs.\
\
You should talk to Legolas."},
[8316]={"Mossbeard has communed with the trees and fallen of the Balewood and now wishes to tell all that he has learned of Núrzum's coming.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Man and Monster","Mossbeard can be found at Stonecliff in the Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard is prepared to tell you and the Ents of the rest of what he has learned from the trees of the forest. You should listen to his tale when you are ready.","Talk to Mossbeard","Mossbeard can be found at Stonecliff in the Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard's tale of Saruman and Núrzum has concluded. You should now speak with him of what can be done to stop the forces at work in the Balewood.","'And so, little one, Brúndoron was taken by the Orcs. \
\
'Núrzum had wandered these woods some time before this happening, you see. Hoom. He was then but a Stone-giant and had not much interest in the destruction of any creature of nature. His curiosity of the Men was his only real reason for venturing into Wildermore, but when he was grievously wounded and chased from their lands, the other Ents and I thought him gone from our forest.\
\
'Such things never come to a resolution simply with you creatures, do they? Hom. Yet, one day Núrzum returned, and this time, he was not alone.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","'I have learned much of Núrzum from these trees, my friend. When you are ready, I shall tell what I know.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","'So you see now, ${PLAYER}...Núrzum returned to the forest, his wounds healed, his might bolstered, and lashed together by what remained of Brúndoron. All he was tasked with in return for such wonders were the deaths of the Men that had wronged him. How could he see the folly of his actions in the face of such a silver-tongued man?\
\
'I know of this Wizard, little one, for once Treebeard spoke of him with Leaflock, in days long past. Always one to take knowledge, but never share it in return. Hoom. You look as if you have met him too....\
\
'Such times are so long past that I doubt he even remembers us amid whatever other chaos he now wreaks. Surely if the Orcs did not tell him of Brúndoron's assault, he would not have thought much of using a tree in his foul experiments. His blindness to the forest may yet prove his monster's undoing, but we shall see yet.'"},
[8317]={"'Eres un buen amigo de los Eglain, como han demostrado las acciones que has llevado a cabo en favor de Hunulf y Gadaric Mascador. Por eso siento que puedo compartir mis preocupaciones contigo. Orcos vinieron del norte y se movieron bajo la cobertura de la noche hacia Ost Cyrn, las ruinas más allá del camino, al suroeste. Si has hablado con Refr Mercurio, sabrás que estos orcos están aliados con los enanos que ocupan Thandobel.\
\
'La amenaza de los orcos tan cerca de Ost Guruth sacude la confianza de mi pueblo. Hemos sufrido mucho últimamente, y la aparición de estas hordas voraces ha alterado enormemente a mi gente.\
\
'Si estás dispuesto a ayudarnos, te pediría que fueras a Ost Cyrn y hicieras la guerra a los orcos para mostrar a los Eglain que hay gente dispuesta a ayudarnos. ¿Qué dices?'","Tarkrîps espantosos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Aunque viajará despacio, la noticia de tu victoria se difundirá y los Eglain llegarán a conocerte.\
\
'Te doy las gracias por todo lo que has hecho y espero que continúes ayudándonos en el futuro.'","Orcos que portan la bandera de Angmar se han derramado en las Tierras Solitarias desde el norte y han ocupado Ost Cyrn, unas ruinas situadas al suroeste de Ost Guruth.","'Si aceptas ayudarnos, podrías ayudar a los Eglain a recuperar su coraje.'","Elimina a Tarkrîps enfadados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Asesinos de Hombres","Tarkrîps enfadados derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grimdeal espera noticias de tu éxito en Ost Guruth, al noreste de Ost Cyrn.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Grimdeal para contarle tu victoria.","Los orcos se encuentran en las ruinas de Ost Cyrn, al suroeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Grimdeal te ha pedido que ayudes a defender a los Eglain atacando a los orcos de Ost Cyrn.","Elimina a Tarkrîps espantosos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8319]={"'¿Mandan está a salvo? Gracias por ir a verlo, ${PLAYER}. Supongo que pasa en todas las comunidades, pero especialmente entre los Dúnedain: puede que discutamos de vez en cuando y que no siempre nos llevemos bien, pero compartimos un mismo propósito y nos cuidamos estrechamente.\
\
'Pese a su exterior espinoso, Mandan tiene un corazón más grande que muchos de los que he conocido. Lo oculta bien, pero no hay nada que no sacrificaría para ayudar a quienes lo necesitan.\
\
'Gracias de nuevo'.","Recoge juncos afilados de la orilla del río (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El montaraz Mithrendan está en Tornhad.","El montaraz Mandan te ha pedido ayuda para recoger varios de los objetos por los que abandonó Tornhad: gel luminiscente de las moscas de luz del Ángulo, sombreros de seta húmedos y juncos afilados de la orilla del río cercana.","Encuentra a Mandan junto a uno de los ríos al noreste de Tornhad","Mandan, el Maestro de Hierbas","Mandan busca hierbas útiles para elaborar ungüentos y cataplasmas","'No es raro que uno de los Dúnedain pase horas caminando por las tierras salvajes, lejos de su hogar; de hecho, así es como llegamos a ser llamados montaraces por la gente que se calienta junto a las hogueras que protegemos. Esto es especialmente cierto en el caso de nuestros sanadores, personas como Mandan e Idhrien, que a menudo se ausentan durante horas o días en busca de hierbas raras. A Idhrien siempre se la recibe con sonrisas y risas, y a Mandan... bueno, sus habilidades curativas son bienvenidas, pero el hombre en sí puede ser algo brusco. Aun así, es un maestro sanador y tenemos suerte de contar con él.\
\
'Pero lleva mucho tiempo fuera. Si tus viajes te llevan a uno de los ríos al noreste de Tornhad, ¿podría pedirte que veas si Mandan está en peligro o necesita ayuda? Suele recorrer las orillas de los ríos buscando ingredientes'.","'He estado buscando la sustancia que da a las moscas de luz su luminiscencia, además de algunos juncos afilados de la orilla que pueda usar para remover mis brebajes. ¡Ah! También te agradecería que recogieras algunas de las setas que brotan en la humedad junto al río. No las necesito realmente, pero recógelas de todos modos, si eres tan amable'.","Recoge setas húmedas, aunque Mandan no las quiera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Mandan","'Si ves a Mithrendan antes que yo, ¡dile que estoy bien y que lo tengo todo bajo control! ¡Seguro que tiene otras cosas por las que preocuparse!'","Juncos afilados recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Has venido en mi busca? No corro ningún peligro'.","Mandan está en la isla en medio de un río al noreste de Tornhad, esperando a que vuelvas con los objetos que te pidió.","Has encontrado a Mandan en una isla en mitad de un río al noreste de Tornhad, y el maestro de hierbas de los Dúnedain no parece correr más peligro de lo habitual.","'No corro peligro, ${PLAYER}, pero me halaga que Mithrendan te haya enviado para ayudarme con la recolección de los remedios herbales. ¿O quizá te envió para ahorrarse el viaje él mismo? Sí, probablemente fuera eso.\
\
'Bueno, ya que estás aquí... He estado buscando la sustancia que da a las moscas de luz su luminiscencia, además de algunos juncos afilados de la orilla que pueda usar para remover mis brebajes. ¡Ah! También te agradecería que recogieras algunas de las setas que brotan en la humedad junto al río. No las necesito realmente, pero recógelas de todos modos, si eres tan amable'.","Lleva los objetos que has recogido a Mandan","Mandan suele recorrer todo el Ángulo, pero Mithrendan cree que deberías buscar al Maestro de Hierbas en algún lugar junto a un río al noreste de Tornhad.","Al montaraz Mithrendan no le preocupa la ausencia de Mandan más de lo habitual... pero, aun así, sigue algo inquieto.","'¿Me has traído todo lo que te pedí? Bien. ¿Incluso las setas?'\
\
Mandan inspecciona la parte inferior del sombrero de las setas y señala las vetas escarlatas que brotan de las láminas.\
\
'Algunos de los animales que merodean por las orillas del río mordisquean los sombreros mientras buscan comida, pero estos son incomestibles; me gusta retirar cualquier ejemplar de esta variedad que vea para evitar que las bestias enfermen. Gracias por ayudarme a recogerlas, aunque no me sirvan de nada. Pero los otros objetos sí nos serán útiles a mí y a los dúnedain.\
\
'¡Si ves a Mithrendan antes que yo, dile que estoy bien y que lo tengo todo bajo control! ¡Seguro que tiene otras cosas por las que preocuparse!'","Habla con Mithrendan en Tornhad","Setas húmedas recogidas, aunque Mandan no las quiera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge gel luminiscente de las moscas de luz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Si tus viajes te llevan cerca de uno de los ríos al noreste de Tornhad, ¿podría pedirte que veas si Mandan está en peligro o necesita ayuda?'","Gel luminiscente recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8320]={"'¿Dónde están esos tontos? Los otros vendedores han desaparecido, seguramente se fueron a disfrutar de la feria. ¡Les arrancaré el pellejo si se atreven a volver después de tantas horas!\
\
'No tengo quien me ayude, ${PLAYER}, como bien puedes ver. ¿Serías tan amable de darme una mano? Hay muchos pedidos que preparar.'","'¡Por favor, no pierdas más el tiempo! ¿No ves que los clientes reclaman nuestra atención? ¡Habla con ellos, no conmigo!'","Muchos de los vendedores aún no han regresado de su descanso, y el mercado está abarrotado de clientes impacientes que esperan sus productos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Atendiendo el Mercado","Ayuda a tantos clientes como puedas durante tu turno","Los clientes del Mercado de los Granjeros se están amontonando en el puesto.\
\
Deberías ayudar a preparar tantos pedidos como puedas antes de que termine tu turno.","Tu turno ha terminado"},
[8321]={"'¡Esta costumbre de dar regalos en el cumpleaños de otros nunca se impondrá, si depende de mí!'","'¡Sin duda le diste una lección! Me pregunto si podré mantener a Lobelia la Sapa enjaulada el tiempo suficiente para enseñarle una lección a la verdadera Lobelia también. Ya veremos.\
\
¡Gracias por tu ayuda!'","Milo Corneta, irritado por la idea de Lobelia de recibir regalos de cumpleaños en vez de entregarlos, ha estado criando un sapo particularmente vil y gordo para dárselo como regalo.","Con suficientes sapos eliminados, Lobelia la Sapa debería aparecer en algún lugar del Pantano de la Rana, al norte de El Tronco Flotante.\
\
Milo Corneta te ha pedido que sometas al sapo salvaje que ha llamado Lobelia.","Milo Corneta está esperando junto a El Tronco Flotante en los Ranales.\
\
Debes informar a Milo de tu éxito al capturar a Lobelia la Sapa.","'Esa Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón ha estado diciendo a todos que no cree que deba dar regalos en su fiesta de cumpleaños, que le parece más razonable recibirlos. Necesita una lección, así que he estado criando este sapo para dárselo como regalo. He llamado al sapo Lobelia, y ha resultado ser tan terca como la original, si entiendes lo que quiero decir; de hecho, ¡ha crecido bastante!\
\
Bueno, mi Lobelia se escapó hoy. Es demasiado grande y fuerte para que yo la controle cuando está molesta, así que necesito a alguien que la calme. Curiosamente, parece tener miedo de los otros sapos, así que quizá debas despejar algunos de los sapos del pantano antes de que Lobelia se muestre.\
\
Si sale, probablemente estará justo al norte de El Tronco Flotante; esa parte del pantano le es más familiar, creo, y probablemente regrese allí.'","Enfréntate a Lobelia la Sapa","'Lobelia la Sapa no saldrá si hay muchos otros sapos cerca, ${PLAYER}, así que deberás eliminar algunos de los sapos que acechan en el Pantano de la Rana.'","Lobelia la Sapa ha regresado asustada a su jaula","Lobelia la Sapa se esconde entre los sapos de las colinas en el Pantano de la Rana, el pantano justo al norte de los Ranales.\
\
Milo Corneta te ha pedido que elimines suficientes sapos en el Pantano de la Rana para que salga Lobelia la Sapa.","Derrota a los sapos de las colinas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sapos de las colinas derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Lobelia la Sapa será el regalo de cumpleaños perfecto para Lobelia... ¡ese sapo!'","¡Muchas felicidades!"},
[8322]={"Urged Dale-folk to seek shelter in Erebor (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to King Thorin III","Urge Dale-folk to seek shelter in Erebor (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Collect the Master's curfew notices","Collect crates of provisions in Felegoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Queen Regent Erna and aid the people of Dale","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have aided the people of Lake-town in preparing, and you should now travel to Felegoth and aid King Thranduil and the Elves of Eryn Lasgalen in preparing for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind.","'Hail!\
\
'Word reached me from Erebor that you would soon come to Felegoth, ${PLAYER}. Both I and the King Under the Mountain have agreed that it would be unwise to send too great a force of Elves to Erebor. However, I shall still send every archer and warrior that can be spared from the defences of Felegoth. If Vethúg is not defeated, he will trouble all our peoples.\
\
'It is a long journey to Erebor, and my soldiers must travel swiftly and without undue burdens. I would ask that you gather quivers of arrows, crates of provisions, and straw. Once you have gathered enough, pack barrels and I shall have them sent through the water-gate to Loeglond and onward to Esgaroth. My soldiers will have to bear the barrels' contents for the final miles of the journey, but it will hasten their early travel.\
\
'I thank you for your aid. Let us hope it is enough.'","Post the Master's curfew notices in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well met, ${PLAYER}. I awaited your return, and I am pleased you have come.\
\
'I have sent word to the leaders of the North, and I informed them that you would aid them in preparing for the coming battle against Vethúg Wintermind. Ah, and before you ask, I am not playing a trick on you this time. When Vethúg's coming still remained in doubt, I was of such a mind, but no longer.\
\
'Each of our peoples will prepare in their own way, but I would send you to aid them. It may be an old foe of Durin's Folk that comes to the North, but the world is changed, and we have more now to consider than our own delvings. Aid the peoples of Dale and Lake-town, and then assist the Elves of Felegoth. King Thranduil offers his finest archers in the defence of Erebor, and I would thank him for it!\
\
'Be swift, friend. We must be prepared for when Vethúg comes to Erebor!'","You pick up a thick stack of sternly-worded notices written by Dagrun herself!","Dale-folk can be found throughout Dale.\
\
Erna has not ordered her people to Erebor, but she will allow them to depart for safety if they wish it. You should urge the people of Dale to seek shelter in Erebor.","Erna can be found within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to speak to the other leaders of the North and aid them in hastening their preparations for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind.","Quivers of arrows can be found near the dungeons of Felegoth, crates of provisions can be found in the wine cellar, and straw can be found near the trapdoors of Felegoth.\
\
King Thranduil has asked you to help ease the burden of travel to Erebor by packing several barrels with supplies to be shipped to Loeglond for the coming battle at Erebor.","With the knowledge that Vethúg Wintermind will soon come to Erebor, the peoples of the North hasten to prepare for the battle ahead.","Collect water-skins in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Barrels can be found nearby the trapdoors of Felegoth.\
\
You have gathered many supplies and straw and should now use what you have gathered to pack barrels for the Elves of Felegoth.","Many Preparations","Collect handfuls of straw in Felegoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected handfuls of straw in Felegoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'You have come at a fortunate time. Lake-town is bustling today! The docks are rife with fisher-men, merchants are selling useless trinkets and odd draughts, and none of it is any help in keeping beneath the notice of that cold-drake!\
\
'I, too, have read the King's missive, but I regret that I can offer little aid outside a few water-skins to the dwarves of Erebor. As for Lake-town, I have spent two evenings now crafting an appropriate notice to send to my people. The words just would not come! It seems to me that if the cold-drake seeks Erebor, we might do well to avoid drawing his attention. To that end, I have decided to enforce a curfew.\
\
'All lights must be put out after dusk, and none but the guards shall be permitted upon the paths of Lake-town until this business is done!\
\
'I would greatly appreciate your help in posting the curfew notices throughout Lake-town. My guards have been busy enough!\
\
'The notices are over on that table behind me. Oh, and do not forget to take water-skins with you when you travel into the lands of the Elves!'","Talk to Master Dagrun and aid the people of Lake-town","'It is done. Let us hope our preparations are enough, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Now all we can do is... wait.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Scion of Winter'</rgb>","Collected quivers of arrows in Felegoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected water-skins in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dagrun can be found within the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
After aiding the people of Dale, you should continue on to Lake-town and aid the Lake-men as best you can.","Collected crates of provisions in Felegoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The pile of curfew notices can be found behind Dagrun in the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
Dagrun has asked you to post curfew notices throughout Lake-town, and has offered a number of water-skins to the dwarves of Erebor. You should pick up the notices before leaving the Master's Manor.","Pack barrels of supplies to send through the water-gate (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Notices can be posted throughout Lake-town. Water-skins can be found around Lake-town.\
\
Dagrun has asked you to post curfew notices, and in return, she has offered a number of water-skins to aid the dwarves of Erebor.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have aided all the peoples of the North and should now return to King Thorin III at Erebor.","'Welcome, ${PLAYER}. King Thorin sent word that you would soon come to Dale, and I am glad you have come.\
\
'I have heard the King's counsel, but my family and I shall remain with Dale along with our warriors. King Thorin offered to protect the folk of Dale within the Lonely Mountain, and I have urged my people to seek shelter in the dwarf-halls. I will not force them to go, but perhaps you can speak to them again on my behalf.\
\
'It seems King Thorin still harbours a great deal of ill will toward the Easterlings that have come to seek refuge in the foothills of the Lonely Mountain. I shall send word to the Chayasir and other refugees of Rhûn that they are welcome to seek shelter within Dale. They are not strangers to us any longer, and by the end of the coming battle, we may both know the ways of the other more keenly.\
\
'Go, and speak to my people. King Thorin tells me your journey shall be long, so travel swiftly and with great care.\
\
'Thank you, ${PLAYER}.'","Posted the Master's curfew notices in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect quivers of arrows in Felegoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Packed barrels of supplies to send through the water-gate (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to King Thranduil and aid the Elves of Felegoth"},
[8323]={"Notas el hedor de la muerte en Baiúrz-mur. Hay tantos orcos muertos como vivos aquí.","Los profanadores y sus maestros han usado a los orcos inferiores como catadores de los venenos fabricados en Baiúrz-mur.\
\
El veneno de los profanadores ha sido fabricado con cuidado para terminar con cualquier criatura viva, incluso los resistentes orcos. Es otra muestra de su crueldad que probaran el veneno en los de su propia especie.","Muchos cadáveres inquietantes","Los cadáveres de los orcos se encuentran por todo Baiúrz-mur.\
\
Deberías buscar en los cadáveres de los orcos pistas de lo que ha podido causar su muerte.","Encuentras una botella vacía con un leve olor a veneno. Este orco era un catador de la inmunda ponzoña.","Completado","Los profanadores y sus maestros han usado a los orcos inferiores como catadores de los venenos fabricados en Baiúrz-mur.\
\
El veneno de los profanadores ha sido fabricado con cuidado para terminar con cualquier criatura viva, incluso los resistentes orcos.","Busca en los cadáveres de los orcos la causa de la muerte (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Notas el hedor de la muerte en Baiúrz-mur. Hay tantos orcos muertos como vivos aquí.\
\
Deberías investigar los cadáveres para ver qué ha causado tal número de muertes. Puede que haya una correlación con la fabricación de veneno por los profanadores y la muerte de los orcos inferiores."},
[8326]={"Hrímil's passage has frozen the fields","Hobgoblins have overtaken Anatrâd!","'Since you are heading north, you may as well try to find these last few places. The Amgaruslun Falls and the ruins of Anatrâd. Even further north, now covered in rimefrost by the passage of Hrímil, was Frósthel. These were large fields by the side of the river, where livestock once grazed on lush grasses.\
\
'There is also mention of a look-out, near to the tunnel that leads to the Welkin-lofts. I cannot make out the name, but see if you can find any clues about where that may have been as well.'","Search for the fields of Frósthel","'Ah, you return! What have you found, friend?'","Return to Gerja","Hrímil's passage has silenced the fall's roar","The passing of Hrímil has greatly altered the landscape of Clovengap. Are there still signs of the fields and fortresses beneath the ice?","A piece of ancient, curved glass glints from the rubble","Search for the Amgaruslun Falls","Mapping Northern Clovengap","The new locations are in northern Clovengap.\
\
You should search for the Amgaruslun Falls, the ruins of Anatrâd, the look-out, and Frósthel.","Gerja Defthand is in Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap.\
\
You should let Gerja Defthand know what you found.","Search for the look-out","Search for Anatrâd"},
[8327]={"'Hay pocos lugares en el mundo tan grandes y misteriosos como Khazad-dûm. Con sus amplias grietas y caminos sinuosos... ¡es fácil desorientarse! Por esta razón, he estado trabajando duro para obtener mapas detallados de cada sala y camino que aseguramos.\
\
'Justo al este encontrarás un pasaje conocido como el Camino Tortuoso. Tenía un hermoso mapa, detallando cada sección del camino, que se extendía hasta la Sala Vigesimoprimera... pero algunos de los guardias descuidados aquí colocaron sus jarras de cerveza y varios otros líquidos directamente sobre él. ¡Lo han arruinado por completo!\
\
'Necesito un reemplazo y debe ser preciso. ¿Podrías tomar este pergamino y dibujar un nuevo mapa para mí, ${PLAYER}?'","Has dibujado la Sala Vigesimoprimera en el pergamino","Thálfi está al oeste en la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Thálfi está esperando que regreses con el mapa que has dibujado del Camino Tortuoso.","Dirígete a la segunda sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Cartografiando el Camino Tortuoso","Dirígete a la cuarta sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Has dibujado esta parte del Camino Tortuoso en el pergamino","Has encontrado una buena sección para dibujar en el pergamino","Dirígete a la tercera sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","'¿Tú dibujaste esto, ${PLAYER}? ¡Esto es incluso mejor que el original! Aprecio el detalle que has puesto. ¿No has considerado una carrera en la cartografía?\
\
'Cada vez que viaje por el Camino Tortuoso, pensaré en ti. Tienes mi agradecimiento.'","Dirígete a la primera sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Habla con Thálfi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Entra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera y dibújala en el pergamino para completar el mapa","Has encontrado un buen lugar para dibujar en el pergamino","Dirígete a la última sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","El Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.","Thálfi necesita a alguien para mapear el Camino Tortuoso, el camino entre la Cámara de la Encrucijada y la Sala Vigesimoprimera."},
[8328]={"You have defeated many Jangovar marauders.","You have defeated many Jangovar marauders encroaching on the Dale-lands. Your efforts will ensure the safety of all those within Dale's walls.","Defeated Jangovar marauders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Jangovar marauders encroach upon the city of Dale and should be dealt with swiftly.","Marauders in the Dale-lands","Defeat Jangovar marauders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Jangovar marauders can be found in the wilds near the city of Dale in the Dale-lands.\
\
Erna has asked you to defeat any Jangovar marauders you come across.","Completado","'I have heard new reports of Jangovar marauders lurking outside Dale. This cannot stand.\
\
'Meet them in the field, and remind them that they are not welcome in the Dale-lands!'"},
[8329]={"'Wargs have on occasion threatened our lands, but never have they come down from the hills in such numbers. It almost seems as if they are working alongside the raiders.\
\
'Glynn Brenin has forbidden us to foray from the village for so long as Isengard's threat persists, but if we do nothing, our livestock will be slaughtered. Please, if you have the strength will you drive off these beasts?\
\
'Whether it be to save us from savage raiders or starvation in the next winter's snow, we may indeed have to bend to Isengard's will....'","Talk to Siorus Brehur at the Brenin's Hall","Marauders of Nan Laeglin","Defeated half-orcs in Nan Laeglin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Another day, another battle. If Saruman thinks we will join him with a boot upon our necks, he should best think again!'","Siorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Lhanuch.\
\
You should return to Siorus Brehur with news of your victory.","'Drive back the foul marauders, ${PLAYER}, and you will earn my respect.'","Wargs and half-orcs from Isengard can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads.\
\
Siorus Brehur has asked you to defend his people against the marauding Wargs and half-orcs in the region of Nan Laeglin.","Defeat Wargs in Nan Laeglin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Half-orcs and Wargs out of Isengard raid the lands around Nan Laeglin to force the people to bow to Saruman's demands.","Defeated Wargs in Nan Laeglin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat half-orcs in Nan Laeglin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8330]={"Nidgyl is concerned with the half-orcs who have been spotted marauding through the Nain Enidh region of the Lone-lands, making travel into the east nearly impossible.","Half-orcs can be found throughout the Nain Enidh region of the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to defeat the half-orcs marauding in the Lone-lands.","Defeated half-orcs in Nain Enidh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat half-orcs in Nain Enidh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have struck a telling blow against the half-orcs of Nain Enidh. My kinsmen have been able to reach Rivendell with considerably fewer unpleasant incidents, thanks to your efforts on our behalf.'","Nidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the west of Nain Enidh.\
\
You should return to Nidgyl of Bree-town and tell him of your battles against the half-orcs of Nain Enidh.","Marauders of the Lone-lands","'My kinsmen often have need to travel into the Trollshaws to carry information to and from Rivendell, but of late that passage has become hazardous, as the roads are frequently watched by bands of half-orc marauders -- particularly in the region of Nain Enidh in the Lone-lands.\
\
'I need you to foray into Nain Enidh and defeat as many of these half-orcs as possible to free up the passage into the east; otherwise, we will likely be caught unaware when the Enemy makes its next move in the east.'","Talk to Nidgyl"},
[8331]={"The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad.","March on Gundabad: Additional Steps (Daily)","Talk to Hlóthi","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Healing Hands'","Locate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Torching the Trenches'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Resupplying the Forces'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Pilfering Orkish Orders'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Raising Morale'","'Hail!\
\
'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad.\
\
'There are several places where we could use your assistance in Elderslade.\
\
'Might you assist us on the battlefield?'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: In order to advance this quest, you must complete any four of the required quests.</rgb>","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Torching the Trenches'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines'","Hlóthi has requested your aid in completing several tasks outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: In order to advance this quest, you must complete any four of the required quests.</rgb>","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Raising Morale'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Pilfering Orkish Orders'","'While there is more to do to assist the war effort, your help has been noted, and we greatly appreciate it.\
\
'Thank you kindly.'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Resupplying the Forces'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Healing Hands'"},
[8332]={"'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in the ongoing war effort.\
\
'Before you, there are a wide array of missions that are required to assist in our cause.\
\
'Seek out and complete these missions and return for a token of our esteem.'","Misiones completadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Spoke to Hlóthi","Your assistance in completing several sorties for the Gabil'akkâ has been greatly noticed.","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in the ongoing war effort.","March on Gundabad: Assisting the War Effort (Daily)","Completa misiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak to Hlóthi","Hlóthi has asked for your assistance in the war effort. The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested that you assist the war effort.","'Your assistance in the war effort has been paramount to our preparation. Thank you kindly.'"},
[8333]={"'You have saved their lives, and the lives of others. We'll have a better chance now of staving off illness in the trenches.'","'There's fear of fever in the trenches, and that's one enemy we can't defeat with steel. But our healers are unable to treat the wounded that have been stranded on the battlefield.\
\
'Find these injured soldiers in the enemy territory that lies beyond our trenches at Ifbar-athrâkh. Do what you can to ease their suffering so that they may return on their own.\
\
'You may be more fortuitous in this endeavour if you strike out north-east to Azgh-buzru, but bring your allies if you decide to do so.'","Talk to Hlóthi","March on Gundabad: Healing Hands","Numerous wounded soldiers have been stranded on the battlefield, unable to receive aid.","You can find injured soldiers scattered across enemy territory, beyond the dwarves' trenches at Ifbar-athrâkh. More soldiers have been stranded in Azgh-buzru, but Hlóthi has suggested bringing allies if you go there.\
\
You should tend to these soldiers' wounds so that they may return to safety.","Tend to (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) injured soldiers","Tended to (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) injured soldiers","The soldiers you tended to will seek treatment from the healers.\
\
Hlóthi in Annâk-khurfu will want to know that you've honoured his request."},
[8334]={"Speak to Elóf","March on Gundabad: Missions for the Cause","Misiones completadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'We have need of your assistance in completing a series of missions for the on-going war effort.\
\
'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has been making headway towards Gundabad, but our troops are spread too thin to accomplish all that is needed to be done.\
\
'Seek out and complete several of these missions to assist our efforts.'","Completa misiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Seek out and complete several missions to assist the Gabil'akkâ.","Seek out and speak to Elóf regarding your completion of several missions.","'We wish to thank you for your hard work towards the war effort. Your good deeds shall help secure our foothold into Gundabad itself!'","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested your assistance in completing a series of missions on their behalf."},
[8336]={"March on Gundabad: Raising Morale","The dwarf-trenches have been dug along the main road towards Gundabad.\
\
Hlóthi has asked that you sing to disheartened soldiers in the trenches, so that you may bolster their spirits.","Sang to disheartened soldiers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Hlóthi","War affects not just the body, but also the mind. The horrors of the War of Three Peaks have caused some Gabil'akkâ soldiers to lose hope.","Sing to disheartened soldiers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'If we are to win this war, our soldiers being in low spirits won't do! Are you up to the task of singing to them, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'You must have heard many songs during your travels. Perhaps you could bolster our soldiers' spirits with a few. Go forth and bring some light to our disheartened soldiers in the trenches.'","'The war may be far from over, but your singing has allowed our soldiers to forget their sorrows, if only for a little while. Thank you.'","You have sung songs for several disheartened soldiers and bolstered their spirits.\
\
Hlóthi in Zarkul-sulûn is waiting for you to report back."},
[8338]={"'Anything you can do to thin the enemy's numbers will greatly help us.'","'Haha! We kicked the hornet's nest now, haven't we, ${PLAYER}? The enemy is frantically swarming out of Gundabad in a paltry attempt to block our forward progress. Do what you can to thin their ranks. Anything you manage will be of great help to the Gabil'akkâ!'","Defeat foes in the War of Three Peaks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hlóthi is in Annak-khurfu in southern Elderslade.\
\
Return to Hlóthi.","Defeated foes in the War of Three Peaks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Good work! Surely their fear of our might is much increased. We may not rest yet, however, but must continue until Gundabad is ours!'","Foes can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Hlóthi has asked you to defeat foes in the War of Three Peaks.","March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade","Foes in the War of Three Peaks must be defeated to help the Gabil'akkâ press forward to Gundabad.","Speak to Hlóthi"},
[8339]={"Hlóthi has requested your aid in securing Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind, for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.","Speak to Hlóthi","Locate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.","Complete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle'","'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in securing Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.\
\
'Zhurmat and his fearsome mount, the horrible two-headed troll Groz-and-Ulk, have begun to amass forces for use against the Gabil'akkâ in the valley below.\
\
'Could you assist us at the Gate of Wind?'","'While there is more to do to assist the war effort, your help has been noted, and we greatly appreciate it.\
\
'Thank you kindly.'","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has asked for your assistance in routing the forces outside Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.","March on Gundabad: Shakalush, the Stair Battle (Daily)"},
[8340]={"Destroy Orc ballistae (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Siege engines can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Hlóthi has tasked you with destroying enemy siege engines.","Destroy Orc trebuchets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Orcs have littered the battlefield with siege engines, ${PLAYER}. I need you to destroy as many as you can before they are able to turn the deadly machines upon our forces.'","'Hah! That put a dent in their helms, didn't it?'","Return to Hlóthi","Destroy Orc catapults (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed Orc catapults (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed Orc ballistae (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hlóthi is in Zarkul-sulûn, in southern Elderslade.\
\
Return to Hlóthi.","'The war machines of the enemy must be destroyed.'","Destroyed Orc trebuchets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Enemy siege engines throughout the War of Three Peaks must be destroyed.","March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines"},
[8342]={"'¿Sabes que nunca creí realmente que era una Boffin, ${PLAYER}? Todos mis hermanos y hermanas son unos aburridos, felices de quedarse en casa, lo más lejos posible de la emoción. Esmeralda iba a ir a bailar al Pantano de los Sapos, pero cuando le sugerí que camináramos hasta los Pantanos de Moscagua más allá de Bree y bailáramos allí, ¡se negó! Me amenazó con contárselo a nuestra madre, así que no insistí. ¿No te parece aburrido?'\
\
Caléndula blande su espada y su escudo.\
\
'¡Hice esta espada con una rama, y rescaté este escudo de una guarida de lobos cuando los lobos se fueron! No pensé que ningún otro Boffin pudiera hacer estas cosas, ¡pero ahora parece que el primo Bingo también es un aventurero! ¡No sabes lo feliz que me hace escucharlo!\
\
'De todos modos, me has encontrado justo a tiempo. Conocí a una criatura curiosa en el bosque, y me ofreció mostrarme su casa. ¡Puedes venir también si quieres! No recuerdo su nombre, ¡pero llevaba botas amarillas y dijo que su casa estaba al noreste de aquí!'","'¡Hemos encontrado a Caléndula, ${PLAYER}!'\
\
'¡Hace muy poco que me he convertido en un aventurero, y debo decir que es difícil deshacerme de mis viejos hábitos ya que este bosque tan tenebroso me hace sentir incómodo! Pero Caléndula es solo una joven hobbit, y ha estado viniendo aquí con regularidad, enfrentándose a los peligros del bosque. Sus regalos de champiñones y otras golosinas deben haber comprado el silencio de sus hermanos, ¡porque Prisca nunca permitiría este comportamiento!'","'¡Qué lugar tan extraño!'","El río Tornasauce atraviesa el centro del Bosque Viejo, y podría ser un buen punto de referencia para usar en tu búsqueda de Caléndula Boffin.","Habla con Caléndula en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil","'Debo ser honesto contigo, ${PLAYER}. No creo que sea prudente que Caléndula siga a ese extraño de botas amarillas hasta su casa, ¡sobre todo si esa casa se encuentra en las profundidades del Bosque Viejo! ¿Quién podría vivir en un lugar así?'","'Me pregunto qué piensa Bingo de mis nuevos amigos.'","Habla con Bingo en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo","Caléndula Boffin está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo, al noreste del río Tornasauce.","'Caléndula ha estado adentrándose cada vez más en el Bosque Viejo últimamente, y a veces nos trae champiñones y otras golosinas. Pero aún así, es peligroso entrar allí. ¡Dice que hay murciélagos, raíces y lobos!\
\
'Si vas a seguir su rastro hacia el Bosque Viejo, ¡tendrás que lidiar con todo eso en algún momento!'","'Este bosque es muy tenebroso, ¡estar aquí me hace sentir! ¿Cómo puede Caléndula venir aquí tan a menudo?'","Busca en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo, a Caléndula Boffin","'Tienes razón, no veo a Caléndula por ningún sitio, pero no es inusual. Siempre está yendo de aquí para allá. Se fabricó una espada de madera y se cree una heroína... ¿puedes creerlo?\
\
'Últimamente se ha estado adentrando cada vez más en el Bosque Viejo, y a veces nos trae champiñones y otras golosinas. Pero aún así, es peligroso entrar allí. ¡Dice que hay murciélagos, raíces y lobos!\
\
'Si vas a seguir su rastro hacia el Bosque Viejo, ¡tendrás que lidiar con todo eso en algún momento!'","Has llegado a la casa de Tom Bombadil","Pregunta a uno de los Boffins sobre Caléndula","'¿Qué pudo haber traído al primo Bingo al Bosque Viejo? ¡Está muy lejos de Cavada Grande y es mucho más peligroso para un viejo hobbit!'","Una extraña criatura del bosque con botas amarillas invitó a Caléndula a su casa al noreste. Deberías acompañarla y asegurarte de que es seguro.","Caléndula está emocionada por hablar contigo sobre la aventura de Bingo.\
\
Bingo y tú habéis encontrado a Caléndula Boffin en el Bosque Viejo, en la orilla del Tornasauce.","Habla con Caléndula en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo","'Este nuevo amigo mío me dijo que su casa se encuentra en el bosque al noreste. ¡Vamos a buscarla!'","'¡Nunca pensé que vería una casa tan acogedora en el Bosque Viejo!'","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Caléndula","Caléndula Boffin podría estar perdida en algún lugar del Bosque Viejo, y Angélica Boffin te ha hablado de los murciélagos, raíces y lobos que podrían estar amenazando a su hermana en el bosque.","'¡Caléndula, por supuesto! ¡Encontramos a todos los demás, pero nos olvidamos de Caléndula!'","Uno de los Boffins en el exterior de la casa de Prisca podría saber dónde ha ido Caléndula.\
\
Has devuelto a la mayoría de los hijos de Prisca Boffin a su casa, pero Caléndula Boffin todavía está por ahí fuera, en algún lugar.","Derrota a los murciélagos en el Bosque Viejo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Debo confesar que no recordaba que Prisca tuviera tantos hijos e hijas. Tendré que esforzarme por recordar sus nombres. La última vez que estuve aquí, hace varios años, una de las hijas de Prisca me impresionó, porque estaba desarrollando un deje aventurero... me pregunto qué pensaría de mi actual aventura...\
\
Tenía un nombre relacionado con las flores... ¿Caléndula, quizás? ¡Sí, eso era! Pero, ¿dónde está la joven Caléndula...?\
\
Bingo observa a los numerosos Boffin y su sonrisa curiosa se desvanece lentamente.\
\
'Uh oh. Lo siento mucho, ${PLAYER}, ¡pero creo que nos hemos olvidado de una!'","Murciélagos derrotados en el Bosque Viejo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bingo está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo, al noreste del río Tornasauce.","Lobos derrotados en el Bosque Viejo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Primo Bingo? ¿Qué haces en el Bosque Viejo?'","'Qué vista tan extraña: una pequeña y acogedora casa en medio de un bosque peligroso, hogar de un individuo muy peculiar y su esposa, ¡igual de misteriosa que él! Nunca pensé que pudiera existir un lugar así, ${PLAYER}. Si mi viaje terminara mañana, aún así lo consideraría una aventura llena de maravillas.\
\
'Necesito descansar después de nuestro viaje por el bosque. ¡Quizás más tarde pueda hablar con Tom y Baya de Oro y escribir una descripción de ellos para mi diario!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Desafiando toda descripción' (Nivel recomendado: 19)</rgb>","Derrota a las raíces en el Bosque Viejo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Has encontrado a Caléndula Boffin!","'No se lo digas a nadie, ${PLAYER}, pero Caléndula siempre fue mi favorita. ¡Si está en problemas en el Bosque Viejo, tenemos que encontrarla!'","Derrota a los lobos en el Bosque Viejo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raíces derrotadas en el Bosque Viejo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Alguna vez has visto una casita tan acogedora, ${PLAYER}? Es el hogar de mi nuevo amigo Tom y su esposa Baya de Oro. Son muy misteriosos, ¡y me gustaría saber más sobre ellos!\
\
'¿De dónde vienen? ¿Por qué viven en el Bosque Viejo? Tengo muchas preguntas, ¡pero cada vez que se las hago solo sonríen y no me dan respuestas directas!\
\
'Aún así, me alegra mucho haberlos conocido. Me pregunto qué piensa el primo Bingo de mis nuevos amigos...'","A pesar de tus esfuerzos, parece que una de las hijas de Prisca Boffin, Caléndula, se te pasó por alto y todavía está lejos de casa.","Bingo y tú habéis encontrado a Caléndula Boffin en el Bosque Viejo, en la orilla del Tornasauce.","Encuentra la casa de la extraña criatura con botas amarillas, en el Bosque Viejo","'¡Hemos encontrado a Caléndula, ${PLAYER}!'"},
[8343]={"Aelindil se encuentra en Tornhad, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.\
\
Has recibido una carta de Aelindil, un Marinero de los Dúnedain, que desea hablar contigo.",",\
\
Tus hazañas se han extendido entre los Dúnedain, y por ello he organizado para ti una audiencia con un Marinero visitante, de gran experiencia y habilidad. Sin embargo, primero deberás demostrar que eres ${PLAYERNAME:digno[m]|digna[f]} de su tutela, y eso no será una tarea sencilla. Te aguardo en Tornhad, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.\
\
Aelindil","Marinero: El mayor viaje es la maestría","Lleva la carta a Aelindil en Tornhad","'Te doy la bienvenida a Tornhad, . Supondré que traes mi carta.'\
\
Le entregas a Aelindil la carta que recibiste, y él la guarda en su bolsillo.\
\
'Verás, Tarneth me escribió hace algunos días, y tenía mucho que decir sobre la ayuda que brindaste a mis hermanos en las orillas del lago Evendim. Te agradezco el papel que desempeñaste en la protección de las reliquias de Annúminas, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}.\
\
'Puede que yo también pueda ayudarte... ¡pero eso dependerá de ti!'","Has demostrado tu valía entre la innumerable cantidad de Marineros y Corsarios que surcan las aguas de la Tierra Media, pero ahora emprendes un nuevo rumbo: poner a prueba tu habilidad y dominar el propio Mar, si puedes."},
[8344]={"Taf is at the leather-working pavillion in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have collected the lake-side plants Taf asked you to gather and should bring them to him.","'I have been working as quickly as I can to fashion armour from the leather that Rhus prepares, but it is time-consuming work. It is important that the armour be strong, but it must also bear the mark of the Falcon; our enemies quail when they know who it is they fight, and Saruman will be no different!\
\
'My stock of the dye used to mark the finished armour with the mark of the Falcon is low. Can you pick the red plants along the lake-side here in Tâl Methedras? Bring me several handfuls of their leaves, and we can grind more of the dye.'","Taf is responsible for crafting much of the armour the Falcon-clan will wear into battle and could use your help.","'Plants with red leaves grow along the lake-side in Tâl Methedras, but only where the dirt comes right down to the water. Bring me their leaves, and I can grind them up to make the dye that I will need to mark this armour.'","Return the excess dye to Taf","You collect the crushed plant dye from the grinding stone","'You have not brought me what I seek?'","Bring lake-side plants to Taf","Lake-side plants with red flowers can be found growing alongside the shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras, but only where the dirt comes right down to the water.\
\
Taf has asked you to collect lake-side plants with red leaves that he can grind up for dye.","'Use my grinding stone to crush the plants that you collected into colouring for the dye I need. It is right over there.'","'These are the plants I asked for, ${PLAYER}? Good. Take them to my grinding stone over there and grind the leaves into a fine powder. It will provide the colour my dye requires.'","'¿No tienes nada para mí?'","'That is an acceptable Falcon's claw, ${PLAYER}. That will drive fear into any of the clans that try to fight us!\
\
'Thank you for the help you have been today. I will not forget it!'","Bring the crushed dye to Taf","Taf is at the leather-working pavillion in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have ground up some dye on his grinding stone and should show the product of your labour to Taf.","Partially-completed leather armour is on the table near Taf in the leather-working pavillion of Tûr Morva.\
\
Taf has asked you to use the dye you prepared to put the mark of the Falcon on some of the partially-completed leather armour he has set out on a table.","Taf is at the leather-working pavillion in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have drawn the mark of the Falcon on some of the partially-completed armour and should return the excess dye to Taf.","'This is just the right shade for our purposes, ${PLAYER}. Use it to mark the leather armour I have nearly finished with the claw of the Falcon.'","Draw the mark of the Falcon clan on the partially-completed armour","There is a grinding stone at the leather-working pavillion near Taf, in Tûr Morva.\
\
Taf has asked you to grind up the plants you gathered on his grinding stone, in order to make the colouring for the dye he needs.","'I have set some armour there on the table. Use the dye you prepared to put the mark of the Falcon on it, ${PLAYER}. You have earned the right!'","You draw a passable Falcon's claw on the armour","Collected lake-side plants (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grind up some dye using Taf's grinding stone","'Our warriors need to have the strongest armour.'","Collect lake-side plants (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'This armour will be the most durable I have made.'","Mark of the Falcon"},
[8345]={"In the wake of a sudden and brutal assault, Thane Mágla's trusted warrior lies slain by Uruks of the White Hand.","Talk to Thane Mágla","Defeated Curr","'What word have you from Bosa's Farm?'","Egbalth's horn can be found outside one of the burned homes at Bosa's Farm.\
\
The leader of the White Hand forces at Bosa's Farm has not made himself known. You should sound Egbalth's horn to lure the Uruk leader to your position.","Marcado para la Muerte","Thane Mágla can be found inside the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have dispatched the Uruk leader, Curr, who spoke of something deeply unsettling before being defeated. You should return to Thane Mágla with this information.","A large Uruk strides forth from the smoking remains of a crofter's home","Lure and defeat Curr","'Back so soon? What word does Egbalth send?\
\
Mágla shrinks into a depressed slump as you inform him of Egbalth's demise and the fate of Bosa's Farm.\
\
'I... he was the last of my council. What sense have I to continue this fight?'","As you look over Egbalth, you notice his horn lying amidst the nearby wreckage. While he likely sounded it to call for aid, only Uruks stood ready to answer. \
\
You have not been able to identify the leader of these Uruk forces thus far, but you suspect that sounding the horn once again might draw what remains of their force.\
\
You decide to learn what you can of the White Hand's purpose at Bosa's Farm before returning to Thane Mágla."},
[8346]={"Collected marked crates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Mervárth","Mervárth can be found outside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","Collect marked crates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'While you're in there sorting out this mess, might I ask of you one thing more? These smugglers have been mixing in marked crates with shipments as they go by, sneaking prohibited goods into Lake-town, Dale, and beyond. Will you gather any suspicious crates you come across and return them to me? We can use them as evidence of their wrongdoing.'","Marked crates can be found inside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should collect marked crates.","Marked for Export","'Ah, would you look at these!'\
\
He cracks open one of the crates and grins.\
\
'Oh yes, this is very illegal. Very illegal, indeed. Thanks to you, we might finally be able to jail these smugglers!'","The smugglers in Esgaroth-of-old have been mixing in marked crates with shipments headed down the Lake. Mervárth has asked you to collect them as evidence of their foul deeds."},
[8347]={"'I will get to fixing the walls when I can. For now, make my life a little easier and leave me a little symbol or scratch mark near the battlements that require the most repair. TBD Location has the worst of it, but I never did find time to properly label the damage.'","The walls in TBD Location need to be marked for repair, to the TBD direction.\
\
TBD Carpenter has asked for your help again, this time in marking the damaged parts of the battlements so he can repair them later.","TBD Mark weak points in the walls","'You have labelled that many, eh? Well, it is not near so many as I had feared, but certainly more than I had hoped. I suppose I should thank you for this. I may be busy, but someone like you, well.... You are doubtless occupied with your tasks, too. Thank you for helping make this ragged city safer.'","Return to TBD Carpenter","'You show up just when I needed you. That puts you head and shoulders above the rest of my old crew. You had such a good hand for carpentry that I know you shall take to this task just as well. I'm up to my ears in building reinforcements, and I do not have time to hunt down the holes and damage in the walls myself.\
\
'I do know the walls in TBD Location are faring the worst. As you run your errands and such, mark any flaw in the city walls, and I shall return when I have half a moment to repair them.'","Mark weaknesses in Jirush's walls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Marked for Later","TBD Carpenter can be found in TBD.\
\
You have left marks on the most decrepit parts of Jirush's battlements for the TBD Carpenter to repair later. Return to him with updates so he can begin his work soon.","Severe damage riddles this part of the wall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8348]={"'Three? You don't seem very skilled in negotiation friend. You are supposed to get closer to the number I suggest, not farther away.\
\
'I suppose I could accept a paltry ten oranges in exchange for the book.'","'All right, all right. You'd see me driven from hearth and home, and leave me destitute with no oranges, but I will accept your terms. Seven oranges in exchange for the book.\
\
'Now go, bring me the oranges before I change my mind.'","'There is a particular book that mentioned the Pale Blight, called \\qNisigím, the Emerald Wood\\q. It is an account of a group of Pohâni who travelled amongst the Kintai and wrote down their tales and legends.\
\
'I don't believe the Kalmakhíla has a copy. You should head to the Court of Larinâsta here in Zajâna. There is a book-seller I know there, Merbâna. Here is some coin. I believe she has a copy of the book. Bring it here and I will find the relevant passage for you.'","'Saráz záro-dan, friend. Yes, I have that book. I don't want coin for it, however. I have a powerful desire for oranges. They grow freely on the hillsides outside Zajâna, beyond the Khab Kitâx, this time of year. Yes, I believe I will accept oranges in exchange for the tome.\
\
'How many oranges are you willing to get for me?'","Go to the hillside outside the Khab Kitâx outside Zajâna where the orange trees grow and gather seven oranges for Merbâna.","Return to Khâbakh in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna with the book he requested. The Kalmakhíla can be found near the Shorakhúna in central Zajâna.","Haggle with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta","'Five? That is far too few oranges. Do you consider me a fool? There are no fools in the Larinâsta.\
\
'I will exchange the book for no fewer than twenty oranges.'","Haggle with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for the book Khâbakh requested.","Finish haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for Khâbakh's book.","'These oranges are perfect. I would have taken five, but seven is even better.\
\
'Here is the book you requested. Give Khâbakh my regards.'","Finish haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta","Market Rates","'Ah yes. This is the book I needed. Let me see, yes, this is the relevant passage for you.\
\
'You were asking about the Pale Blight, yes? Here it is. Travelling scholars mention a legend among the Kintai that may be relevant. They speak of Sívigush the Earth Terror, a great beast of unimaginable size and ferocity. These accounts say that Sívigush carried within it a great plague, that corrupted all it touched, turning the forests pale and dead wherever it strode.\
\
'These accounts attribute this Pale Blight to Sívigush, and claim it emanated from a place in Adagím once said to be Sívigush's abode. This site was later settled by a group of Men who excavated the area. It is known amongst the Elves as Nagakhêdi's Folly. Apparently the Men who were excavating the site were building a grand abode for their king, Nagakhêdi. Reports disagree here on the details, but each claim that the workers perished to a man within the cursed tunnels.\
\
'This is all rumour and happenstance. But if you are indeed searching for the source of this Pale Blight, you might explore Nagakhêdi's Folly in Adagim. Then tell me what you find. I would love to publish something new about Adagím - as long as I don't have to go there myself. Dreadful place.'","Speak with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about buying the book Khâbakh requested. The Court of Larinâsta is located due east of the Kalmakhíla, whilst still in Zajâna.","Continue haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for Khâbakh's book.","In order to get the book Khâbakh needs, you will need to haggle with the local book-seller in the Court of Larinâsta.","Return to Khâbakh in the Kalmakhíla with the book","Harvest oranges outside Zajâna (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Harvested oranges outside Zajâna (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Merbâna in Larinâsta in Zajâna with the oranges","Return to Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna with the harvested oranges.","Continue haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta","Speak with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta"},
[8349]={"'Did I not say I was a dwarf of my word?\
\
'I knew very little of the plans of the Keeper of the Coffers, but I knew enough. He made for the Steel Keep of old... Thikil-gundu as it was once named in the tongue of the dwarves.\
\
'I could not follow him as he wished, but I offered to keep his home in order until his return. I have borne Nori's secret faithfully, but I do not wish to lose the favour of the King under the Mountain.\
\
'Here, take this key. Perhaps Nori left behind some clue for his brother to find....'","'You have the spare key, yes?\
\
'Let us see what my brother left behind, ${PLAYER}. I hope it is of some use to us....'","Dori can be found before the throne of King Thorin III in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has granted Dori leave to pursue Nori into the Ered Mithrin, but Dori must now meet his terms. You should speak to Dori.","Unlock the door to Nori's home and begin your search with Dori","Talk to Dori before the throne of King Thorin III","Talk to King Thorin III","'You have my truest gratitude, King under the Mountain. I will do as you have commanded.'\
\
Dori turns to you.\
\
'What do you say, ${PLAYER}? Let us begin our preparations!'","Talk to Dori in the Hall Under the Mountain","'At least Débel did not allow my brother's home to fall into disrepair....'\
\
Dori glances around Nori's home and pauses upon a stack of papers piled on the dining table.\
\
'I think my brother left more hastily than he expected to, ${PLAYER}. Look!\
\
'There are papers piled upon the table, and I see other curiosities left about that I would like to examine. Take a look at those papers and see if my brother has left any hint of his course or the names of other dwarves that we might question.\
\
'Once you have done that, let us meet back here.'","'My brother believes that because the great cold-drake was defeated that our old hoards lay unguarded? By dragons, perhaps, but the Orcs will not have abandoned them.\
\
'As the King under the Mountain said, Thikil-gundu is best forgotten. The Longbeards have found only misfortune and death in the Steel Keep. If I do not aid my brother, this expedition will be his doom.\
\
'We are forbidden from travelling to Thikil-gundu, but perhaps King Thorin will be merciful upon my family and allow me to pursue him into the Ered Mithrin. It is the only course!\
\
'Come, we must go at once!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: When you continue this quest, you will swiftly travel to the Hall under the Mountain.</rgb>","Dori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have examined many notes in Nori's home and they bear marks of a conspiracy to defy the King under the Mountain and seek the hoards of Thikil-gundu. You should inform Dori.","The earth shakes as a deep-claw bursts forth!","Nori's home can be found in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have arrived at Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm and should now use the spare key to gain entry.","Meet Dori at Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls","Thikil-gundu was lost, Nori thought, but it was not the way of dragons to abandon their hoards...","Nori's home can be found in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
After learning that Nori left behind a spare key, Dori has asked you to meet him at Nori's home in Erebor.","After clearing the dust away, Nori drew forth his armour of old. The time had come!","'I do not appreciate your gaze. What business have you in the New-lodes?'\
\
You explain to the dwarf that he matches the description of a dwarf Dori believed to be in league with Nori's secret expedition. The dwarf lets out a long sigh.\
\
'Very well... I am Débel. I am not so deeply involved as you might believe, but yes, I know of these things. I suppose the truth would come out sooner or later, but I had hoped it would be after Nori returned to Erebor.\
\
'I cannot give such information freely, but I can offer it for a trifle. If you were to clear out some of the deep-claws that have burrowed into the New-lodes, I give my word that I will share all I know of Nori and his expedition.\
\
'What do you say?'","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
Dori has begged King Thorin III to grant him leave to pursue his brother into the Ered Mithrin. You should now speak to King Thorin III.","After countless hours of study, Nori learned that the hoarding-vault laid 'beneath the eyes of the Seven'...","'I do not understand, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'What has compelled my brother to act so foolishly? He has lived a life of wealth in Erebor! He is the Keeper of the Coffers! Or he was....\
\
'Bah! I should have confronted him. I saw dwarves speaking with him in hushed tones, but I thought nothing of it. Nori is a dwarf of some repute, after all.\
\
'If only I knew the names of those dwarves, but... wait. I do recall one of them. This dwarf seemed to be of a line descended from both the Longbeards and the Zhélruka of the East. He was thin in the beard, but any dwarf would be proud to have such a moustache.\
\
'He is a miner, I think. Search for him in the New-lodes of Narathâk, and perhaps he will be better able to explain why my brother has left for Thikil-gundu.'","Talk to Débel in the New-lodes of Narathâk","Débel can be found among the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
You have defeated many of the encroaching deep-claws in the New-lodes of Narathâk and should now return to Débel.","Notes can be found throughout Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
After noticing a number of scattered notes, Dori has asked you to begin your search of his brother's home by examining what Nori left behind.","Dori seems fixated upon the King under the Mountain and barely seems to notice your approach.\
\
'King Thorin III Stonehelm, King under the Mountain, I beg leave to travel into the Ered Mithrin. You have forbidden Durin's Folk to return to the Steel Keep, Thikil-gundu, but that is not my purpose. I go in search of my brother, Nori!\
\
'I am a loyal dwarf of Erebor. I have fought and bled in its defence... from the Easterlings... from Bolg! All I ask is the chance to save Nori from his folly!\
\
'Will you grant me leave, King under the Mountain?'","After Vethúg's defeat at the gates of Erebor, Nori enlisted his kinsfolk to follow him to Thikil-gundu...","Dori can be found among the upper levels of the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
You have obtained a spare key to Nori's home in Erebor, and you should now return to Dori and tell him what you have learned.","Dori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have gained entry to Nori's home and should now speak to Dori.","Dori can be found before the throne of King Thorin III in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
Dori intends to beg King Thorin III to allow him to seek his brother, Nori, in the Ered Mithrin. You should meet Dori before the throne of King Thorin III.","Talk to Dori in Nori's home","'I hear your words, Dori of the Company.\
\
'Your deeds and those of your kin are not forgotten to any who dwell in Erebor, but Nori has acted in defiance of my edict. Whether his expedition is successful or not, there will be consequences for him.\
\
'I know well that your brother, Ori, was among those lost in Balin's expedition, and I know as well as you do that this bears a resemblance to our efforts to reclaim Khazad-dûm. Both Balin's expedition and the Iron Garrison have failed, and if future losses may still be prevented, they must be. And so, Dori, I grant you leave to follow your brother and put an end to his expedition.\
\
'You will travel on my behalf, but you will go in secret as your brother did. You may form a company of your own choosing, but do not spread word of this to any untrustworthy ears. In addition, I ask that you find the remains of Vethúg Wintermind. He flew from battle gravely wounded and passed into the Ered Mithrin, but I desire proof of his death.\
\
'Heed my words. Deliver Nori from his folly and retrieve for me a bone of Vethúg Wintermind. Only then will we speak of forgiveness....'","Talk to the dwarf in the New-lodes of Narathâk","Talk to Dori","After Nori secretly departed Erebor for the Ered Mithrin, Dori hopes to learn why his brother deceived both him and the King under the Mountain.","You spot a dwarf matching Dori's description...","Deep-claws have burrowed into the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
In exchange for aiding him in repelling the deep-claws of Erebor, Débel has offered to share what he knows of Nori's secret expedition to Thikil-gundu.","Dori shifts uncomfortably outside Nori's home...","Defeated deep-claws in the New-lodes of Narathâk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thikil-gundu had once possessed great wealth, Nori thought, and now it sat unguarded and unclaimed...","The strange dwarf can be found among the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
You have found a dwarf matching Dori's description and should now speak to him.","Defeat deep-claws in the New-lodes of Narathâk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dori looks around the empty home of his brother...","Examine notes left behind by Nori (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Marks of a Conspiracy","Find a dwarf matching Dori's description in the New-lodes of Narathâk","The New-lodes of Narathâk can be found in the entry hall of Erebor.\
\
Believing him to be in league with Nori, Dori has asked you to find a dwarf of uncommon lineage in the New-lodes of Narathâk.","'You found the dwarf, did you? Very good! What did he have to say of my brother?'\
\
You explain to Dori that Débel did not offer much in the way of new information, but he did offer up the key to Nori's home.\
\
'A key? My brother entrusted his key to this Débel before me? We shall have much to discuss when next I see him!\
\
'My brother was not one to leave things unorganised... he is the Keeper of the Coffers after all! However, if Nori has travelled to Thikil-gundu, I must know his course through the Ered Mithrin. They are unfriendly lands, now home only to Orcs and dragons.\
\
'It is to Tumnu-dûm we must go. Those are the dwelling-halls of Erebor, and it is there Nori makes his home.\
\
'I will await you outside his home. After all, you have the key!'"},
[8351]={"Some disturbance has wakened many of the dead within the marshes. These spirits will work no good in the world while they prowl.\
\
You should defeat a number of fell spirits in the Dead Marshes.","Defeated a spirit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Marsh Spirits","You have defeated a number of spirits in the Dead Marshes.","Some spirits, roused by intruders, prowl the Marshes restlessly.","Completado","Some disturbance has wakened many of the dead spirits within the marshes. They should really be returned to rest.\
\
Defeat a good number of fell spirits in the Dead Marshes.","Defeat spirits in the Dead Marshes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8352]={"'Ah! Marsh reeds. Thank you -- these are the horses' favourite food. Supposedly it tastes sweet to them; I have tried it, and I can assure you it does not taste sweet to me. Ah, well.'","Bring the marsh reeds to Céolstan at the Harwick Stables","Collect marsh reeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Marsh reeds tend to grow along the edges of standing water, and prefer the rich soil near bogs.\
\
You should collect marsh reeds, the favourite food of Harwick's horses.","Marsh-reeds","Great steeds are the pride of Harwick, and these horses feed on only the finest of hay, grasses, and reeds.","The guard of the stables waits for you to return.","Collected marsh reeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8356]={"You have defeated a number of the Orkish invaders of Marton, but their numbers seem endless. This town is no longer safe, but you hope that you have avenged the farmers who were forced from their homes.","Orcs can be found in the Westfold town of Marton.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in Marton.","The Westfold town of Marton is now utterly occupied by violent Orc-invaders that streamed down from Isengard through the undefended gap.","Marton: Fallen to Orcs","Completado","Defeated an Orc-invader (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Orcs in Marton (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","It is clear that the town of Marton has fallen to Orcs of late."},
[8358]={"It is possible that some people did not escape Marton after the recent Orc assault, and might need rescue.\
\
You should search for hidden places where townsfolk might be trapped.","Townsfolk can perhaps be found in hidden spots throughout Marton in the northern Westfold.\
\
You should search the town for any hiding or trapped survivors.","'Thank you for coming! I could not get out. I had hoped our Thane would set these Orcs straight, but the enemy is many, and our warriors are still at the Fords of Isen.\
\
'It grieves me that Gladsúnu will come back to this! Would that we could have saved Marton.'","You have rescued a trapped farmer (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","It is possible that some people did not escape Marton after the recent Orc assault, and might need rescue.","Marton: Hindered Escape","You have rescued some straggling townsfolk. If anything good can be said of the state of Marton, it is that the townspeople seem to have escaped with their lives.\
\
This is more than can be said of other towns you've encountered.","Completado","Search Marton for survivors","'I was asleep when the attack happened, and now I am trapped! That is, until you came to rescue me. Are we taking back the town now?'\
\
You inform the man that the town is not safe, and that there are no Rohirrim soldiers in sight. He looks crestfallen.\
\
'I will flee, then. I cannot believe I must leave my home!'","'Thane Gladsúnu, you have come for me at last!\
\
'You -- you are not Gladsúnu! Did he send you? Where are the others? Are they safe?'\
\
You have not the time or the knowledge to satisfy all of this farmer's questions, but you urge her to run quickly to a safe place, away from this dangerous town.\
\
'Right you are, stranger! Thank you for helping me.'","Help trapped townsfolk (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'You are not an Orc! Nor are you my Thane, who fought at the Fords and has not been heard from. Does this mean that Gladsúnu is dead, and cannot take back our town? I was waiting for him.'\
\
You tell the farmer that it would be wise to flee, for the town is certainly far from secure.\
\
'Thank you -- I will do so. There is a cave of sorts to the north where we go in case of danger.'"},
[8359]={"Rípmaush has staked the heads of many Rohirrim victims in Marton's Mead Hall, defiling the corpses and the seat of the Thane.\
\
Such desecrations should not be allowed to stand and rot. You should burn the hideous stakes to undo the hideous work of Rípmaush.","Burn a severed head (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Burn the severed heads (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Severed heads can be found in the Mead Hall of Marton.\
\
You should burn the severed heads on stakes.","Rípmaush has staked the heads of many Rohirrim victims in Marton's Mead Hall, defiling the corpses and the seat of the Thane.","Marton: Remnants of a Massacre","You have burned the desecrated heads on stakes in Marton's Mead Hall.\
\
Such a wrong cannot be righted, but destroying the Orc's hideous work is better than letting it stand.","Completado","You have burned the desecrated heads on stakes in Marton's Mead Hall."},
[8362]={"Máscaras burdas han sido colgadas en Mudmul-charâf como burla a las estatuas de los enanos, mostrando sus horribles bocas en una cruel risa orca.","Destruye las máscaras burdas","Completado","Has destruido una máscara burda (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Máscaras de fauces abiertas","Las máscaras burdas talladas y colgadas por el enemigo pueden encontrarse en Mudmul-charâf, en las salas del noroeste de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las máscaras burdas, pues se burlan de las magníficas estatuas hechas por los enanos de antaño.","Has destruido las máscaras crueles que los orcos y trasgos colgaron en Mudmul-charâf.","Destruye máscaras burdas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8363]={"'Hail, ${PLAYER}, slayer of the Castellan of Barad Gúlaran. What need have you this day?'","Gath Forthnír is north-west from Barad Gúlaran.\
\
You entered Barad Gúlaran and after some time found and defeated the Castellan within his chambers. You should now return to Gath Forthnír, the hidden refuge in the north-east area of Angmar, and inform Uidon that you have defeated Castellan Wisdán.","'We face many fell foes in this dark place. Though the strength of the Enemy is weakened, so, too, is it strengthened by the discovery of this great ruse. Now, we learn that the dark tower standing amidst the forces within the forsaken valley to our south teems with enemies long kindling flames from a place I shall not speak of.\
\
'It falls to you, ${PLAYER}, to gather your allies and make an assault on Barad Gúlaran, to stand against the horrors awakened within that dark citadel. One horror, Wisdán, once a man in service to Angmar, sacrificed his life to watch over Barad Gúlaran. Lore-masters dispatched from Esteldín brought us all we know of him and Barad Gúlaran. Little is known beyond his service to the Witch-king and his close ties with the Shadow in the North. It is possible that he is a sorcerer, like a few others within Barad Gúlaran.\
\
'He must be slain, ${PLAYER}, lest his darkness be used to spread evil towards the south to become the bane of all. Gather your allies together and enter Barad Gúlaran. Return to me when you have done the deed, and I will see that the Council's gifts are bestowed upon you.'","Long ago, a servant pledged himself to the Witch-king's cause. His service lasts to this day, and his dark embrace on Barad Gúlaran brings terror into the hearts of those fighting to unseat Shadow in the North.","'Do not tarry, ${PLAYER}. Though the citadel of Barad Gúlaran has long lain in slumber, recent events will surely set the inhabitants within to their task. We must disrupt their intentions swiftly.'","Barad Gúlaran rises out of the centre of Nan Gurth, south and east of Gath Forthnír.\
\
Uidon directed you to enter Barad Gúlaran in search of Castellan Wisdán. You are to slay him and return to Uidon for your reward.","'A sign of hope in these dark times, ${PLAYER}. This news will hearten Halbarad and those who worry of our tenuous position here. You have earned a great deal of our respect and this reward.\
\
'Take it and know that we are honoured by all you do to keep Evil from spreading to the south. We must endeavour onward.'","Master of Barad Gúlaran"},
[8364]={"Señor de las llamas","'Prepárate para enfrentarte a un enemigo que se mueve como en casa entre las llamas. Busca a Gothghaash dentro de la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.'","'Con el líder de la tribu eliminado, deberíamos ser capaces de contener el poder de los Ghâsh-hai. Esta es una muy buena noticia, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Recuperaremos la Gran Escalera en poco tiempo.'","Derrota a Gothghaash el Invocallamas","'Aunque los Ghâsh-hai han demostrado ser enemigos formidables, también tienen líderes, y el suyo se internó en la Gran Escalera hace algún tiempo.\
\
'Los Ghâsh-hai tienden a reunirse cerca del fuego. Cuando te dirijas a la Gran Escalera, busca una fuente de llama, pues allí encontrarás a su líder, Gothghaash.\
\
'Encuéntralo y destrúyelo, para que podamos expulsar con mayor facilidad a los enemigos de la Gran Escalera. Avanza hacia el noreste desde la Guardia Orca para hallar la entrada a la Gran Escalera.'","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur, en la Guardia Orca, y contarle tu victoria sobre Gothghaash.","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","En lo más profundo de las salas de Moria, las llamas brotan de charcos aceitosos. Aquí es donde los Ghâsh-hai tienen su hogar. Una de sus facciones está aliada con Mazog, el señor de Moria, y ha acudido a la Gran Escalera para pagar tributo a su líder.","Gothghaash puede encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te habló de Gothghaash, el líder de los orcos de fuego, y te indicó que lo encontraras y lo derrotaras.","Gothghaash el Invocallamas derrotado"},
[8365]={"Derrota a Khurrákh","'¡Solo el más grande de los héroes podría haber derrotado al Maestro de Maethad!'","Maethad está al norte y al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Hwati te ha indicado que entres al centro de Maethad y uses el Ushum-ghâsh para hacer que Khurrákh se presente.","Hwati está de regreso en Gabilshathûr, al oeste y al sur de Maethad.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a Khurrákh, deberías regresar con Hwati y contarle la historia de tus hazañas.","Habla a Hwati","'Ve ahora a Maethad, al norte y al este de aquí, y haz que Khurrákh se presente. ¡Acaba con la amenaza de Maethad de una vez por todas!'","'¿Dónde está la maza de Ronkûrz?'","Khurrákh derrotado","Hwati te ha dicho que ahora que tienes la maza de Ronkûrz, puedes hacer que Khurrákh, el Maestro de Maethad, se presente y desafiarlo.","Maestro de Maethad","'Ahora estamos listos para golpear el corazón mismo de Maethad, su maestro: Khurrákh. Es un Gorthorog grande y terrible, que ha matado a muchos para alcanzar y mantener su posición. Derrotarlo no será fácil, pero debe hacerse si queremos acabar con la amenaza de Maethad.\
\
'Toma la maza de Ronkûrz y entra al centro de Maethad. Según lo que nos han contado, deberías encontrar algo que los Gertheryg llaman \\qUshum-ghâsh\\q en el centro de Maethad. Una vez allí, muestra la maza de Ronkûrz cerca del fuego. Khurrákh no tendrá más opción que enfrentarte. Su sentido del “honor”, si es que tal concepto existe en un Gorthorog, lo obligará a luchar contigo.\
\
'No será una pelea fácil, pero debe hacerse.'","Haz que Khurrákh se presente y derrótalo","'¿Está hecho? ¿Khurrákh está muerto? ¡No puedo creerlo! ¡El maestro de Maethad ha muerto!\
\
'Aunque algún día seguramente habrá otro Maestro de Maethad, por ahora has sumido a Maethad en el caos.\
\
'Sin embargo, aún queda trabajo por hacer, más al norte...'"},
[8366]={"Recoge la armadura del general uruk","Derrota a Zaukîl y recoge su armadura","Armadura del general uruk recogida","Maestro de la Marea Negra","El general uruk Zaukîl se encuentra en la cima de una colina, en el corazón del campamento orco de Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes derrotar a Zaukîl, el general uruk de Dol Dínen, y traer su armadura como prueba de tu hazaña.","Lleva la armadura a Elúr","El general uruk Zaukîl se encuentra en la cima de una colina, en el corazón del campamento orco en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.","'¡Este es un gran trofeo, ${PLAYER}! Me alegra que Zaukîl ya no recorra la tierra.'"},
[8367]={"'Las cosas sin nombre que habitan en ese lugar no rehuirán el resplandor de tu corazón. De hecho, creo que la oscuridad las fortalecerá. Aunque esto es cierto, es posible que pierdan su fuerza en la luz, así que sé prudente al acercarte.\
\
'Busca el origen del mal en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y vuelve a mí una vez que hayas acabado con él.'","'Un mal semejante no puede andar suelto por el mundo. Has hecho bien en regresarlo de vuelta a la oscuridad, aunque no creo que un mal así de grande pueda ser eliminado tan fácilmente. \
\
'Guardo en mi corazón la esperanza de que haya desaparecido y sé que no me mientes. El Gurvand ha sido derrotado, al menos por ahora, por lo que informaré a Gelirwen de tu hazaña.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}.'","Glorelloth se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.\
\
Tras atravesar las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, encontraste allí el origen del mal: una criatura ancestral llamada Gurvand. Luego de una dura pelea, acabaste con la criatura, y ahora debes regresar con Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío.","Habla con Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío","'Gelirwen me pidió que averiguara qué clase de demonio habita en las profundidades de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, pero aún no he logrado comprender el verdadero horror que se esconde en ese lugar. Sé que allí hay un gran mal, una cosa sin nombre a la que no le afecta el poder de la luz. La luz es rechazada por la fuerza de su corrupción. Solo sé que hay algo allí que es malvado más allá de mi comprensión.\
\
'Así que te advierto, ${RACE}, que cuando entres en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas debes estar preparado para algo tan antiguo como los Elfos, salvaje y terrible.\
\
'Descubre qué mal habita allí y regresa a mí en el Refugio Sombrío.'","Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se encuentran muy al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Glorelloth te advirtió que en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas existe un mal que no teme a la luz. Te aconsejó que anduvieras con cuidado en aquel lugar, situado muy al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.","En las profundidades más oscuras de Moria, hay un lugar donde la única luz que brillaba provenía de las lámparas de enanos y hongos luminiscentes. Ahora estos túneles son más tenues que nunca y hogar de criaturas que existen solo en pesadillas. Sin embargo, ahí están, y los agentes de Veúlfur enviados al Refugio Sombrío encuentran poco consuelo al saber que hay algo en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas que ordena a los orcos a envenenarse de una manera que los entrega a una voluntad superior.","El amo de la oscuridad","Derrota el Mal en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas","Has derrotado al Gurvand"},
[8370]={"'Podemos aún asestar un golpe a los orcos que ayudará no solo a los Eglain, sino a todo Eriador. Por favor, cumple la misión que te he encomendado y derrota al líder de los orcos en Ost Cyrn. También debes asegurarte de que se queden sin tantas armas como sea posible.'","Lleva las espadas a Grimdeal, en Ost Guruth","El líder de los orcos y sus armas pueden encontrarse en algún lugar dentro de las ruinas de Ost Cyrn, al suroeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Grimdeal cree que si logras matar al líder de los orcos y robar sus armas, podrían colapsar sobre sí mismos y las Tierras Solitarias se librarían de su amenaza.","'Eres una persona fuerte que inspira y devuelve la esperanza a quienes no la tienen. Has demostrado esto una y otra vez.\
\
'Ahora te pido que vuelvas a atacar Ost Cyrn y les arranques el corazón. Dentro de las murallas de las ruinas hay un maestro de esclavos que impulsa a los orcos con miedo y fuerza de armas. Su maldad no conoce límites y su reinado es inquebrantable. Sin embargo, hemos aprendido que su fuerza es limitada en armas, y si podemos derrotar al maestro de esclavos y robar suficientes armas a los orcos, podrían colapsar sobre sí mismos.\
\
'Ve a Ost Cyrn y recoge armas de los orcos a los que te enfrentes. Si encuentras a su líder, mátalo.'","'Vamos a ver si los orcos son capaces de reagruparse bajo el mando de otro líder, o si se dispersan, como esperamos. En cualquier caso, ha sido una gran victoria.\
\
'Tus hazañas serán contadas entre los Eglain y todos llegarán a conocerte. Te ofrezco mi gratitud y la de mi pueblo.\
\
'Deseamos honrar todo lo que has hecho por nosotros, ${PLAYER}. Como no tenemos mucho que ofrecerte, espero que esto sea suficiente.'","Orcos que portan la bandera de Angmar se han derramado en las Tierras Solitarias desde el norte y han ocupado Ost Cyrn, unas ruinas situadas al suroeste de Ost Guruth.","Grimdeal espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al noreste de Ost Cyrn.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Grimdeal sin demora para llevarle las espadas de orco que has recogido como prueba de tu victoria.","'Te agradecemos tu ayuda contra los orcos.'","El maestro del látigo","'Podemos aún asestar un golpe a los orcos que ayudará no solo a los Eglain, sino a todo Eriador. Por favor, cumple la misión que te he encomendado y derrota al líder de los orcos en Ost Cyrn.'"},
[8371]={"Habla con Calenthon","Deberías buscar al demacrado Gúrdring antes de que su poder se vuelva demasiado grande","Calenthon está en Nan Tornaeth, muy al oeste de Ost Brandras.\
\
A Calenthon le alegrará saber que has matado al demacrado Gúrdring.","Gúrdring derrotado","Has encontrado un emblema como el que solo has visto una vez... en Agamaur, en el Señor Demacrado Ivar.","El demacrado Gúrdring probablemente esté acampado en las zonas más profundas de las ruinas de Nan Tornaeth.\
\
Has encontrado el emblema del demacrado Gúrdring y deberías buscar a esa criatura maligna antes de que su poder se vuelva demasiado grande.","Tumularios derrotados en Nan Tornaeth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Gúrdring","'¿Un demacrado, dices? Es bueno que Gúrdring haya sido derrotado y que los tumularios que comandaba hayan sido rechazados. Un mal así podría haber representado una verdadera amenaza para Rivendel.\
\
'Tienes mi agradecimiento, ${PLAYER}.'","Derrota tumularios en Nan Tornaeth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Señor de los Alzados"},
[8372]={"Destroyed weapon-racks in the Oath-taker's Horn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Doused forges in the Oath-taker's Horn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Firehorn smiths in the Oath-taker's Horn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Douse forges in the Oath-taker's Horn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Firehorns loyal to King Greytooth must be deprived of their forges if his quest to seize the dwarf-rings is to be brought to an end.","You have destroyed many of the forges, tools, and weapons vital to King Greytooth and the Firehorns' quest to seek the dwarf-rings.\
\
It is possible the Firehorns still possess a great deal of armour and weapons in their stores, but for the moment, you have stopped them from forging new equipment.\
\
Gimli and Spakorth will be pleased.","Firehorn smiths and their equipment can be found around the forges in the depths of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Gimli has asked you to hinder the Firehorns' efforts to amass armour and weapons for the quest to seek the dwarf-rings.","Destroy weapon-racks in the Oath-taker's Horn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","'Ah-ha! The Firehorns may have sealed the hidden gate, but they have left their greatest weakness exposed!\
\
'Don't you see, ${PLAYER}? The lower gate is now the only passage into and out of the Spire, and it leads to the very heart of their forges!\
\
'Ruin their forges and break their weapons, and I dare say their search will be over before it begins! If the Firehorns discover you, do what you must. When the Dourhands treated my folk as the Firehorns treat the Stout-axes now, I did not shy from battle.\
\
'While you deal with that, I'll escort Spakorth into the Spire. He has a mind to speak with King Greytooth, but I do not think it wise. Ah well, I have my axe if talking won't do!'","Defeated Firehorn smiths in the Oath-taker's Horn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have done much to hinder King Greytooth and the Firehorns in their efforts to prepare for the search for the dwarf-rings.","Mastering the Forges"},
[8373]={"'After I sent you on your patrol, I sent several other Rangers to track our foes in the further reaches of Ithilien. \
\
'Many of them went to the north, a few to the west, and a few to the east. The border of Dagorlad has always been contested, but our foes have been emboldened by their Master's rage and pour across it in greater numbers than we have previously weathered.\
\
'It has been some time, and I would hope that my scouts have all returned by now. I would ask that you gather their reports and deliver them to me.\
\
'Search for my scouts in Henneth Annûn and hear what they have learned of our foes.'","Talk to Mablung","Gathered reports from Rangers of Ithilien in Henneth Annûn (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Mablung can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have heard the reports of his Rangers and should now deliver them to Mablung.","Henneth Annûn can be found in north-central North Ithilien.\
\
Mablung has asked you to hear the reports of recently-returned Rangers to help guide his plans to defend Ithilien.","The Rangers know much of the lands and history of Ithilien and have dedicated themselves to its protection even in times of war.","'These reports are troubling, and much will need to be done to ensure our foes cannot gain more of a hold in Ithilien.\
\
'The Khundolar are a terrible foe... for they are unlikely to surrender in direct combat. If we are to rout their forces in Ithilien, it must be through total defeat. \
\
'The Orcs of Mordor are more easily spooked, but their numbers are endless and the Dark Lord drives them further into Ithilien each day.\
\
'To be free of even one of our foes would be a great boon to our cause!'","Mastering the Wilds","Gather reports from Rangers of Ithilien in Henneth Annûn (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[8374]={"Derrota a los maestros de asedio de Moria (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Si las máquinas de asedio no tienen maestros, no representan una amenaza.'","Habla con Dagfari en Mekhem-bizru","Dagfari se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Drû-garmadh.\
\
Dagfari querrá saber sobre la derrota de los maestros de asedio.","'Los maestros de asedio han caído, y por lo tanto sus armas están inactivas. Tenemos poco que temer de Drû-garmadh, pero aún queda un último golpe por dar.'","Maestros de la guerra","Ahora que no hay más materiales de construcción, los enanos quieren eliminar a los orcos que operan las máquinas de asedio.","'Los orcos ya no tienen los materiales para construir más máquinas de asedio, lo que es un fuerte golpe contra su capacidad de continuar la guerra; sin embargo, aún no hemos reducido su capacidad existente.\
\
'Nuestro próximo golpe debe centrarse en asegurarnos de que las armas que tienen sean inútiles. Regresa al sureste, de nuevo a Drû-garmadh, y derrota a los maestros de asedio de Moria. Sin ellos, las máquinas de asedio no son más que montones de madera.'","Maestros de asedio de Moria derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los maestros de asedio de Moria se encuentran en Drû-garmadh, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Dagfari quiere eliminar a los maestros de asedio de Moria que operan las grandes máquinas de asedio."},
[8375]={"Derrota trolls en Dol Dínen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota trolls en Dol Dínen","Una gran hueste de orcos se derramó por el Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas, trayendo consigo poderosos trolls Ongbúrz.","Los trolls se pueden encontrar más allá de las trincheras de Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín, bajo la cubierta del humo.\
\
Debes derrotar a los trolls Ongbúrz de Dol Dínen.","Maestros del Asedio Negro","Has derrotado trolls en Dol Dínen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Una gran hueste de orcos se derramó por el Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas, trayendo consigo poderosos trolls Ongbúrz.\
\
Debes derrotar trolls Ongbúrz en Dol Dínen.","Has derrotado a un gran número de trolls en Dol Dínen."},
[8376]={"Has derrotado a Mordeloth","Ivorel se encuentra en su campamento en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Deberías informar a Ivorel de la destrucción de los maestros demacrados.","Has derrotado a Thorún","Tres hombres demacrados, llamados maestros demacrados, han estado creando un ejército de espectros para usarlo contra los Malledhrim.","Maestros de los Muertos","Los maestros demacrados pueden encontrarse en las regiones orientales de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Ivorel te ha encargado destruir a los tres maestros demacrados que están levantando a los Muertos de sus túmulos.","'¡Excelente! Con esos monstruos fuera de juego, los hechizos que han lanzado sobre los túmulos empezarán a deshacerse.\
\
Si los propios túmulos son sellados, la mayor parte del peligro quedará contenida.'","'El vil arte de alzar espectros es una hechicería de un mal sin igual. ¡Que criaturas como los hombres demacrados puedan invocar a sus hermanos espirituales desde más allá del Vacío para profanar los cuerpos de los Hombres es inconcebible!'","Has derrotado a Brungúr","'Los Hombres del Este traídos para construir Dol Guldur fueron sometidos a un duro trabajo por sus amos, pero sin saberlo, sus lugares de descanso final estaban siendo preparados por seres malignos que se convertirían también en sus amos en la muerte, una vez que sus vidas fueran consumidas por sus brutales labores.\
\
En estas runas veo las inscripciones de tres manos funestas... maestros demacrados al servicio de los Nueve, que incluso ahora invocan espíritus siniestros para sacar a los Muertos de sus tumbas y lanzarlos contra nosotros.\
\
Estos tres hechiceros deben ser destruidos antes de que completen sus rituales, o el número de los Muertos aumentará enormemente, y puede que nos veamos en serias dificultades para mantener Ost Galadh frente a ellos.'","Derrota a Mordeloth","Derrota a Brungúr","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","Derrota a Thorún"},
[8378]={"Habla con Nos Grimsong","'Conseguiste los minerales que necesitamos, ${PLAYER}?'","Nos Grimsong está en el Patio de Frerin, al oeste del Abismo de Plata.\
\
Debes regresar con Nos Grimsong por tu recompensa.","Reúne minerales (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Materiales para Nuestras Armas","'Sigue el camino hacia el este desde el Patio de Frerin rodeando el lago hacia el este y hacia el Abismo de Plata. Dentro hay varias vetas de minerales que necesitamos para elaborar nuestras armas. Entra, reúne los minerales y tráeme el mineral.'","Reunió minerales (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ahora que te has ocupado de la fauna local, Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que ayudes a reponer suministros para el Patio de Frerin.","'Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}. Este mineral debería durarnos por un corto tiempo, al menos.\
\
'Toma esta recompensa, junto con mi agradecimiento, por todos tus esfuerzos.'","Los minerales pueden encontrarse en el Abismo de Plata, al este del lago congelado al este del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que reúnas minerales para él.","Habla con Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Ahora que te has ocupado de la fauna local, no supondrás que podrías ayudarnos a reponer nuestros suministros?\
\
'Sigue el camino hacia el este desde el Patio de Frerin rodeando el lago hacia el este y hacia el Abismo de Plata. Dentro hay varias vetas de minerales que necesitamos para elaborar nuestras armas. Entra, reúne los minerales y tráeme el mineral.\
\
'Ten cuidado, pero sé rápido.'"},
[8379]={"Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Garras torcidas","'¿Viste a Lobelia cuando estabas consiguiendo estos? Oh, clemencia, no de los Sacovilla-Bolsón... ¡el sapo! Oh, no te preocupes ahora, me desinvitarán de su fiesta con seguridad si alguien escuchó esa conversación.\
\
'Gracias, amablemente.'","Garras torcidas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las garras torcidas a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Se busca: Garras torcidas de los sapos que rodean los Ranales en la Comarca.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras torcidas para los fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","'He visto a los sapos cerca de los Ranales; cosas perezosas que engordan con mosquitos y moscas guadaña.'","Recoger garras torcidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Hal Corneta quiere garras torcidas. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Se busca: Garras torcidas de los sapos que rodean los Ranales en la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton."},
[8380]={"Se busca: Dagas rotas de los trasgos en las afueras de la Comarca.","Dagas rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hal Corneta quiere dagas rotas. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir dagas rotas para los Fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","'Parece que hay más bandidos y trasgos por ahí tratando de perturbar la Comarca.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Dagas rotas de los trasgos en las afueras de la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Dagas rotas","'Los trasgos y los bandidos nunca han sido mi tipo de gente favorita. Ciertamente no tan amigables como tú.\
\
'Gracias, amablemente.'","Entregar las dagas rotas a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Recoger dagas rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8381]={"Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Arcos cortos rotos","Recolectar arco corto roto (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Arcos cortos rotos recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'La gente está preocupada por la presencia de la Gente Grande y los trasgos tan cerca de la ciudad. ¿Estarías dispuesto a traer pruebas de que pueden ser derrotados aquí?'","'Creo que estos prueban el punto muy bien. Gracias.'","Entregar los arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en Avenal","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recolectar y entregar arcos cortos rotos de los trasgos que rodean Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los trasgos que rodean Avenal.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los trasgos que rodean Avenal. Puede hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal."},
[8382]={"Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Arcos cortos rotos","Arcos cortos rotos recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'La gente grande que echó a los habitantes de Dwaling necesita aprender algunos modales. Tal vez puedas traer alguna prueba de que estás trabajando para ese fin.'","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los bandidos al norte de Avenal. Puede hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal.","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los bandidos al norte de Avenal.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recolectar y entregar arcos cortos rotos de los bandidos al norte de Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","'Me aseguraré de mostrar esto a los demás habitantes del pueblo. Es bueno saber que hay gente dispuesta a ayudar. Gracias.'","Entregar los arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en Avenal","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recolectar arcos cortos rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8383]={"Se busca: Vainas de espada rotas de los bandidos en las afueras de la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton.","Entregar las vainas de espada rotas a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Recoger vainas de espada rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'He oído que hay trasgos al norte de Sobrecolina y bandidos cerca de la Marjala.'","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Vainas de espada rotas","Vainas de espada rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Vainas de espada rotas de los bandidos en las afueras de la Comarca.","Hal Corneta quiere vainas de espada rotas. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada rotas para los Fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Estos son lo suficientemente grandes como para hacer cinturones elegantes para nosotros, los hobbits. Tal vez por eso los Fronteros querían estos.\
\
'Gracias, amablemente.'"},
[8384]={"'Esto es simplemente asqueroso. Nunca pensé que estaría recogiendo pedazos de cosas cuando me apunté para este deber. Mantén la compostura, Hal. Sonríe y agradécele al ${RACE}.\
